  <para style="h">Luku</para>
  <para style="toc1">Anwodelɛnli Luku Edwɛkpa Ne</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luku</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt1">Anwodelɛnli Luku Edwɛkpa Ne</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Agɔnwolɛ kpalɛ mɔɔ kulo Nyamenle a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1-2" />Bɛlua nrɛlaleɛ anzɛɛ edwɛkɛ mɔɔ ɛdoavolɛma mɔɔ lumuale nee Kelaese luale la dele, ɔ nee mɔɔ bɛnwunle ye bɛ nye zo la azo bɛhɛlɛ ɔ nwo edwɛkɛ ngakyile ekyii. <verse eid="LUK 1:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Emomu yezi me nu kɛ, ɔhyia kɛ eza mesia me nzi mebɔ ye ɔ ti meneɛnlea edwɛkɛ ɛhye mɔ anu bieko, na saa mefunvua nu bɔkɔɔ mewie a ɛnee meadu ye kolakola ne meahile bɛ, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />amaa bɛahola bɛanwu nɔhalɛ mɔɔ wɔ ngilehile dɛba ne mɔɔ bɛlumuale bɛhilehilele bɛ la anu.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anwumabɔvolɛ ɛye ɔ nwo ɛhile Zɛkalaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Me adawu ne abobɔlɛ ne fale Dwuunli sɛlɛvolɛ Zɛkalaya, mɔɔ ɛnee de aze wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛnee Hɛlɔdo di belemgbunli wɔ Dwudiya la anwo. Ɛnee Zɛkalaya boka Abaegya ekpunli ne mɔɔ ɛnee yɛ gyima wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu la anwo. Ɔ ye Ɛlezabɛte le kɛ ɔdaye mumua ne la; ɛnee ɔboka Dwuuma azɛlɛvolɛ mɔɔ te bɛ nwo aneɛ na bɛvi Aalɔn abusua eku ne anu la anwo. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Zɛkalaya nee ɔ ye Ɛlezabɛte sulo Nyamenle, bɛnva Nyamenle mɛla ne bɛnli nwɔhoa, na bɛdi zolɛ wɔ sunsum nu ɔ nee nyɛleɛ nu. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Na emomu, ɛnee bɛnlɛ ralɛ biala, ɔluakɛ Ɛlezabɛte yɛle motavolɛ, yɛɛ mekɛ zɔhane noko ɛnee eza bɛ mu nwiɔ bɛyɛ mgbanyinli kpalɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8-9" />Kenle ko bie mɔɔ ɛnee Zɛkalaya ɛlɛyɛ ye gyima wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu, ɔluakɛ ɛnee dapɛne zɔhane le ɔ nee ye ekpunli ne bɛ mekɛ la, ɔrale ye kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ ɔkɔ asɔne sua ne akunlu na ɔkɔsɔ ɛyɛlɛ wɔ Awulae anyunlu. <verse eid="LUK 1:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Mekɛ zɔhane anu, ɛnee menli dɔɔnwo ne ala wɔ Azukponle ne anyunlu wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu kɛmɔ dahuu mekɛ biala bɛsɔ ɛyɛlɛ bɛakpumgbu ye wɔ asɔne sua ne anu a bɛyɛ ye la.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11-12" />Zɛkalaya wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu suakunlu ɛkɛ ne la, arɛlevilɛ nu ala, anwumabɔvolɛ bie vindele ɛkɛ ne, na ɔragyinlanle ɔ sa fema zo wɔ azukponle ne ɛleka ne mɔɔ ɛnee ɛyɛlɛ ne ɛlɛsɔ la! Ɛhye zinle Zɛkalaya anwo na ɔ nwo mɔra dule.<verse eid="LUK 1:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Anwumabɔvolɛ ne zele ye kɛ, “Zɛkalaya, mmasulo! Mera mebaha meahile wɔ kɛ Nyamenle ɛdie wɔ nzɛlɛlɛ ne, na ɛ ye Ɛlezabɛte bawo ralɛ nrenyia! Na ɔwɔ kɛ ɛto ye duma Dwɔn. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Ɛ nee ɛ ye bɛ mu nwiɔ bɛ nye balie kpole kpalɛ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ bɛbawo kakula ne la, na menli somaa ne ala nee bɛ a bali zɔhane fɛlɛko ne a. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Ɔluakɛ ɔbayɛ Awulae menli mgbole ne mɔ anu ko. Ɔnle kɛ ɔno nza menlemenle anzɛɛ nza anu ɛsesebɛ biala, na Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne bayi ye tɛkɛɛ bɔbɔ kolaa na bɛawo ye. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Na eza noko ɔbali Dwuuma somaa ne ala adwenle yeamaa bɛanwu Awulae Nyamenle. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Ɔbayɛ sonla mɔɔ lɛ sunsum mɔɔ anu yɛ ɛsesebɛ nee tumi kɛ Yilaegya, kapezonli ne mɔɔ ɛwu la; na yemɔ yɛɛ ɔbalumua Awulae Maleɛ ne anyunlu a. Ɔbaha mgbanyinli ahonle aze yeamaa bɛayɛ kɛ ngakula ngyikyi ɛdeɛ la, na eza noko yeahakyi anzosesebɛvoma adwenle yeamaa bɛanyia diedi mɔɔ nrɛlɛbɛ wɔ nu a.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zɛkalaya zele anwumabɔvolɛ ne kɛ, “Ɛhye ɛnrɛyɛ nɔhalɛ! Kɛkala meyɛ kpanyinli mebo zo, yɛɛ me ye ɔdaye noko yeyɛ ɛrelera.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Ɛkɛ ne ala, anwumabɔvolɛ ne buale ye zele kɛ, “Bɛfɛlɛ me Geebeleɛle! Megyi Nyamenle agyakɛ anu. Yemɔ yɛɛ ɔvale amaneɛ fɛlɛko ɛhye ɔzoanle me wɔ ɛ nwo ɛke a! <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Ɛhye ati mese wɔ nɔhalɛ nu kɛ, kɛmɔ wɔanlie me wɔanli la ati, ɛbadɔ mumule, ɛnrɛhola tendɛ dedee kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛwo kakula adɔma ne la. Na me edwɛkɛ ne bazi kɛmɔ meha ye ala la.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Ɛnee akee menli ekpunli dɔɔnwo ne ɛhendɛ Zɛkalaya dedee bɛvɛ. Bɛnnwu deɛmɔti yehyɛ zɔhane a. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Nzinlii mɔɔ ɔvindele ɔrale la, ɛnee eza ɔngola tendɛ kile bɛ. Na bɛnwunle kɛ ɔsi ɔyɛ ye nyɛleɛ la, bɛnwunle kɛ yenwu yekile bie wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Ɔdɛnlanle Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu dedee ɔwiele ye mekɛ mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ɔfa ɔyɛ ye gyima ɛdeɛ ne la kolaa na yeahɔ sua nu. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Yeangyɛ biala yɛɛ ɔ ye Ɛlezabɛte nrenzɛle a, na ɔveale ɔ nwo dedee kɛyɛ siane nnu.<verse eid="LUK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Ɛlezabɛte zele kɛ, “Kpalɛ kokye mɔɔ Awulae ɛyɛ ɛmaa me la ɛne. Yeye me motayɛlɛ nwo nyiane ne yevi ɛkɛ bɔkɔɔ!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakula Gyisɛse ɛwɔkɛbɔlɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Wɔ siane ne mɔɔ tia ye nsia ne la anu, Nana Nyamenle eza zoanle anwumabɔvolɛ Geebeleɛle wɔ Nazalɛte, mɔɔ wɔ Galeli la, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />wɔ belamunli bie mɔɔ bɛlɛle ye Male, mɔɔ Dwosefi mɔɔ vi belemgbunli Devidi abusua ne anu la ɛva ɔ nloa ɛdo ɔ nwo zo la ɛkɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Geebeleɛle rayele ɔ nwo hilele ye na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Ahye, Male, ɛlolɛ ɛyi wɔ tɛkɛɛ! Awulae li ɛ nzi; bɛyila wɔ wɔ mraalɛ avinli!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Ɛhye zinle Male anwo totohyia, ɔti ɔbɔle mɔdenle kɛ ɔkpondɛ deɛ ɛhye mɔɔ anwumabɔvolɛ ne ɛrayɛ ɛhile ye la abo, ɔluakɛ ɛzulolɛ kpole hanle ye somaa.<verse eid="LUK 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Na anwumabɔvolɛ ne zele ye kɛ, “Mmasulo, Male, ɔluakɛ Nana Nyamenle ɛyɛ ye adwenle kɛ ɔyila wɔ kpole kpalɛ! <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Ɔnrɛhyɛ biala, ɛbanrenzɛ, na wɔawo ralɛ nrenyia, na ɛbado ye duma ‘Gyisɛse’. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Ɔbayɛ sonlakpole kpalɛ; na bɛbavɛlɛ ye Nana Nyamenle Ara. Na Awulae Nana Nyamenle bava ɔ nlenyia Devidi belemgbunli ebia ne yeamaa ye. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Na yemɔ yɛɛ ɔbali Yizilayɛ anwo zo belemgbunli wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a, na ye belemgbunlililɛ ne ɛnrɛbɔ aze ɛlɛ!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Male bizale anwumabɔvolɛ ne kɛ, “Na kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na meawo ralɛ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ menze nrenyia la ɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Anwumabɔvolɛ ne buale ye zele kɛ, “Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne badwu ɛ nwo zo, na Nana Nyamenle tumi ne baheda ɛ nwo zo; ɔti kakula ne mɔɔ ɛbawo ye la bayɛ nwuanzanwuanza bɔkɔɔ: ɔluakɛ ɔle Nana Nyamenle Ara. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Tie, siane nsia mɔɔ ɛze ɛhɔ la, yɛɛ wɔ busuanli Ɛlezabɛte ‘mɔɔ bɛse ɔle motavolɛ la’ nrenzɛle a. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Ɔluakɛ ɛwɔkɛ biala mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle kɛbɔ la pe zo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Male noko buale ye zele kɛ, “Mele Awulae deɛ, na mɔɔ ɔkɛze me biala la, yemɔ a mebayɛ a. Mesɛlɛ ye kɛ ɔmaa mɔɔ wɔha la amuala ɛyɛ ɛkɛ.” Akee anwumabɔvolɛ ne minlinle ɔ nye zo minlimenla.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39-40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39-40" />Kenle guale nu ekyii la, Male hɔle Zɛkalaya sua zo wɔ Dwudiya kɛ ɔkakpɔla Ɛlezabɛte.<verse eid="LUK 1:39-40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Mɔɔ Ɛlezabɛte dele Male ane wɔ ye ahyebizalɛ ne anu la, kakula ne hehanle ɔ nwo wɔ ɔdaye Ɛlezabɛte ɔ kunlu, na Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne rayile ye tɛkɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Ɔvale fɛlɛkolilɛ kpole ɔdeɛdeanle nu ɔzele kɛ, “Male, Nana Nyamenle ɛyila wɔ ɛdɛla mraalɛ kpokpoti, yɛɛ yeyila ɛ kunlu ralɛ ne noko totohyia. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Duzu anyunlunyia bɔbɔ a le ɛhye, kɛ me Awulae ɔ nli ɔdaye ɔkɛbolo agyakɛ too ɔkɛrakpɔla me a! <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Nea, mekɛ mɔɔ mendele wɔ ahyebizalɛ ne ala la, yɛɛ kakula ne vale fɛlɛko hehanle ɔ nwo wɔ me kunlu a! <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Ɛlielɛ ɛlile kɛ Nana Nyamenle bayɛ mɔɔ ɔhanle ɔhilele wɔ la; na ɛhye ati noko a yeva nyilalɛ bedevinli ɛhye yemaa wɔ la.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Male noko zele kɛ, “Me ɛkɛla ye Awulae ayɛlɛ dahuu; <verse eid="LUK 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />na ɔlua me Nyamenle Ngoanedievolɛ ne noko ati, me sunsum ne noko lɛ anyelielɛ dahuu! <verse eid="LUK 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Ɔluakɛ yeambu ɔ nye yeangua bɛlɛra ekyi mɔɔ le kɛ medame la anwo zo; na kɛkala ɔlua ye ɛlolɛ kpole ye ati, ɛnɛ aleɛ ye abo amra kpokpoti bavɛlɛ me kɛ sonla ne mɔɔ Awulae Nyamenle ɛyila ye la! <verse eid="LUK 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Ɔboalekɛ, yemɔ Nwuanzanwuanza bedevinli Ko ne ɛyɛ ninyɛne mgbole ɛmaa me. <verse eid="LUK 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Ye anwunvɔnezelɛ wɔ ɛkɛ ne dahuu maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdie ye bɛdi na bɛsonle ye la.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />“Duzu tumi kpole a wɔ Nana Nyamenle asa ɛnlomboɛ ne anu a! Mɔɔ ɔkola ɔfa ɔbɔ mgbanyizonleyɛvoma nee anwomemaazovoma ɔkponde a! <verse eid="LUK 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Yedudu arelemgbunli mralɛ yevi bɛ mbia ne mɔ azo, na yekpogya mɛlɛbɛnwoazema zo. <verse eid="LUK 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Yemaa menli mɔɔ ɛlɛdi nyane wɔ bɛ ahonle nu la akunlu ɛdwo bɛ nwo, na akee yevoa anyiabɛnwoma yemaa bɛva bɛ sa mgbane bɛnriandi. <verse eid="LUK 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Yeboa ye sonvolɛ Yizilayɛ! Yɛɛ yeammaa ɔ rɛle anvi ye anwunvɔnezelɛ ɛwɔkɛ ne noko! <verse eid="LUK 1:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Ɔluakɛ ɔbɔle yɛ ze mɔ, Ebileham nee ɔ mra ɛwɔkɛ kɛ, ɔbaze bɛ anwunvɔne wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Male lile kɛyɛ siane nsa wɔ Ɛlezabɛte anwo ɛkɛ kolaa na yeazia yeahɔ ye sua zo.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛwo Dwɔn sɔnevolɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Ɛlezabɛte awolɛ mekɛ ne dwule, na ɔwole ralɛ nrenyia. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Yeangyɛ biala edwɛkɛ ne zandele maanle ye aako nu amra, ɔ gɔnwo mɔ nee ye mbusua dele kɛ Awulae ɛzi ɛlo ye a, na bɛ muala bɛ nee ye lile nwolɛ fɛlɛko somaa ne ala.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Mɔɔ kakula ne lile kenle mɔtwɛ la, bɛ nwo amra nee bɛ gɔnwo mɔ amuala rale ye dumadonlɛ ɔ nee ye mrenyiazopɛlɛ guabɔlɛ ne abo. Ɛnee bɛ muala bɛ adwenle a le kɛ bɛbava ye bɛado ɔ ze Zɛkalaya.<verse eid="LUK 1:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Na Ɛlezabɛte zele bɛ kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ! Ɔwɔ kɛ bɛfɛlɛ ye Dwɔn!”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Bɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Duzu ati ɔ? Awie biala ɛnle wɔ abusua ye anu mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye zɔhane a.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Ɔti bɛyɛle sɛkɛlɛneɛ bɛhilele ɔ ze kɛ ɔhile adɔma ne duma.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Ɔdole ɛsalɛ kɛ bɛrɛlɛ ye sileeti. Na mɔɔ ɔ sa hanle ye la, ɔyɛle awie biala azibɛnwo kɛ ɔhɛlɛle kɛ, “Ye duma a le Dwɔn.” <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Na ɛkɛ ne ala Zɛkalaya holale dendɛle na ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔye Awulae ayɛlɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Ɛhye zinle awie biala anwo totohyia, na edwɛkɛ ne zandele Dwudiya awoka ne mɔ azo ɔ nee namunamu ne mɔ anu amuala. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Na awie biala mɔɔ dele la dwenlenle nwolɛ fane dɔɔnwo ne ala na bɛzele kɛ, “Ɛnee duzu sonla a kakula ɛhye bayɛ a? Ɔluakɛ Nana Nyamenle asa la ɔ nwo zo wɔ adenle ngakyile bie anu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Akee Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne radwule ɔ ze Zɛkalaya anwo zo maanle ɔhanle kɛ:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Bɛye Awulae, Yizilayɛ Nyamenle ne ayɛlɛ, ɔluakɛ yera yerakpɔla ye menli, na yekpɔne bɛ yevi akɛlɛyɛlɛ bo. <verse eid="LUK 1:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Na yeye Ngoanedievolɛ Bedevinli bie yevi Devidi dehelɛ abusua ne anu yemaa yɛ, <verse eid="LUK 1:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />kɛmɔ ɔluale ye anwodelɛ ngapezoma ne mɔ anwo zo ɔbɔle nwolɛ ɛwɔkɛ ne, wɔ melɛ tendenle mɔɔ ɛze ɛhɔ la, <verse eid="LUK 1:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />kɛ ɔbakpɔne yɛ yeavi yɛ kpɔvolɛma nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi ye la amuala asa anu.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72-73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72-73" />“Amgba noko yenwu yɛ nlenyia mɔ anwunvɔne, na eza yenwu yɛ ze Ebileham mumua ne noko anwunvɔne, wɔ ye ɛwɔkɛ dɛba ne bɔbɔ mɔɔ ɔhakyele la ati; <verse eid="LUK 1:72-73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />nee ɛyelɛ mɔɔ yeye yɛ yevi yɛ kpɔvolɛma asa anu, amaa yɛahola yɛanyia adenle yɛazonle ye mɔɔ ɛzulolɛ biala ɛnle nu la; <verse eid="LUK 1:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />yɛɛ yɛ nwo bɔbɔ mɔɔ yede ye nwuanzanwuanza amaa yɛagyinla ɔ nyunlu wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />“Na wɔmɔ kakula ɛhye, bɛbavɛlɛ wɔ Nyamenle Bedevinli ne kapezonli, ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ a ɛbaziezie adenle ne anu wɔamaa Ngoanedievolɛ ne a. <verse eid="LUK 1:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Wɔmɔ a ɛbahile menli adenle mɔɔ bɛfa zo a bɛkɛnyia ngoane wɔ bɛ ɛtanefakyɛ nu a. <verse eid="LUK 1:77" /><verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Ɛhye mɔ amuala bazi, ɔluakɛ Nana Nyamenle ye anwunvɔnezelɛ ne le kpole, yɛɛ akee anwuma maanle ne noko ɛlɛba arabuke amaa yɛ, <verse eid="LUK 1:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />na ɛhye bamaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛde awozinli nu, ɔ nee ewule ɛlobɔ nu la anwu wienyi, na wienyi ne awowa yɛ muala ahɔ anzondwolɛ nu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Kakula ekyi ne vale ye ahonle muala maanle Nana Nyamenle amgba. Na mɔɔ ɔyɛle kpanyinli la, fiemgbole zo lɔ a ɔdɛnlanle dedee hɔkpulale mekɛ mɔɔ ɔbɔle ye Nyamenle gyima ne abo wɔ Yizilayɛma anu la.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse awole ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Mekɛ ɛhye anu, Siza Ɔgɛsetɛse, mɔɔ le Wulomuma belemgbunli ne la lile mɛla kɛ bɛdia menli mɔɔ wɔ maanle ne anu la amuala. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Zɛhae menlidianlɛ ne zile wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛnee Koyeleneɛse a le amɛnlado wɔ Selea la.<verse eid="LUK 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Ɛnee ɔwɔ kɛ awie biala sia kɔ ye mgbanyima sua zo maa bɛkɛlɛ ye duma wɔ ɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Ɛhye maanle Dwosefi zile nu vile Nazalɛte, mɔɔ wɔ Galeli maanzinli nu la, kɛ ɔkɔ Bɛtelɛhɛm mɔɔ wɔ Dwudiya la, ɔluakɛ ɔvi Belemgbunli Devidi aako nee abusua ne anu. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Ɔ nee Male, mɔɔ ɛnee yeva ɔ sa yedo ɔ nwo zo, na ɔ ko ɛdu kpalɛ noko la hɔle.<verse eid="LUK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Ɔti mekɛ mɔɔ bɛwɔ ɛkɛ ne la, ɔ ko hanle ye; <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />na ɔwole ye belamunli ralɛ ne, ralɛ nrenyia. Ɔvale fuazinli ɔkyekyele ɔ nwo, na ɔvale ye ɔdole ye wɔ mboane aleɛlilɛ ɛlɛka nu, ɔluakɛ bɛannyia ɛleka wɔ nyɛvosua ne anu.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Kenle ko ne nɔe ne, ɛnee mboaneneavolɛma bie ɛlɛsinza bɛ mboane wɔ ɛsɛlɛ zo lɔ wɔ namule ne anzi lɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Na arɛlevilɛ nu ala, anwumabɔvolɛ bie vindele bɛ avinli, na Awulae anyunlunyia dale ɛkɛ ne wienyi. Bɛ ahonle dule somaa ne ala, <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />noko anwumabɔvolɛ ne zele bɛ kɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 2:10">“Bɛmmasulo! Ɔluakɛ melɛ amaneɛ fɛlɛko mebɛlɛ bɛ muala! <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Ɛnɛ nɔe ye a bɛwo Ngoanedievolɛ ne, Sonla Ra ne, Awulae ne wɔ Bɛtelɛhɛm a. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Na bɛbanwu ye kɛ bɛkyekye ye wɔ fuazinli nu, na ɔla mboane aleɛlilɛ ɛlɛka nu!”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Na arɛlevilɛ nu ala, anwumabɔvolɛma ɛlɔne kpole bie rabokale anwumabɔvolɛ ko ne anwo, na bɛdole edwɛne bɛyele Awulae Nyamenle ayɛlɛ bɛzele kɛ:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Nyilalɛ ɛha Nana Nyamenle wɔ anwuma anwuma, na wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo, anzondwolɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛ diedi anzɛɛ ɛhulolɛ kpalɛ wɔ ye nu la.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Mɔɔ anwumabɔvolɛ kpolane ne ziale hɔle la, mboaneneavolɛma ne mɔ zele bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko kɛ, “Ayi mɔ! Bɛrɛla bɛmaa yɛhɔ Bɛtelɛhɛm yɛhɔnlea nwanwanedeɛ ɛhye mɔɔ ɛzi, mɔɔ Awulae ɛye ɛhile yɛ la!”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Bɛvale ɛnriandinlɛ bɛhɔle sua ne azo na bɛhɔnwunle Dwosefi nee Male. Na bɛnwunle kakula ne kɛ ɔla mboane aleɛlilɛ ɛlɛka nu. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Mboaneneavolɛ ne mɔ hanle ninyɛne mɔɔ zile la, nee mɔɔ anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ rayele hilele bɛ wɔ kakula ɛhye anwo la amuala hilele awie biala. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Na awie biala noko mɔɔ dele zɛhae edwɛkɛ ne la, ɔyɛle ye azibɛnwo, <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />noko Male yemɔ ɔvale ɔ muala ɔziele ye ahonle nu na ɔdwenlenle nwolɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Akee mboaneneavolɛma ne mɔ ziale bɛ nzi vale ayɛlɛyelɛ nee edwɛnedolɛ hanvole Nyamenle, wɔ mɔɔ bɛdele nee mɔɔ bɛnwunle ye, boka mɔɔ bɛhanle bɛhilele bɛ la amuala anwo.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Ɔlile kenle mɔtwɛ, mɔɔ bɛyiale nu wɔ kakula ne mrenyiazopɛlɛ nee ye dumadonlɛ nwo la, bɛdonle ye duma “Gyisɛse”, kɛmɔ anwumabɔvolɛ ne hanle ye wɔ ɔ nwo kolaa na bɛanrenzɛ ye bɔbɔ la.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Na mɔɔ Male vile ye ɛdane wiele la, kɛmɔ Mosisi mɛla ne se la, bɛvale kakula ne bɛhɔle Gyɛlusalɛm kɛ bɛkaye ye bɛahile wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu; <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />ɔluakɛ, Awulae Nyamenle mɛla ne se, “Kakula biala mɔɔ le belamunli ralɛ nrenyia la, ɔwɔ kɛ bɛtu ye bɛwula Awulae asa.”<verse eid="LUK 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Zɔhane mekɛ ne, ɛnee deɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛbu zɛhae amaamuo ne la a le “aabule nwiɔ anzɛɛ mɔlɔnloma nwiɔ” kɛmɔ mɛla ne se la. <verse eid="LUK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Kenle ko ne ala, ɛnee nrenyia bie mɔɔ vi Gyɛlusalɛm, mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Semɛyɔn la, wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu. Nrenyia ɛhye le sonla atiakunlukɛnlɛma, ɔsulo Nana Nyamenle, na eza Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne ɛyi ye tɛkɛɛ zɛhae, na eza noko ɔ nye la Ngoanedievolɛ ne ade dahuu. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Ɔluakɛ Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne ɛye ɛhile ye kɛ ɔnrɛnwu Ewule kɔkpula kɛ ɔkɛnwu ye Belemgbunli ne mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɔdaye yeyila ye la. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne noko eza hwenle ye hɔle Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu wɔ zɔhane kenle ne; ɛhye noko ati, mɔɔ Dwosefi nee Male rale kɛ bɛbava kakula ne bɛahile kɛmɔ mɛla ne se la, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />ɛnee Semɛyɔn wɔ ɛkɛ ne, ɔti ɔliele kakula ne ɔdole ɔ sa zo na ɔyele Awulae Nyamenle ayɛlɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29-31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29-31" />Ɔzele kɛ, “Awulae, akee maa menwu anzondwolɛ nu! Ɔluakɛ akee menwu ye, kɛmɔ ɛbɔle me ɛwɔkɛ la. Menwu Ngoanedievolɛ ne mɔɔ ɛbɔle ɛwɔkɛ kɛ ɛbava wɔamaa ewiade ye la. <verse eid="LUK 2:29-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Yemɔ a le Kɛnlaneɛ ne mɔɔ bada amaa ewiade amra, na eza noko yeaye anyunlunyia yeamaa wɔ menli Yizilayɛma ne la!”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ ɛnee bɛlɛka ye wɔ Gyisɛse anwo la yɛle Dwosefi nee Male azibɛnwo totohyia.<verse eid="LUK 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34-35" />Semɛyɔn yilale bɛ, na akee ɔzele Male kɛ, “Dadeɛ bawɔ wɔ ahonle nu, ɔluakɛ Yizilayɛma dɔɔnwo ne ala bakpo kakula ɛhye wɔ bɛdabɛ bɛ amaneɛnwunlɛ ti. Noko akee ɔbayɛ anyelielɛ kpole yeamaa dɔɔnwo ne ala; na ahonle dɔɔnwo ne ala fealera nu edwɛkɛ bala ali.”<verse eid="LUK 2:34-35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36-37" />Kenle ko ne ala, ɛnee Ana, mɔɔ le kapezonli raalɛ la noko wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu bie. Ɔ ze a le Fanuwɛle, mɔɔ vi Dwuunli Ahya abusua ne anu la. Eza ɔle raalɛ mɔɔ ɔ nye ɛvi kpalɛ a, ɔboalekɛ ɔhɔle agyalɛ ɛvolɛ nsuu ala, na yehyi kunlane ɛvolɛ abulatwɛ nee nna. Ɔ gyakɛ amkpa Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu ɛlɛ, alehyenlɛ nee aledwolɛ muala ɛnee ɔwɔ ɛkɛ ɔlɛsonle Awulae wɔ nzɛlɛlɛ nee ɛhɔnehyelɛ nu.<verse eid="LUK 2:36-37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Mekɛ mɔɔ Semɛyɔn tendɛ ahile Dwosefi nee Male la, Ana ɔdaye noko ɔrale bɛ nwo ɛkɛ, na ɔdaye noko ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔyɛ Nyamenle mo, eza ɔyeyɛ ye, na ɔbɔ ye ɛlawule ɔkile Gyɛlusalɛm amra amuala kɛ, Ngoanedievolɛ ne mɔɔ ɛnee bɛ nye la ye ade la a ɛra la.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛzia bɛra Nazalɛte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Mɔɔ Dwosefi nee Male wiele ninyɛne mɔɔ Nyamenle Mɛla ne kile la amuala yɛ la, bɛziale bɛhɔle sua nu wɔ Nazalɛte mɔɔ wɔ Galeli la. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Akee kakula ne nyinle wɔ nrɛlɛbɛ kpole nu, na Nana Nyamenle ɛlolɛ ne noko dɛnlanle ye nu.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41-42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41-42" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse lile ɛvolɛ bulu nee nwiɔ la, ɔ nee ye awovolɛma ne mɔ hɔle Gyɛlusalɛm bɛkali Dwuuma Akpabɛnwo Ɛvoyia ne bie. <verse eid="LUK 2:41-42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Bɛwiele ɛvoyia ne di la, bɛzile nu kɛ bɛkɔ Nazalɛte, noko Gyisɛse yemɔ ɔhale bɛ nzi wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm. Ɛnee ye awovolɛma ne mɔ ɛnze nwolɛ bie, <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />ɔluakɛ bɛdwenlenle kɛ ɔ nee ɔ gɔnwo mɔ nee ye sua zo amra bara. Na ye nɔsolɛ nu mɔɔ yeamba la, bɛbɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛkpondɛ ye wɔ bɛ nwo amra nee bɛ gɔnwo mɔ ɛkɛ ne; <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />na mɔɔ bɛannwu ye la, akee bɛziale bɛhɔle Gyɛlusalɛm kɛ bɛkakpondɛ ye wɔ ɛkɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46-47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46-47" />Ye kenle nsa ne azo yɛɛ akee bɛnwunle ye a. Ɛnee ɔde kilehilevolɛma mgbanyima ne mɔ avinli wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu ɔlɛtie bɛ na ɔbizebiza bɛ edwɛkɛ. Na ye ndelebɛbo nee ye nyelebɛnloa ne zinle bɛ nuhua biala anwo.<verse eid="LUK 2:46-47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Ye awovolɛma ne mɔ noko nwunle ye la, ɔyɛle bɛdabɛ noko nwanwane. Na ɔ nli zele ye kɛ, “Me Ra, na duzu ati a wɔyɛ yɛ zɛhae a? Ɛdawɔ nea kɛ me nee ɛ ze yɛkpondɛ wɔ yɛvɛ zɛhae ɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Na duzu bɔbɔ ati a bɛkpondɛ me a? Bɛnze kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ meyɛ Egya gyima wɔ ye Asɔne Sua ne anu ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Ɔ nli nee ɔ ze bɛmɛ bɛande ɛhye mɔɔ ɔhanle la abo.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Akee ɔ nee bɛ ziale hɔle Nazalɛte, na ɔdiele bɛ edwɛkɛ, na ɔbɛlɛle ɔ nwo aze ɔmaanle bɛ; na ɔ nli noko vale edwɛkɛ ɛhye mɔ amuala ziele ye ahonle nu. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Na Gyisɛse noko nyinle wɔ nrɛlɛbɛ nee nwonane nu, na Nana Nyamenle nee menli hulole ye edwɛkɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Dwɔn ɛbɔ ye gyima bo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1-2" />Wɔ ɛvolɛ ne mɔɔ tɔ zo bulu nee nnu wɔ Belemgbunli Taebilease Siza mekɛ zo la anu, Nana Nyamenle edwɛkɛ ne radwule Zɛkalaya ara, Dwɔn, mɔɔ ɛnee wɔ fiemgbole ne azo la anwo zo. Mekɛ ɛhye anu, ɛnee Paelɛte a le Dwudiya maanle ne azo amɛnlado a; yɛɛ Hɛlɔdo a nea Galeli maanzinli ne mɔ azo a; ɔ diema Felepe, noko a nea Ayetulia nee Telakonaetɛse maanzinli ne mɔ azɛlɛ azo a; yɛɛ akee Laesɛnease noko a nea Abelin maanzinli ne azo a; na ɛnee Anase nee Kayafase a le Dwuuma Azɛlɛvolɛ Mgbanyinli ne mɔ a. <verse eid="LUK 3:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Na Dwɔn kpɔsale vile azule Dwɔdan ne foa ko nee ye foa ko hanle edwɛkpa ne zele kɛ, ɔwɔ kɛ menli nyia anlubɛnwo na bɛsɔne bɛ amaa Nyamenle ava bɛ ɛtane ahyɛ bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ɛhye le edwɛkɛ mɔɔ kapezonli Ayezaya hanle dole ɛkɛ ne dɛbadɛba kɛ, “Ɛnelɛ bie ɛlɛtea nu wɔ fiemgbole ne azo kɛ, ‘Bɛziezie Awulae adenle ne anu bɛmaa ɔva zo! Bɛbukebuke ndenle ne mɔ mɔɔ deda ɔ nyunlu la anu! <verse eid="LUK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Bɛha awoka ne mɔ aze! Bɛduodua ahuma ne mɔ! Bɛdenrɛdenrɛ ɛleka mɔɔ ɛhyeɛhyea la! Na bɛbobo zo bɛmaa ɔyɛ sɛlɛsɛlɛ! <verse eid="LUK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Amaa ewiade amra anwu Ngoanedievolɛ ne mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛzoa ye la.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ Dwɔn hanle hilele menli ekpunli ekpunli ne mɔɔ rale kɛ bɛba bɛamaa yeazɔne bɛ la bie ɛne: “Bɛmɛ nwɔlɛ mralɛ! Bɛlɛbɔ mɔdenle kɛ bɛnriandi bɛavi abɔnsam senle ne anu wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ nɔhalɛ nu, bɛtɛdiele Nyamenle bɛtɛdile la! Ɛhye ati a bɛkulo kɛ bɛsɔne bɛ a! <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Bɛlumua bɛzia bɛhɔbɔ ɛbɛla mɔɔ kile kɛ amgba bɛnlu bɛ nwo la. Bɛmmadwenle kɛ Ebileham abo zo amra a le bɛ la ati, ɛnee ɔdaye ne ala ɛne. Nana Nyamenle kola kakyi ɛsɛlɛ ye azo awolɛ bɔbɔ maa bɛyɛ Ebileham abo zo amra! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Yezi ye ndɛnebualɛ akuma ne noko yedo bɛ bo ngoko ngoko, na yeboa ɔ nwo kɛ ɔpepɛ bɛ yeagua bɛ aze. Ɔti baka biala mɔɔ anzo ma kpalɛ la ɔbapɛ ye yeado ye senle nu yeayela ye.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Menli dodo ne bizale ye kɛ, “Duzu a ɛkpondɛ kɛ yɛyɛ a?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Saa ɛlɛ anwuma adɛladeɛ nwiɔ a, fa ko maa koahweabane mɔɔ ɛnlɛ bie la. Yɛɛ saa ɛlɛ aleɛ dɔɔnwo noko a, fa bie maa menli mɔɔ ɛhɔne ku bɛ la.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Adwuledievolɛma noko mɔɔ ndoloboalielɛ ɛnzea bɛ adenle la bɔbɔ rale ɛkɛ ne bie kɛ bɛbazɔne. Na bɛdabɛ noko bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, na kɛ ɔkɛzi ɔkɛyɛ na wɔanwu kɛ amgba yɛgyakyi ɛtaneyɛlɛ ɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Ɔbuale bɛ ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛ nɔhalɛlilɛ ne a bahile a. Bɛmmadie adwule mɔɔ bo mɔɔ Wulomu Arane ne ɛpɛ ɛdo ɛkɛ kɛ bɛlie la azo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Azogya bie mɔ noko rabizale ye kɛ, “Na yɛmɛ noko ɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Dwɔn buale bɛ zele kɛ, “Bɛmmabɔ awie mɔ apo na bɛfa kitikitiyɛlɛ bɛdie bɛ ezukoa amile nu; eza noko bɛmmapɛ ɛzonle bɛto awie abo wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ahenle ne ɛtɛyɛle ɛtane biala la; na bɛmaa bɛ kunlu ɛdwo bɛ ahatualɛ ne anwo!”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Ɛnee awie biala anye la kɛ ɔnrɛhyɛ biala na Kelaese ne ara. Ɛhye ati menli dɔɔnwo ne ala dwenlenle kɛ Dwɔn a le Kelaese ne a. Ɛhye yɛle huhuhuhu edwɛkɛ wɔ maanle ne anu ɛleka biala.<verse eid="LUK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Na Dwɔn hanle ye wienyi hilele bɛ kɛ, “Mame nzule mgbane ala a melɛfa meazɔne bɛ a; na awie bie li me nzi ɛlɛba mɔɔ ɔlɛ tumi kpole ɔtɛla me a; na memfɛta kɛ menwɔyɛ ye akɛlɛ bɔbɔ, yɛɛ memfɛta noko kɛ menwɔzanyi ye mgbɔlaboa nyɛma mgbane ne bɔbɔ. Na yemɔ yɛɛ ɔbava senle nee Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne yeazɔne bɛ a. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Yemɔ yɛɛ ɔbaye abɛlɛ abonle ne yeavi abɛlɛ ne anwo, na yeayela abɛlɛ abonle ne wɔ sendɔlɛra ne mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la anu, na yeava abɛlɛ ma ne yeazie a.” <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Akee ɔvale zɛhae ndonwo dɔɔnwo ne ala a ɔhanle Edwɛkpa ne ɔhilele menli ne a. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19-20" />Nzinlii mɔɔ Dwɔn dendɛle bagua nu tiale Hɛlɔdo, mɔɔ nea Galeli maanzinli ne azo, wɔ ɔ diema aye Hɛlɔdease mɔɔ ɛnee yeva ye la ati, nee ɛtane gyɛne gyɛne dɔɔnwo mɔɔ yeyɛ la noko anwo la, Hɛlɔdo hyele Dwɔn dole efiade. Ɛhye maanle Hɛlɔdo ɛtane ne akee yɛle molozo. <verse eid="LUK 3:19-20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Na kenle ko bie mɔɔ bɛzɔnenle menli dɔɔnwo ne ala bɛwiele la, Gyisɛse noko rale maanle bɛzɔnenle ye. Bɛzɔnenle ye bɛwiele mɔɔ ɔsɛlɛ la, anwuma maanle ne bukele wienyi, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />na Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne dule hyii kɛ abubule la radwule ɔ nwo zo, na ɛnelɛ bie vi anwuma maanle ne anu zele kɛ, “Wɔmɔ a ɛle me ɛhulolɛ Ralɛ ne mɔɔ ɛsɔ me nye a.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse abusua eku ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse bɔle ye bagua nu gyima ne abo la, ɛnee yeli ɛvolɛ kɛyɛ abulasa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:23">Ɛnee awie biala ze ye kɛ ɔ ze a le Dwosefi. Dwosefi ɛhye, yemɔ ɔ ze a le Helae;<verse eid="LUK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Helae ɔ ze a le Matate; Matate ɔ ze a le Livae; Livae ɔ ze a le Mɛlekae; Mɛlekae ɔ ze a le Gyanae; Gyanae ɔ ze a le Dwosefi;<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Dwosefi ɔ ze a le Matatayase; Matatayase ɔ ze a le Emɔso; Emɔso ɔ ze a le Neehum; Neehum ɔ ze a le Ɛselae; Ɛselae ɔ ze a le Nagae;<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagae ɔ ze a le Meeyate; Meeyate ɔ ze a le Matatayase; Matatayase ɔ ze a le Semɛyɔn; Semɛyɔn ɔ ze a le Dwosɛke; Dwosɛke ɔ ze a le Dwoda;<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Dwoda ɔ ze a le Dwowanan; Dwowanan ɔ ze a le Rilisa; Rilisa ɔ ze a le Zɛlubabɛle; Zɛlubabɛle ɔ ze a le Hyealeteɛle; Hyealeteɛle ɔ ze a le Nilae;<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Nilae ɔ ze a le Mɛlekae; Mɛlekae ɔ ze a le Asa; Asa ɔ ze a le Kosam; Kosam ɔ ze a le Ɛlemadam; Ɛlemadam ɔ ze a le Ɛɛ;<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Ɛɛ ɔ ze a le Dwɔhyua; Dwɔhyua ɔ ze a le Ɛleyizɛ; Ɛleyizɛ ɔ ze a le Dwolem; Dwolem ɔ ze a le Matate; Matate ɔ ze a le Livae;<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Livae ɔ ze a le Semɛyɔn; Semɛyɔn ɔ ze a le Dwuda; Dwuda ɔ ze a le Dwosefi; Dwosefi ɔ ze a le Dwonam; Dwonam ɔ ze a le Yilayakem;<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Yilayakem ɔ ze a le Mɛlɛya; Mɛlɛya ɔ ze a le Mina; Mina ɔ ze a le Matata; Matata ɔ ze a le Neetan; Neetan ɔ ze a le Devidi;<verse eid="LUK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Devidi ɔ ze a le Gyɛsi; Gyɛsi ɔ ze a le Obɛde; Obɛde ɔ ze a le Bowaze; Bowaze ɔ ze a le Salemɔn; Salemɔn ɔ ze a le Nahyɔn;<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nahyɔn ɔ ze a le Amenadabe; Amenadabe ɔ ze a le Ademen; Ademen ɔ ze a le Aanae; Aanae ɔ ze a le Hɛzelɔn; Hɛzelɔn ɔ ze a le Pɛlɛze; Pɛlɛze ɔ ze a le Dwuda;<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Dwuda ɔ ze a le Gyekɔbo; Gyekɔbo ɔ ze a le Ayezeke; Ayezeke ɔ ze a le Ebileham; Ebileham ɔ ze a le Tɛla; Tɛla ɔ ze a le Neehɔ;<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Neehɔ ɔ ze a le Sɛlɛge; Sɛlɛge ɔ ze a le Riliyu; Riliyu ɔ ze a le Pɛlɛge; Pɛlɛge ɔ ze a le Yibɛ; Yibɛ ɔ ze a le Hyɛla;<verse eid="LUK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Hyɛla ɔ ze a le Keenan; Keenan ɔ ze a le Aafazade; Aafazade ɔ ze a le Hyɛm; Hyɛm ɔ ze a le Nowa; Nowa ɔ ze a le Leemɛke;<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Leemɛke ɔ ze a le Matusɛla; Matusɛla ɔ ze a le Yinɔko; Yinɔko ɔ ze a le Gyɛlɛde; Gyɛlɛde ɔ ze a le Mahalɛli; Mahalɛli ɔ ze a le Kinan;<verse eid="LUK 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kinan ɔ ze a le Yinɔhye; Yinɔhye ɔ ze a le Sɛte; Sɛte ɔ ze a le Adam; Yɛɛ Adam ɔdaye ɔ ze a le Nana Nyamenle.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛzɔ Gyisɛse bɛnlea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1-2" />Na Gyisɛse vile Azule Dwɔdan ne anu, mɔɔ ɛnee Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne ɛyi ye tɛkɛɛ la, Sunsum ko ne ala vale ye hɔle Dwudiya ɛsɛlɛ reserese ne azo. Na Abɔnsam zɔle ye nleanle too kenle abulanla. Zɛhae mekɛ ye amuala ɛnee ɔlɛkye ɛhɔne, ɔti nzinlii, akee ɛhɔne hunle ye kpole.<verse eid="LUK 4:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Na Abɔnsam zele ye kɛ, “Saa ɛdawɔ a ɛle Nyamenle Ra ne a, ɛnee kakyi bolɛ ɛhye maa ɔyɛ kpanwo.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Gyisɛse buale ye zele kɛ, “Bɛhɛlɛ ye wɔ Ngɛlɛlera ne anu kɛ, ‘Tɛ kpanwo angomekye a sonla di a ɔnyia ngoane a!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Akee Abɔnsam vale ye hɔle boka bie ati zo hɔyele ewiade ye arelemgbunli maanle nee bɛ anyunlunyia muala hilele ye wɔ mekɛ ekyi bie anu; <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6-7" />na Abɔnsam zele ye kɛ, “Ɛhye mɔ amuala le me deɛ, yɛɛ mekola mefa memaa awie biala mɔɔ mekulo la. Ɛhye ati saa ɛkoto ɛsonle me ekyii ala a, mebava bɛ muala kpokpoti meamaa wɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 4:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Gyisɛse buale zele kɛ, “Bɛhɛlɛ ye wɔ Ngɛlɛlera ne anu kɛ, ‘Mmasonle debie biala ɛboka wɔ Nyamenle ne anwo, na ɔ ngome ala a sonle ye a.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9-11" />Abɔnsam eza vale Gyisɛse vole Gyɛlusalɛm Asɔne Sua Kpole tawa ne ati zo, na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Saa wɔmɔ a ɛle Nyamenle Ra ne a, ɛnee wulu pe! Ɔluakɛ Ngɛlɛlera ne se kɛ, Nana Nyamenle bazoa ye anwumabɔvolɛma amaa bɛarazɔ wɔ bɛ sa nu ammaa ɛ gyakɛ amkpula mgbane bɔbɔ!”<verse eid="LUK 4:9-11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Gyisɛse noko buale ye kɛ, “Ngɛlɛlera ne noko kile yɛ kɛ, ‘Mmasɔ wɔ Awulae Nyamenle ɛnea mgbane mgbane.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Mɔɔ Abɔnsam wiele ye sɔnea ne amuala la, akee ɔhwenle ɔ nwo ɔgyakyile Gyisɛse wɔ mekɛ ekyi bie anu na ɔhɔle.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛbɔ ye gyima bo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Na Gyisɛse, mɔɔ ɛnee Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne tumi ɛyi ye tɛkɛɛ la, ziale hɔle Galeli. Yeangyɛ biala ye nganeɛ zandele maanle ne anu amuala, <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />ɔlua ye nwanwane ngilehile ne mɔ wɔ ayiasua ne mɔ anu ati; ɔti awie biala hanvole ye na bɛwulale ye anyunlunyia.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Mɔɔ ɔrale Nazalɛte namule nu, mɔɔ le ɔdaye ye sua zo, ɛleka mɔɔ bɛtetele ye wɔ la, ɔhɔle ayiasua ne anu wɔ Folɛ anzɛɛ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne kɛmɔ ɔta ɔyɛ ye la; na ɔdwazole ɔgyinlanle kɛ ɔkenga Nyamedwɛkɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Bɛvale Ayezaya kapezonli buluku ne bɛmaanle ye, na ɔbukele ɛleka ne mɔɔ se kɛ:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18-19" />“Awulae Sunsum ne ɛdwu me nwo zo; ɔluakɛ yedu me kɛ membanga Edwɛkpa ne mengile ehyiavolɛma; eza yezoa me kɛ membankyekye bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛdi nyane la arɛle, na menze bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛgua efiade la kɛ bɛbaye bɛ, yɛɛ anyezinliravolɛma kɛ bɛdabɛ noko bɛbanwu debie, na menze bɛdabɛ mɔɔ menli sisi bɛ la noko kɛ bɛbaye bɛ bɛavi bɛ kpɔvolɛma asa anu; na Nana Nyamenle noko ɛboa ɔ nwo kɛ ɔbayila bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛra ye ɛkɛ la.”<verse eid="LUK 4:18-19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Akee ɔdole buluku ne anu na ɔvale ɔmaanle ahenle mɔɔ nea asɔne ninyɛne ne mɔ azo la, na ɔhɔdɛnlanle aze. Na awie biala mɔɔ wɔ ayiasua ne anu bie la anye hale ɔ nwo. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Ɔzele bɛ bieko kɛ, “Ɛnɛ demua ye a zɛhae Ngɛlɛlera ne ɛli munli a!”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Menli mɔɔ wɔ ɛkɛ ne la amuala hanvole ye, na eza noko ɔyɛle bɛ azibɛnwo kɛ ɔ nloa edwɛkɛ yɛ fɛ a. Bɛzele bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko kɛ, “Na tɛ Dwosefi ara ye ɛhye ɔ? Duzu ati a akee ɔ nwo yɛ nwanwane zɛhae a?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ, bɛbava ɛrɛlɛ ɛhye bɛabu me bɛaze me kɛ: ‘Ninsinli, yɛ ɛ nwo ayile ɛ’ anzɛɛ ‘Duzu ati a ɛnyɛ nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛyɛle bɛ wɔ Kapɛnayɛm la bie wɔ ɛdawɔ wɔ sua zo a?’ <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Noko akee memaa bɛade ɔ bo wienyi kɛ, kapezonli biala ɛnlɛ anyunlunyia wɔ ɔdaye ye sua zo! <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25-26" />Memaa bɛ ndonwo: Bɛnlea kɛ ɔyɛle mɔɔ Yilaegya kapezonli ne yɛle nwanwanendeɛ vale boale Zalɛfate, kunlavolɛ raalɛ ne mɔɔ le ɛyɛvolɛ mɔɔ vi Saedɛn maanle nu la. Ɛnee Dwuuma kunlavolɛma dɔɔnwo ne ala wɔ Dwudiya maanle ne anu, mɔɔ bɛhyianle moalɛ wɔ ɛhɔne kpole bie mɔɔ zile azɛlɛ ye azo wɔ mekɛ zɔhane anu la; ɔluakɛ ɛnee ɛvolɛ nsa nee foa: kpalɛ ɛpɛ nu ɛze mɔɔ ezule biala ɛndɔ a; noko akee bɛanzoa Yilaegya wɔ ɛhye mɔ biala ɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:25-26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Na eza noko bɛdwenle kapezonli Yilaehya mɔɔ yɛle Neeyaman mɔɔ le Seleanli ne ayile wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛnee Dwuuma kokobɛvolɛma dɔɔnwo hyia: moalɛ la.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Edwɛkɛ ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ bɛdele la maanle ɛya kpole hunle bɛ; <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />ɔti bɛvale ye kɛ bɛ nee ye kɔ sua ne azo boka ne agye nu, na bɛawɔ ɔ kɔme anzi, bɛazuhu ye bɛado bɔnza ne anu bɛamaa yeatete kpasakpasa. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Noko ɔwolole menli ne anu ɔgyakyile bɛ ɛkɛ ne ɔhɔle.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Ɔziale ɔrale Galeli sua ne mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Kapɛnayɛm la azo bieko, na ɔhanle Edwɛkpa ne wɔ bɛ ayiasua ne anu wɔ mekɛ biala mɔɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne kɛdwu la. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Ɛke noko, eza menli ne mɔ nwunle kɛ ye edwɛkɛ mɔɔ ɔka la amuala yɛ nwanwane. Ɔluakɛ tumi wɔ ye edwɛkɛ ɛhanlɛ ne anu kɛ sonla mɔɔ ze nɔhalɛ ne, na ɔnle mɔɔ mɔɔ awie mɔ ɛha la azo yɛɛ ɔto la.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Kenle ko bie mɔɔ ɛnee ɔlɛkile debie wɔ ayiasua ne anu la, nrenyia bie mɔɔ bozonle ɛva ye la bɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔteɛdea nu ɔse kɛ, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Gyisɛse Nazalɛtenli, ɛvi ɛke kɔ! Duzu a yɛ nee wɔ lɛ ye a? Wɔra kɛ ɛbahu yɛ ɔ? Meze wɔ sonla holɛ; Wɔmɔ a le Nyamenle Ra Nwuanzanwuanza ne.”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Gyisɛse deanle ye nu zele kɛ, “Yɛ koonwu! Ɛvi ye nu finde!” Na amgba noko bozonle ne pɛle nrenyia ne dole ye aze na ɔvindele nyaa ɔhɔle.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Ɛhye zinle menli ne anwo totohyia, na bɛbizale kɛ, “Na duzu bɔbɔ a wɔ nrenyia ɛhye edwɛkɛhanlɛ nu a, mɔɔ ɔti awozonle bɔbɔ tie ye a?” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Ɔti yeangyɛ yɛɛ ye nganeɛ zandele maanzinli ne anu amuala a.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Mekɛ mɔɔ ɔvi ayiasua ne anu wɔ zɔhane kenle ne la, ɔhɔle Saemɔn sua nu, na ɔhɔdole kɛ ebunlu ɛhye Saemɔn azebɛla ne, ɔti bɛbodole ye kɛ ɔyɛ ye ayile.<verse eid="LUK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Ɔhɔgyinlanle raalɛ ne ɛsokpa ne anwo na ɔdendɛle wɔ tumi nu ala ɔguale ɔ nwo zo, na ɛkɛ ne ala, ebunlu ne mɔɔ ɛhye ye la amgba noko vile ɔ nwo dule bɔkɔɔ, ɔti ɔdwazole foa, na ɔrazonlenle bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Ye nɔsolɛ nu mɔɔ sɛnzɛne ne ɛlɛkɔ ahɔdɔ la, sua ne azo amra mɔɔ lɛ awuliravolɛ la zoale bɛ muala rɛlɛle Gyisɛse; na amgba noko ɔvale ɔ sa ɔtotole bɛ nwo zo ngoko ngoko na ɔyɛle bɛ ayile. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Na awozonle vile menli dodo ne ala nu dule, na bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Wɔmɔ a le Nyamenle Ra ne a.” Na kɛmɔ bɛze kɛ yemɔ a le Kelaese ne la ati, yeammaa bɛ adenle yeammaa bɛandendɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Aleɛ hyenle nwonlomɔ ne la, ɔhɔle ɛsɛlɛ ne azo. Menli dodo ne kpondɛle ye dedee, na nzinlii mɔɔ bɛnwunle ye la, bɛbodole ye kɛ ɔmmakɔ, na ɔ nee bɛ ɛdɛnla Kapɛnayɛm ɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Na ɔzele bɛ kɛ “Ɔwɔ kɛ mekɔ mekɔka Nana Nyamenle Belemgbunli Maanle ne anwo Edwɛkpa ne mekile ɛleka bie amra noko, ɔluakɛ ɛhye ati a bɛzoanle me a.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Ɔti ɔhɔle zo ɔkpɔsale Dwudiya maanle ne anu amuala ɔhanle Edwɛkpa ne wɔ ayiasua ne mɔ anu.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛva ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Kenle ko bie mɔɔ ɛnee ɔlɛka Edwɛkpa ne wɔ Gɛnɛzalɛte Tandane ne anloa la, menli dɔɔnwo bie pianle bɛ nwo rale kɛ bɛbadie Nyamenle Edwɛkɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Na ɔnwunle nlɛne nwiɔ bie mɔɔ ɛhwee ɛnle nu na bɛgyigyi tandane ne anloa wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛnee bɛ menle mɔ ɛlɛkpo bɛ avonle ne mɔ a. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Gyisɛse vole nlɛne ne mɔ ko mɔɔ le Saemɔn deɛ la anu, na ɔzele ye kɛ ɔzuhu ye ɔhɔ azukunlu ekyii amaa yeahola yeadɛnla ɛlɛne ne anu na yeadendɛ yeahile menli dodo ne.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Mɔɔ ɔwiele tendɛ la, akee ɔzele Saemɔn kɛ, “Twe wɔ ɛlɛne ne kɔ azukunlu na akee to avonle ne, na ɛbahye fɛlɛ dɔɔnwo!”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Saemɔn buale zele ye kɛ, “Yɛmenle, nɔe amuala yɛyɛ gyima dedee noko yɛangye ɛhwee. Na kɛmɔ ɛdawɔ a wɔha la ati, yɛbado bieko yɛanlea.”<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Na mɔɔ bɛdole la, bɛhyele fɛlɛ somaa ne ala mɔɔ ɛnee akee bɛ avonle ne bɔbɔ kpondɛ atete a! <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛvɛlɛle bɛ gɔnwo mɔ mɔɔ wɔ ɛlɛne ko ne anu la kɛ bɛrazɔ bɛ nu bɛhwe, na bɛ fɛlɛ ne yile nlɛne nwiɔ ne mɔ tetɛkɛɛ mɔɔ ɛnee akee bɛkpondɛ bɛanloma bɔbɔ a.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Mɔɔ Saemɔn Pita nwunle deɛ mɔɔ zile la, ɔhotole Gyisɛse anyunlu na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Ao! Awulae, ɛvi yɛ nwo ɛke kɔ, ɔluakɛ mele ɛtanevolɛ mɔɔ ɔnle kɛ ɛbikye me a.” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Fɛlɛ dɔɔnwo ne mɔɔ bɛhyele ye la yɛle ye nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ ɛnee wɔ ɛkɛ ne la amuala azibɛnwo. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Ɛnee Zɛbɛdi amra, Gyemise nee Dwɔn noko boka Pita anwo. Na Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmmasulo! Ɔvi ɛnɛ mɔɔ kɔ la bɛbahwe menli bɛara Awulae ɛkɛ!”<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Mɔɔ bɛdwule file zo ala la, bɛgyakyile debie biala na bɛdoale ɔ bo zo bɛ nee ye hɔle.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛyɛ menli dɔɔnwo ayile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Kenle ko bie ɔhɔle namule bie azo la, ɛnee nrenyia bie mɔɔ kokobɛ ɛyɛ ye ɛhyɛ kpalɛ la wɔ ɛkɛ. Nrenyia ne nwunle Gyisɛse la, ɔrabutule ɔ nyunlu ɛkɛ na ɔzɛlɛle ye ɔzele kɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:12">“Yɛmenle, saa ɔyɛ wɔ ɛhulolɛ a, yɛ me ayile.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Gyisɛse dendenle ɔ sa ɔzɔle ye nu na ɔzele kɛ, “Mekulo. Te kpɔkɛ!” Na ɛkɛ ne ala kokobɛ ne vile ɔ nwo minlinle minlimɛnla! <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Ɛhye anzi, Gyisɛse bɔle ye kɔkɔ kɛ ɔmmaka ɔkile awie biala; na emomu ɔha ɔ nwo ɔhɔ ɔhɔva ɔ nwo ɔhile Dwuuma azɛlɛvolɛ ne mɔ ɔmaa bɛnwu kɛ amgba yede kpɔkɛ bɔkɔɔ. Ɔzele ye kɛ, “Kɔ bɔ azu ne mɔɔ Mosisi mɛla ne kile kɛ saa kokobɛvolɛ te kpɔkɛ a ɔwɔ kɛ ɔbɔ la. Ɛhye bamaa awie biala anwu kɛ amgba ɛ nwo ɛza bɔkɔɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Akee bɔbɔ ye tumi ne nganeɛ zandele ndɛndɛ mɔɔ ɔlua zo menli dɔɔnwo rale kɛ bɛbadie ye, na eza bɛamaa yeayɛ bɛ ayile a. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Noko akee fane dɔɔnwo ne ala, ɔhwenle ɔ nwo ɔhɔle ɛsɛlɛ ne azo kɛ ɔkazɛlɛ.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Na ɔrale kɛ, kenle ko bie mɔɔ ɛnee ɔlɛkilehile la, Falasiima ɔ nee Mɛla ne kilehilevolɛma ne mɔ bie noko rale ɛkɛ. Bie mɔ vi Gyɛlusalɛm, yɛɛ bie mɔ noko vi Galeli nee Dwudiya azua ne mɔ azo. Ɛnee Awulae ayileyɛlɛ tumi ne noko ɛradwu ɔ nwo zo kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ ɔyɛ menli ayile.<verse eid="LUK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18-19" />Na menli bie vale nrenyia bie mɔɔ ɛbubu la dole ahomanga nu bɛ nee ye rale. Na ɔlua menli dɔɔnwo ne ati bɛangola Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ dwu. Ɔti bɛhɔvole sua ne ati zo, na bɛkpogyale ezumule ne zo, na bɛdwulale nrenyia ne ɔ nee ahomanga ne mɔɔ ɔla zo la amuala wɔ Gyisɛse anyunlu ɛkɛ ne.<verse eid="LUK 5:18-19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Gyisɛse nwunle bɛ diedi ne la, ɔzele nrenyia ne kɛ, “Adiema, bɛva wɔ ɛtane bɛhyɛ wɔ!”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Falasiima ne mɔ nee Mɛla ne kilehilevolɛma ne mɔ mɔɔ wɔ ɛkɛ la zele kɛ, “Na nrenyia ɛhye mumua ne kɛ ɔdwenle ɔ nwo ɛ? Munzule edwɛkɛ a le ɛhye! Nwane bieko a kola fa ɛtane kyɛ kɛ Nana Nyamenle angomekye a?”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Gyisɛse nwunle mɔɔ bɛlɛdwenle la, ɔbuale bɛ ɔzele kɛ, “Duzu ati a ɛhye le munzule edwɛkɛ a? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23-24" />Mame, Sonla Ra ne, Melɛ tumi wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo kɛ mefa ɛtane mekyɛ. Na bɛ nloa edwɛkɛ le mgbane, awie biala kola ka ɛhye. Ɔti mebayɛ nrenyia ɛhye ayile amaa bɛanwu ye.” Ɔhakyile ɔ nye wɔ abuburavolɛ ne anwo, na wɔ tumi nu ala ɔzele ye kɛ, “Dwazo, fa wɔ ɛkpa ne na kɔ sua nu, ɔluakɛ wɔde kpɔkɛ!”<verse eid="LUK 5:23-24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Na ndɛndɛ ne ala, mɔɔ ɛnee awie biala anye gyi ɔ nwo la, nrenyia ne wulule gyinlanle; ɔvale ye ɛkpa ne na ɔbɔle ɔ bo ɔyele Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ ɔhɔle sua nu. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Ɔyɛle awie biala mɔɔ wɔ ɛkɛ ne la azibɛnwo totohyia. Na bɛhanle bɛfunlanle nu kɛ, “Ɛnɛ kenle ko ye yɛnwu nwanwane ninyɛne.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Ɛhye anzi ye, mɔɔ Gyisɛse vile sua ne azo la, ɔnwunle adwuledievolɛ bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Livae, kɛ ɔde ye adwulelielɛ kpɔda bo. Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Bɛla bayɛ me ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu ko!” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Amgba noko Livae dwazole foa, na ɔhɔdoale ye ɛkɛ ne ala na ɔ nee ye hɔle.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Yeangyɛ biala, Livae dole ɛkponle kpole ne ala maanle Gyisɛse. Na Livae agɔnwo mɔ adwuledievolɛma dɔɔnwo nee nyɛvolɛ gyɛne dɔɔnwo rale ɔ bo.<verse eid="LUK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Benlevolɛma ne mɔ akunlu ɛndwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Na Falasiima ne mɔ nee Mɛla ne kilehilevolɛma ne mɔ dendɛle ɛtane hilele Gyisɛse ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ zele kɛ, “Duzu ati a bɛ menle nee ɛtanevolɛma nee adwuledievolɛma to ɛsale di aleɛ ko a?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ zele kɛ, “Wuliravolɛma a hyia ninsinli anwo a, na tɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛte kpɔkɛ la ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Meambanvɛlɛ tenlenema, emomu ɛtanevolɛma ati a membale a, amaa bɛanlu bɛ nwo.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Mɔɔ bɛhanle ye bieko la a le kɛ, “Na duzu ati a Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ nee Falasiima ne mɔ kye ɛhɔne dahuu, na bɛyɛ asɔne, na Gyisɛse ɛdoavolɛma ɛdeɛ ne mɔ di aleɛ na eza bɛno nza a?”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Gyisɛse bizale bɛ kɛ, “Asoo atɔfolɛ bo amra bahola ahye ɛhɔne amaa yeayɛ boɛ, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ atɔfolɛ kunli ne nee bɛ wɔ ɛkɛ la ɔ? Menli mɔɔ anye die bɛ nwo la kye ɛhɔne ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Na mekɛ ne bara, mɔɔ atɔfolɛ kunli ne bavi bɛ sa a. Na zɔhane mekɛ ne a akee bɛbabua bɛala a.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Akee Gyisɛse bule ɛrɛlɛ ɛhye noko hilele bɛ kɛ: “Awie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔte ɛdanlɛ fofolɛ ɔfa ɔta fuazinli nu a. Ɔluakɛ saa ɛyɛ ɛhye a ɛdanlɛ fofolɛ ne bade avi dɛba ne anu na akee yeamaa tokule ne ayɛ kpole adɛla dɛba ne! <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Zɔhane ala noko, yɛɛ awie ɛnva nwanye fofolɛ ɛngua nwoma toba dɛba nu a. Ɔluakɛ saa ɛyɛ ɛhye a nwanye fofolɛ ne anu ɛsesebɛ ne bakpuke nwoma toba dɛba ne yeamaa nza ne agua aze. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Nwanye fofolɛ biala ɔwɔ kɛ bɛfa bɛgua nwoma toba fofolɛ nu. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Noko akee awie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ, mɔɔ saa ɔno nza dɛba na ɔtɔ ye fɛlɛko nu a, ɔkpondɛ fofolɛ bo zo a; emomu mɔɔ ɔka la a le kɛ, ‘Dɛba ne ala le kpalɛ.’”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ɛnwomenlelielɛ kenle ne amenle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle bie anu, mɔɔ ɛnee Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ lua abɛlɛ ɛya bie anu la, bɛbule na bɛnyekɛle abɛlɛ ne bie na bɛkposale ye wɔ bɛ sa nu na bɛlile.<verse eid="LUK 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mɔɔ Falasiima ne mɔ bie mɔ nwunle ɛhye la, bɛzele kɛ, “Ɛhye ɛnva mɛla adenle nu! Wɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɛlɛbu abɛlɛ wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔtia Dwuuma amaamuo ne la.”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ zele kɛ “Bɛngenga Ngɛlɛlera ne ɔ? Anzɛɛ bɛtɛkengale deɛ mɔɔ Belemgbunli Devidi yɛle ye wɔ mekɛ bie mɔɔ ɛhɔne hunle ye nee ɔ sa zo ne mɔ la ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Ɔhɔle Asɔne Sua Kpole ne akunlu azukponle ne azo na ɔhɔvale ngoane kpanwo ne mɔɔ le Awulae mumua ne deɛ, mɔɔ gyi azukponle ne azo la, na bɔbɔ ɛnee ɛhye tia mɛla ne, noko akee ɔ nee awie mɔ hyɛle na bɛlile.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Eza Gyisɛse vale zɔle zo kɛ, “Mame a le Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne amenle ne a.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle bieko dwule la ɔhɔle ayiasua ne anu kɛ ɔkahile debie, na ɛnee nrenyia bie mɔɔ kokobɛ ɛzɔ ɔ sa fema la wɔ ɛkɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Mɛla Kilehilevolɛma ne mɔ nee Falasiima ne mɔ, guale bɛ nye aze koonwu nleanle ye kɛ saa ɔkɛyɛ nrenyia ne ayile wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ko ne a, amaa ɔlua zo bɛanyia edwɛkɛ bɛaha bɛatia ye.<verse eid="LUK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Na kɛmɔ ɛnee ɔze bɛ adwenle la ati, ɔzele nrenyia kokobɛvolɛ ne kɛ, “Bɛla bagyinla ɛke amaa awie biala anwu wɔ.” Ɔti nrenyia ne noko yɛle ye zɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Akee Gyisɛse zele Falasiima ne mɔ nee Mɛla kilehilevolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Melɛ kpuyia mebiza bɛ. Anzɛɛ ɔfa adenle nu kɛ bɛkɛyɛ boɛ wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne anzɛɛ kɛ bɛkɛyɛ ɛtane ɔ? Kɛ ɛkɛlie ngoane, anzɛɛ kɛ ɛkɛzɛkye ye ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Ɔnleɛnleanle bɛ nyunlu ngoko ngoko na ɔzele nrenyia ne kɛ, “Tenrɛ ɛ sa ne anu.” Na mɔɔ ɔyɛle la, ɔ sa ne yɛle fɔɔnwo kɛ ye dɛba ne la bieko. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ nwunle ɛhye la, bɛvale ɛya kpole, na bɛbɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛfa ɔ nwo akpame kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na bɛ sa aha ye bɛahu ye la.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛye ye ɛdoavolɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Ɛhye anzi ye, ɔrale ye kɛ, kenle ko bie Gyisɛse hɔle awoka ne mɔ azo kɛ ɔkazɛlɛ, na ɔyɛle nzɛlɛlɛ nɔe ne amuala. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Aleɛ hyenle la ɔvɛlɛle ye ɛdoavolɛma tɔka ne, na ɔyele bɛ nuhua bulu nee nwiɔ kɛ bɛyɛ ye suakunlu ɛdoavolɛma. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14-16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14-16" />Bɛ anluma a le ɛhye mɔ: Saemɔn, mɔɔ eza ɔvɛlɛle ye Pita la, Andelu Saemɔn adiema nrenyia ne, Gyemise, Dwɔn, Felepe, Baatɔlomiyu, Mateyu, Tɔmase, Gyemise, mɔɔ le Alefiyɛse ara nrenyia ne, Saemɔn (mɔɔ maanle ne kulo ye la), Dwudase, mɔɔ le Gyemise ara nrenyia ne ɔ nee Dwudase Yesekaleɔto, mɔɔ nzinlii ɔyele Gyisɛse ɔmaanle la.<verse eid="LUK 6:14-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17-19" />Mɔɔ bɛrale boka ne agye nu la, bɛ nee Gyisɛse gyinlanle azɛlɛ sɛlɛsɛlɛ bie azo, mɔɔ ɛnee ye ɛdoavolɛma dɔɔnwo ne ala ɛbɔ ye mgbɔlɛka ɛyia, na bɛdabɛ noko menli ekpunli ekpunli dɔɔnwo ɛbɔ be mgbɔlɛka ɛyia a. Ɛnee menli vi Dwudiya maanle ne anu ɛleka biala nee Gyɛlusalɛm boka Taya nee Saedɛn Sɔlɔ ɛnweanloa ɛra kɛ bɛbadie ye edwɛkɛ ne bie na eza noko bɛamaa yeayɛ bɛ ayile.<verse eid="LUK 6:17-19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Na ɔnleanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ na ɔzele kɛ: “Nyilalɛ ɛha ehyiavolɛma, ɔluakɛ bɛmɛ yɛɛ Nana Nyamenle Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne le bɛ deɛ a! <verse eid="LUK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ ɛhɔne ɛlɛku bɛ kɛkala la, ɔluakɛ bɛ ko bayi! Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛsu kɛkala la, ɔluakɛ mekɛ ne bara mɔɔ bɛbazele na bɛali fɛlɛko a! <verse eid="LUK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ menli kpɔ bɛ la, na bɛkpo bɛ, na bɛtendɛ bɛtia bɛ na bɛsɛkye bɛ duma kɛ bɛle ɛtanevolɛma wɔ Sonla Ra ne duma nu ti la! <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Bɛli fɛlɛko kenle zɔhane, na bɛmaa bɛ nye ɛlie! Ɔluakɛ bɛ ahatualɛ deɛ wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu, na zɔhane ala yɛɛ bɛ ze mɔ yɛle tiale ngapezoma ne mɔ a.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />“Na munzule ɛha sukoavolɛma, ɔluakɛ bɛmɛ bɛnyia bɛ ahatualɛ nee bɛ fɛlɛkolilɛ muala wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo ɛke ala. <verse eid="LUK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Munzule ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ ko ɛyi kɛkala la, ɔluakɛ mekɛ bie ɛlɛba mɔɔ ɛhɔne kpole badɔ bɛ kunlu a. Munzule ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ nye die la, ɔluakɛ mekɛ bie ɛlɛba mɔɔ bɛbali nyane bɛazu bɛaye awolɛ a. <verse eid="LUK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Munzule ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ menli bɔ bɛ duma kpalɛ la, ɔluakɛ kɛ bɛ ze mɔ yɛle maanle ngapezoma adalɛ nabalabama ne mɔ la ɛne.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Bɛdie. Bɛhulo bɛ kpɔvolɛma. Bɛyɛ kpalɛ bɛmaa menli mɔɔ kpɔ bɛ bɔbɔ la. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Bɛyila menli mɔɔ wa bɛ amonle la; na bɛzɛlɛ Nana Nyamenle nyilalɛ bɛmaa menli mɔɔ kɛha bɛ nwo edwɛkɛ ɛtane ɛtane la.<verse eid="LUK 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />“Saa awie bɔ ɛ nzo nu a, maa ɔbɔ ko ne mɔɔ ɛha la noko anu! Saa awie sɛlɛ wɔ kootu ne a, fa wɔ anwuma tɛladeɛ ne boka nwo. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Mɔɔ bɛlɛ ye biala la saa awie sɛlɛ bɛ a bɛva bɛmaa ye; yɛɛ saa awie wua bɛ ninyɛne a, bɛmmadi kɛ ɔkɛzi ɔkɛyɛ na bɛanyia bieko la anwo nyane. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Bɛyɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛhulo kɛ bɛkɛyɛ bɛkɛmaa bɛ la bɛmaa bɛ gɔnwo mɔ noko.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Saa bɛkulo menli mɔɔ kulo bɛ edwɛkɛ la angomekye a, ɛnee duzu nvasoɛ yɛɛ awɔ bɛ ɛhulolɛ ne azo a? Ɔluakɛ ɛtanevolɛma bɔbɔ kulo menli mɔɔ kulo bɛ la. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Saa bɛyɛ kpalɛ bɛmaa menli mɔɔ yɛ kpalɛ maa bɛ la angomekye ala a, duzu nvasoɛ yɛɛ awɔ bɛ kpalɛyɛlɛ ne azo a? Ɔluakɛ ɛtanevolɛma bɔbɔ yɛ zɔhane ala! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Saa bɛbɔ menli bosea na bɛkpa nu bɛbɔ nuhua ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛbɔ bɛ a bɛbadua la angomekye a, ɛnee duzu boɛ a bɛyɛ a? Menli mɔɔ ati ye se la bɔbɔ bɔ bɛ gɔnwo mɔ mɔɔ ati yɛ se la bosea maa bɛsia bɛtua ɔ muala bɛmaa bɛ!<verse eid="LUK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />“Bɛhulo bɛ kpɔvolɛma! Bɛyɛ kpalɛ bɛmaa bɛ! Bɛbɔ bɛ bosea mɔɔ bɛnva bɛ nye bɛndo kɛ bɛkɛzia bɛkɛdua bɛkɛmaa bɛ a. Saa ɛyɛ ɛhye a yɛɛ wɔ ahatualɛ mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la bayɛ kpole a, na eza noko nyɛleɛ ɛhye bahile yɛ nɔhalɛ nu kɛ bɛle Anwuma Nyamenle Bedevinli ne amra: ɔluakɛ Nyamenle le kpalɛ maa anzeayɛlɛma ɔ nee menli mɔɔ ati ɛzɛne ne yɛ ɛsesebɛ kpole kpalɛ la.<verse eid="LUK 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />“Bɛbɔ mɔdenle bɛze anwunvɔne kɛmɔ bɛ Ze mɔɔ wɔ anwuma yɛ ye la. <verse eid="LUK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Bɛmmatendɛ bɛtia awie anzɛɛ bɛmmabu awie fɔlɛ, ɔluakɛ mɔɔ tendɛ tia ɔ gɔnwo la, bɛtendɛ bɛtia ye, yɛɛ mɔɔ bu ɔ gɔnwo fɔlɛ la, bɛbu ɔdaye noko fɔlɛ. Bɛva ɛtane bɛhyɛ na bɛkɛva bɛ ɛtane bɛkɛhyɛ bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Fa ahyɛlɛdeɛ maa, na ɛbanyia ɔ muala mɔnwo mɔnwo dɔɔnwo ne ala. Debie biala mɔɔ ɛbava wɔahyɛ la, saa kpole o, anzɛɛ ekyii o, nwolɛ yɛɛ bɛbanlea bɛazia bɛabɔ nwo bɛamaa wɔ a.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Gyisɛse bule ɛrɛlɛ ɛhye vale hilehilele ye Nyamedwɛkɛ ne anu: kɛ: “Asoo anyezinliravolɛ bahola ahile ɔ gɔnwo anyezinliravolɛ adenle ɔ? Anzɛɛ bɛ mu nwiɔ bɛnrɛdɔ kuma nu ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Kɛ ɔyɛ mɔɔ sonla mɔɔ sukoa nwoma la kola nwu nwoma tɛla ye kilehilevolɛ ne ɛ? Noko akee saa ɔmia ɔ nwo ɛsesebɛ a, ɔkola ɔnwu nwoma kɛ ɔ menle ne ala la.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Duzu ati yɛɛ ɛkola ɛnwu mumunli ne mɔɔ la ɛ diema anye zo la, na ɛngola ɛnnwu mgbunla ne mɔɔ la ɛdawɔ mumua ne ɛ nye zo la ɛ? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Kɛ ɛkɛzi ɛkɛhola ɛkɛha ɛkɛhile ye kɛ, ‘Adiema, maa memboa wɔ memaa ɛye mumunli ne mɔɔ la ɛ nye zo’, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ mgbunla ɛheda ɛ nye la ɛ? Adalɛ nabalaba! Dumua ye mgbunla ne mɔɔ la ɛ nye zo la, na akee ɛ nye zo tete wɔ a akee wɔahola wɔaye mumunli ne mɔɔ la ɛ diema ne ɛdeɛ ne azo la!<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Baka kpalɛ ɛnzo ma ɛtane, na zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ baka ɛtane ɛnzo ma kpalɛ a. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Baka biala ma ne yɛɛ maa bɛkola bɛnwu ye baka holɛ ko a. Akutue ɛngola ɛnzo amango, yɛɛ amango noko ɛngola ɛnzo akutue. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Sonla kpalɛ biala yɛ nyɛleɛ kpalɛ mɔɔ vi ahonle kpalɛ nu la. Sonla mɔɔ ati akunlu le ɛtane la noko yɛ nyɛleɛ ɛtane mɔɔ vea ye ahonle nu la. Mɔɔ wɔ sonla ahonle nu la yɛɛ finde wɔ ye ɛdendɛlɛ nu a.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Duzu ati a ɛfɛlɛ me ‘Awulae’ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛnli me edwɛkɛ zo a? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47-48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47-48" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛba bɛbatie na bɛdi me edwɛkɛ zo la le kɛ nrenyia bie mɔɔ ɛzi ye sua wɔ bolɛ kpole bie azo la. Saa azule yi bonrɛbonra na nzule ne bato si sua ne a, ɔgyi ye kpundii, ɔluakɛ ɔle anwosesebɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:47-48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />“Na menli mɔɔ tie na bɛnli zo la le kɛ nrenyia bie mɔɔ si sua na yeanzi ye wɔ bolɛ zo la. Saa azule yi na ɔbafa sua ne a ɔbubu ye ɔgua ye aze.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Nwanwanendeɛ ngakyile nwiɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse wiele ye edwɛkpa ngilehilenu ne la, ɔziale ɔ nzi ɔhɔle Kapɛnayɛm.<verse eid="LUK 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Mekɛ zɔhane anu ɛnee Wulomu sogya kpanyinli bie akɛlɛ mɔɔ sɔ ɔ nye kpole kpalɛ la ɛnde kpɔkɛ fee mɔɔ ɔdie adenle yeawu a. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Mɔɔ sogya kpanyinli ne dele Gyisɛse nganeɛ la, ɔzoanle Dwuuma mgbanyima bie mɔɔ lɛ duma na eza bɛdi bɛ nwo eni la kɛ bɛhɔze ye kɛ ɔrayɛ ye akɛlɛ ne ayile. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Ɔti bɛrale bɛrabodole Gyisɛse mɛlɛbɛnwoaze nu ala kɛ ɔ nee bɛ ɛhɔ na ɔhɔboa nrenyia ne. Bɛhanle sogya kpanyinli ne ye mɔdenle mɔɔ ɔbɔ ɔmaa bɛ la bɛhilele ye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:4">Bɛzele kɛ, “Saa awie ko hyia wɔ moalɛ a, ɛnee ɔdaye ɔ, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />ɔluakɛ ɔkulo Dwuuma ne mɔ, na eza yebɔ kakɛ yezi ayiasua yemaa yɛ bɔbɔ!”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6-7" />Gyisɛse nee bɛ hɔle. Na mɔɔ ɔka ekyii na bɛawole aako ne anu la, sogya kpanyinli ne zoanle ɔ gɔnwo mɔ kɛ bɛraha bɛhile ye kɛ, “Yɛmenle, mmafonla ɛ nwo kɛ ɛkɛra me aako ye anu, ɔluakɛ memfɛta. Emomu wɔmɔ gyinla ɛleka mɔɔ ɛgyi ala la na ka edwɛkɛ ne, na me akɛlɛ kakula nrenyia ne anwo kɛza. <verse eid="LUK 7:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Meze, ɔluakɛ mewɔ me mgbanyima bo, yɛɛ medame noko melɛ tumi wɔ me azogya nwo zo. Saa mese ko kɛ, ‘Kɔ!’ a, ɔkɔ; yɛɛ mese bieko noko kɛ, ‘Bɛla!’ a, ɔba; saa mese me akɛlɛ ne kɛ, ‘Yɛ ɛhye!’ a, ɔyɛ. Ɔti wɔmɔ ka kɛ, ‘Te kpɔkɛ!’ na me akɛlɛ ne bade kpɔkɛ bieko!”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Gyisɛse dele ɛhye la, ɔyɛle ye azibɛnwo. Ɔhakyile ɔ nye wɔ menli ekpunli ne anwo na ɔzele kɛ, “Metɛnwunle awie ko mɔɔ lɛ diedi kɛ nrenyia ɛhye la bie ɛlɛ wɔ Dwuuma mɔɔ wɔ Yizilayɛ la anu kɛ nrenyia ɛhye.”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Na mɔɔ sogya kpanyinli ne agɔnwo mɔ ziale bɛ nzi hɔle sua nu la, bɛnwunle kɛ akɛlɛ ne ɛde kpɔkɛ bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Na ɔrale ye kɛ, yeangyɛ dɔɔnwo biala, Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ hɔle namule bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Neeyen, la azo. Na kɛmɔ ɔde ala la, menli dɔɔnwo ne ala doale ye. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Na mɔɔ ɔbikyele namule ne anlenkɛ kpole ne anloa la, ɔnwunle kɛ bɛzo awie bie mɔɔ ɛwu, na ɔle ɔ nli ara nrenyia kotokokye la bɛlɛkɔ bɛahɔzie ye; na ɛnee raalɛ ne le kunlavolɛ. Ɛhye ati ɛnee namule ne azo amra dɔɔnwo boka ɔ nwo.<verse eid="LUK 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Mɔɔ Awulae nwunle ye la, ɔlile nyane kpole wɔ ye ahonle nu ɔmaanle ye, na ɔzele raalɛ ne kɛ, “Mmasu!” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Ɔhɔle funli ɛlɛka ne anwo na ɔhɔzɔle nu, na menli mɔɔ ɛnee zo ye la gyinlanle. Ɔhanle kɛ, “Kpavolɛ, mese wɔ kɛ, Dwazo!”<verse eid="LUK 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Ɛkɛ ne ala, kpavolɛ ne dwazole dɛnlanle aze na ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔtendɛ. Akee Gyisɛse ziale vale ye maanle ɔ nli.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Ɛzulolɛ kpole hanle menli ne mɔ kpokpoti; na bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛyele Nyamenle ayɛlɛ bɛzele kɛ, “Kapezonli kpole bie ɛra yɛ avinli,” yɛɛ “Ɛnɛ Nana Nyamenle anye ɛra ye menli anwo zo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Nyɛleɛ zɔhane mɔɔ ɔyɛle ye kenle ko demua ne la nganeɛ pɛle nu Dwudiya maanle ti nee ɔ bo.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse nee Dwɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Yeangyɛ biala Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ dele mɔɔ ɛnee Gyisɛse ɛlɛyɛ la amuala. Mɔɔ bɛhanle bɛhilele Dwɔn la, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />ɔzoanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu nwiɔ wɔ Gyisɛse anwo lɔ kɛ bɛhɔbiza ye kɛ, “Ɛnee wɔmɔ a ɛle sonla holɛ ko ne mɔɔ ɛlɛba la anzɛɛ? Anzɛɛ yɛhɔ zo yɛhendɛ ye ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20-22" />Ɛdoavolɛma nwiɔ ne hɔnwunle kɛ Gyisɛse ɛlɛyɛ wuliravolɛma dɔɔnwo ayile mɔɔ bie mɔ le abuburavoma, bie mɔ le anyenzinliravolɛma, na eza ɔlɛtu sunsum evinli evinli yeavi bie mɔ nu a. Mɔɔ bɛvale Dwɔn kpuyia ne bɛbizale ye la, ɔbuale bɛ ɔzele kɛ: “Bɛzia bɛhɔ Dwɔn anwo lɔ na bɛhɔha mɔɔ bɛnwu ye bɛ nye zo, ɔ nee mɔɔ bɛde ye ɛke ɛnɛ la bɛhile ye kɛsi mɔɔ anyezinliravolɛma ɛnɛ kola nwu debie la; abuburavoma ɛnɛ kola tia bɛ gyakɛ anu mɔɔ bɛnzi ndɛnye a; ahohobɛvolɛ anwo ɛza bɔkɔɔ; anzodiliravolɛma kola te edwɛkɛ bieko; mɔwuamra ɛzia ɛra ngoane nu bieko na ehyiavolɛma ɛlɛtie Nyamenle Edwɛkpa ne. <verse eid="LUK 7:20-22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Na bɛha bɛhile ye kɛ, Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛ diedi wɔ me nu la.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Mɔɔ Dwɔn soavolɛma ne mɔ hɔle la, Gyisɛse hanle Dwɔn anwo edwɛkɛ hilele menli ɛwolaa ne. Ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Duzu a bɛhɔle Dwudiya fiemgbole ne azo kɛ bɛkanlea la? Ɛhonle mɔɔ anwoma ɛlɛbɔ ye amaa yeadeda la: anzɛɛ? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Na duzu ati bɔbɔ a bɛvindele a, kɛ bɛkanlea sonla mɔɔ heda selekye la anzɛɛ? Nea, bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛheda selekye la wɔ arelemgbunli aako nu. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Ɛnee duzu ati bɔbɔ a bɛhɔle a? Kɛ bɛkanlea Awulae Nyamenle kapezonli anzɛɛ? Nɔhalɛ, mese bɛ kɛ, ɔle kpole ɔtɛla kapezonli bɔbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ɔluakɛ Dwɔn a le nrenyia ne mɔɔ bɛha ɔ nwo edwɛkɛ dɛba wɔ Nyamedwɛkɛ Buluku ne anu la ‘Ɛzoavolɛ mɔɔ balumua me nyunlu, na yeabɔ me maleɛ ne anwo nolo, na yeaziezie adenle ne anu yeamaa bɛalie me la.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Wɔ aleɛabo amuala, awie ko biala ɛndɛla Dwɔn kpole. Noko akee wɔ Nyamenle anwuma maanle ne anu sonla ne mɔɔ ye dibilɛ le ekyii kpalɛ la le kpole tɛla ye.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Na bɛdabɛ kpokpoti mɔɔ bɛdele kɛ Dwɔn ɛlɛka Nyamenle edwɛkɛ ne, bɔbɔ adwuledievolɛma ne mɔ liele dole nu kɛ Nyamenle edwɛkɛ ne le nɔhalɛ, ɔboalekɛ bɛvale Dwɔn ye ɛzɔnenlɛ deɛ ne a bɛzɔnenle bɛ a. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Na Falasiima ne mɔ nee kilehilevolɛma mɔɔ kile Mosisi mɛla ne la anlie Nyamenle ngyehyɛlɛ ne ando nu, ɛhye ati bɛamkponle zo bɛammaa Dwɔn anzɔne bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Gyisɛse bizale kɛ, “Duzu a menva adwuliso amra mendo nwo a? Yɛɛ duzu bɔbɔ a bɛzɔho ye a? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Bɛle kɛ ngakula ngyikyi mɔɔ ɛlɛdi nwɔhoa wɔ gua zo, na bɛse bɛ gɔnwo mɔ kɛ, ‘Yɛliele “atɔfolɛ,” na bɛannyia nwolɛ ahomeka; ɔti yɛyɛle “ɛzɛne,” noko akee bɛ rɛle ambɔ.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Kɛmɔ Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne ɛnno nwanye, na mekɛ dɔɔnwo ne ala ɔkye ɛhɔne la ati, bɛse ‘Ɔle abɔnsam!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Na mame Sonla Ra ne noko, meto ɛkponle na meno nza, noko bɛse me kɛ, ‘Mele adidikpokuvolɛ! Eza mele nzanovolɛ! Na me nee ɛtanevolɛma yɛɛ atu a.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Noko akee nrɛlɛbɛvolɛ biala nyɛleɛ a maa bɛkola bɛnwu ye sonla holɛ a.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛkponledolɛ ngakyile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Akee Falasiima ne mɔ anu ko zele Gyisɛse kɛ ɔrɛla ye sua nu ɔmaa bɛdo ɛsalɛ, na Gyisɛse noko kponlenle zo. Mɔɔ bɛdɛnlanle aze kɛ bɛdi debie la, <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />raalɛ ɛtanevolɛ bie dele kɛ Gyisɛse wɔ ɛkɛ ne, ɔti ɔhɔvale alufuanlɛ toba ko ɔrale. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Ɔvale ɛzunlɛ ɔhotole ɔ gyakɛ abonyi zo wɔ Gyisɛse anzi, na ɔvale ɔ nye monle ɔloale Gyisɛse agyakɛ babonle ne anwo; ɔvale ɔ ti enrinli ɔkyikyile na ɔtafele ɔ gyakɛ anwo; akee ɔvale alufuanlɛ ne ɔvɔle ɔ gyakɛ ne mɔ anwo.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Mɔɔ nrenyia Falasiinli ne mɔɔ dole ɛkponle ne maanle Gyisɛse la nwunle ɛhye, na ɔze raalɛ ne subane la, ɔhanle kɛ, “Ɛhye kile kɛ Gyisɛse ɛnle kapezonli, ɔluakɛ saa amgba ala Nana Nyamenle yɛɛ azoanle ye a, anrɛɛ ɔbahola yeanwu raalɛ ɛhye sonla holɛ ko!”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Gyisɛse buale Falasiinli ne zele ye kɛ, “Saemɔn, melɛ edwɛkɛ bie mefa meado ɛ nyunlu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Saemɔn noko yele ɔ nloa kɛ, “Wioo, Kilehilevolɛ duzu edwɛkɛ ɔ? Ka kile me.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Akee Gyisɛse bɔle adawu ɛhye kɛ: “Nrenyia bie bɔle menli nwiɔ bosea; ɔmaanle ko menli ɛya nnu kenle ko ahatualɛ ezukoa, na ɔmaanle ko ne noko menli abulanlu kenle ko ahatualɛ ezukoa. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Na menli nwiɔ ɛhye anu ko bɔbɔ angola andua bosea ne ammaa ye, ɔti ɔvale bɛ mu nwiɔ bɛ nwo ɔhyɛle bɛ! Menli nwiɔ ɛhye boni yɛɛ ɔnea a ɔbanyia nrenyia ne anwo ɛhulolɛ kpole a?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Saemɔn buale zele kɛ, “Medie medi kɛ nuhua ne mɔɔ tua ye ezukoa dɔɔnwo ne la ɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Gyisɛse liele dole nu na ɔzele kɛ, “Mo! Wɔbua boɛ bɔkɔɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Akee ɔhakyile ɔ nye wɔ raalɛ ne anwo, na ɔzele Saemɔn kɛ, “Nea! Se wɔnwu raalɛ ɛhye mɔɔ hoto ɛke la! Mɔɔ membale wɔ sua nu la, yeanvale ɛ nwo bɔbɔ kɛ ɛkɛmaa me nzule ɛkɛmaa menwɔnrinzi me gyakɛ anwo munlutu ne; na yemɔ yeva ɔ nye monle yenrinzi me gyakɛ anwo, na eza yeva ɔ ti enrinli yekyikyi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Ɛkpole kɛ ɛkɛyɛ ɛhulolɛ nwo nyɛleɛ ne ɛkɛmaa me kɛmɔ amaamuo ne se la, na yemɔ sumunli kɛ membale aako ye anu la, ɔtɛgyakyile me gyakɛ taboa ne anwo ɛvolɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Wɔmɔ ɛkpole kɛ ɛkɛva ɔlivi nwole ɛkɛkpokpa me ti avinli ɛkɛli me eni, na yemɔ yewola alufuanlɛ yegua me gyakɛ babonle ne mɔ anwo bɔbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Ɛhye ati mese wɔ kɛ, bɛva ye ɛtane ɛwolaa ne amuala bɛhyɛ ye, ɔboalekɛ ye ɛhulolɛ ne le kpole kpalɛ; na mɔɔ ye ɛhulolɛ le ekyii la, ye ɛtane ekyii bie ala a bɛfa bɛkyɛ ye a.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Na ɔhanle ɔhilele raalɛ ne kɛ, “Bɛva wɔ ɛtane bɛhyɛ wɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Akee menli mɔɔ nee ye dede ɛkponle ne anwo la bizebizale bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko kɛ, “Kɛ nrenyia ɛhye bu ɔ nwo ɛ, mɔɔ ɔkola ɔfa menli ɛtane ɔkyɛ bɛ a?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Na Gyisɛse zele raalɛ ne kɛ, “Wɔ diedi ɛlie wɔ ngoane; kɔ anzondwolɛ nu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Duavolɛ ne anwo adawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Ɛhye mɔ amuala anzi ye, yeangyɛ dɔɔnwo biala, ɔvale ye ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee nwiɔ ne ɔlile ɔ nzi na ɔkpɔsale wɔ azua mgbole nee namunamu mɔɔ wɔ Galeli la azo kɛ, ɔbɔ Nana Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle ne maleɛ ne anwo nolo. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />Mraalɛ bie mɔ mɔɔ yedu sunsum evinli evinli yevi bɛ nu anzɛɛ mɔɔ yeyɛ bɛ ayile la nee ye a hɔle a; bɛ nuhua bie mɔ a le Male mɔɔ vi Magedala, mɔɔ Gyisɛse ɔdaye mumua ne ɔdule sunsum evinli ngakyile nsuu ɔvile ye nu la, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Dwowana, Twuza mɔɔ ɛnee nea belemgbunli Hɛlɔdo gyima, ye belemgbunli aako nee ye Sua nu edwɛkɛ zo aye ne, Susana, ɔ nee menli dɔɔnwo ne ala mɔɔ fa bɛdabɛ bɛ nwo ezukoa bɛnea Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ la.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Kenle ko bie mɔɔ ɛnee menli dɔɔnwo bie ɛyia kɛ bɛbadie ye edwɛkɛ ne bie, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛnee bɛ nuhua dɔɔnwo noko lua adenle nu, bɛvi azua ngakyile ngakyile zo bɛlɛba la, ɔbule ɛrɛlɛ ɛhye ɔzele kɛ:<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Ɛyazonlɛnli bie hɔle ye ɛya nu kɛ ɔkagua ma. Na mɔɔ ɔgua ma ne la, bie guale bɛ gyakɛ abo zo adenle ne anu, na menli tietiale zo; na nloma rale rasusole nuhua ne mɔɔ yemɔ bɛantietia zo la. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Ma ne bie mɔ noko guale azɛlɛ sɛhɛlɛɛ bie mɔɔ awolɛ mgbole yɛɛ awɔ ɔ bo la azo. Ma ɛhye mɔ bɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛfifi, na yeangyɛ biala bɛ nya ne amuala nwosonwosonle na bɛwule, ɔluakɛ bɛannyia nzule. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Ma ne bie mɔ guale mbowule nu, na mɔɔ bɛbɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛfifi la, mbowule ne miemianle bɛ maanle bɛwule. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Bie mɔ noko guale azɛlɛ kpalɛ zo, na bɛfifile na bɛzole ma mɔnwo mɔnwo fane ɛya kɛmɔ ɔluale bɛ la.” Mekɛ mɔɔ ɔbu bɛ ɛrɛlɛ ɛhye la, ɔhanle ɔzɔle zo kɛ, “Bɛmaa menli mɔɔ lɛ ɛnzolɛ tie edwɛkɛ la ɛdie ye kɛkala!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bizale ye ɛrɛlɛ ne abo.<verse eid="LUK 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmɛ Nana Nyamenle ɛmaa bɛ tumi kɛ bɛde mrɛlɛ ɛhye mɔ abo, ɔluakɛ bɛka Nyamenle Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anwo edwɛkɛ dɔɔnwo. Na kɛmɔ mɔmoane ngapezoma ne mɔ hanle dole ye ɛkɛ ne la, menli ekpunli ekpunli ɛhye mɔ te edwɛkɛ ne, noko akee bɛnde ɔ bo.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Ɛrɛlɛ ne abo ɛne: Ma ne a le Nyamenle edwɛkɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Ma ne mɔɔ guale ademgbole ketekete ne azo la gyi ɛkɛ ne maa menli ahonle ɛsesebɛvoma mɔɔ tie Nyamedwɛkɛ ne, na abɔnsam ba baye fi bɛ ahonle ne mɔ anu, na ɔmmaa bɛnlie edwɛkɛ ne bɛnli amaa bɛanyia ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Ma ne mɔɔ guale awolɛ ne azo la gyi ɛkɛ ne maa menli mɔɔ fa fɛlɛkolilɛ tie edwɛkɛ ne, na edwɛkɛ ne ɛngola ɛndɛnla bɛ ahonle ne mɔ anu bɛnva bɛmbɔ bɛ ɛbɛla la. Bɛze kɛ edwɛkɛ ne le nɔhalɛ, na bɛdie bɛdi mekɛ ezinraa bie, na saa sɔnea kpole bie ba bɛ nwo zo ala a, ɛnee bɛkpo aze. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Ma ne mɔɔ guale mbowule nu la a le bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtie na bɛdie Nyamedwɛkɛ ne bɛdi, na nzinlii ye, nyanelilɛ nee anyiabɛnwo boka gyinlabelɛnyialɛ nee ewiade fɛlɛkolilɛ bayeye fi bɛ ahonle nu la. Ɔlua ɛhye ati bɛngola bɛmboa awie biala bɛmmaa ɔnlie Nyamedwɛkɛ ne ɔnli.<verse eid="LUK 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />“Na ma ne mɔɔ guale azɛlɛ kpalɛ ne azo la a le bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfa nɔhalɛ, nee ahonle kpalɛ bɛtie edwɛkɛ ne na bɛsɔ nuhua kpundii bɛfa bɛbɔ bɛ ɛbɛla la.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Akee Gyisɛse bizale kɛ, “Nwane a ɛde ye ɛlɛ kɛ awie ɛzɔ kɛnlaneɛ na yeva debie yeheda zolɛ ammaa yeanda a? Kyɛkyɛ, bɛsie kɛnlaneɛ wɔ anwuma ɛleka wienyi nu amaa awie biala anwu ye. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Ɛhye kile nɔhalɛ ne kɛ, kenle bie debie biala mɔɔ wɔ menli ahonle nu la bala ali. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Ɔti bɛnlea bɛ nwo boɛ wɔ kɛ bɛsi bɛtie edwɛkɛ la; ɔluakɛ awie ko biala mɔɔ lɛ bie la, yemɔ yɛɛ bɛbamaa ye bie dɔɔnwo a; na mɔɔ ɛnlɛ bie la, ekyi ne bɔbɔ mɔɔ ɔlɛ ye la bɛbaza ye bɛalie.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Na ɔrale kɛ, kenle ko bie, mɔɔ ɔ nli nee ɔ mediema mrenyia ne mɔ hɔle kɛ bɛkanlea ye la, bɛangola bɛangɔ ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne, ɔluakɛ ɛnee menli ekpunli ekpunli dɔɔnwo wɔ ɔ nwo ɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Bɛzele ye kɛ, “Ɛ nli nee ɛ mediema ne mɔ gyigyi alie nwo nehane ɛlɛkpondɛ wɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Ɔbuale bɛ ɔzele kɛ, “Ɔmɔ nee me mediema a le menli mɔɔ tie Nyamedwɛkɛ ne na bɛdi zolɛ la.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛha ahumu aze fɛɛnye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Kenle ko bie, Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ vole ɛlɛne nu, na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmaa yɛpɛ azule tandane ne yɛhɔ ɔ nzi nehane.” <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Mɔɔ bɛpɛ azule ne la nafelɛ vale ye, na mekɛ mɔɔ ɔwɔ nafelɛ nu la, ahumu kpole bie bɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔtu. Na bɛ ɛlɛne ne bɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔsia.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Bɛdule bɛhɔle ɔ nwo zo bɛhɔdunwuele ye bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Yɛmenle, Yɛmenle, yɛlɛnoma!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Ɔdwazole ɔdendɛle na ɔbɛlale anwoma ne nu ɔzele kɛ, “Ka aze fɛɛnye,” na anwoma ne nee azɛlɛkye ne mɔ hanle aze na ɛkɛ ne yɛle kɛnlanana zɛhae! <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Akee ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛ diedi wɔ nienwu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Ɛzulolɛ kpole hanle bɛ eza ɔyɛle bɛ azibɛnwo na bɛbizale bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko kɛ, “Duzu sonla a le ɛhye, mɔɔ anwoma nee ahumu nee azɛlɛkye bɔbɔ tie ye a?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Amozi ye, bɛpɛle azule tandane ne bɛvile Galeli bɛhɔle Gɛlasa maanle nu, na bɛhɔdwule ɔ nzi. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Mekɛ mɔɔ ɔvi ɛlɛne ne anu ɔdwu aze la, nrenyia bie mɔɔ sunsum evinli ɛva ye ɛhye na ɔvi sua kpole bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Gɛlasa la azo la yiale ye. Nrenyia ɛhye ɛnlɛ aako biala; yɛɛ eza ɔlɛ ɔ nwo zɔ. Yeanga ye zɔ, ɔde aziezo. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Ɔ nye bɔle Gyisɛse anwo zo ala la, ɔdeɛdeanle nu na ɔbutule aze wɔ ɔ nyunlu ɛkɛ ne ɔzele kɛ, “Duzu debie a ɛkpondɛ wɔavi me ɛkɛ a, Gyisɛse, Anwuma Nyamenle Bedevinli Ra? Yɛmenle, mebodo wɔ, mmayɛ me ayɛkayɛkadeɛ!”<verse eid="LUK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Ɛnee Gyisɛse ɛlɛtu sunsum evinli ne mɔɔ wɔ ye nu la. Saa ɔdwu mekɛ ne bie na sunsum evinli zɔhane bawolo nrenyia ne nu wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛnee bɛgua ye nwɔnzɔnwɔnzɔ bɔbɔ la a, ɔtete nu ɔdie ɔ nwo na ɔriandi ɔkɔtɔ fiemgbole ne azo. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Gyisɛse bizale sunsum evinli ne kɛ, “Kɛ bɛfɛlɛ wɔ ɛ?” Sunsum evinli ne buale zele kɛ, “Ɛlɔne”, ɔluakɛ ɛnee sunsum evinli dɔɔnwo ɛwolo ye nu. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Mbɔnsam ne mɔ bodole ye kɛ ɔmmatu bɛ ɔgua kuma kulongulo ne anu.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Ɛnee agbolike kpolane bie wɔ adidi wɔ awoka bie mɔɔ bikye ɛkɛ ne la agye nu, ɛhye ati sunsum evinli ne mɔ bodole ye kɛ ɔmaa bɛhɔwolowolo agbolike kpolane ne mɔ anu. Ɔti Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Wioo, bɛhɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Ɛkɛ ne ala bɛvile nrenyia ne nu, na bɛhɔwolole agbolike kpolane ne mɔ anu, na ɛkɛ ne ala agbolike kpolane ne amuala dule twi bɛwulule pemgbɛne ne na bɛguale nyevile ne anu bɛwule. <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Agbolikeneavolɛma ne mɔ vale ɛnriandinlɛ hɔle sua kpole ne mɔɔ bikye bɛ la nee awoka ne mɔ azo, na mɔɔ bɛkɔ la ɛnee bɛlɛka mɔɔ bɛnwu ye la anwo edwɛkɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Yeangyɛ biala menli ekpunli dɔɔnwo bie rale kɛ bɛbanlea mɔɔ ɛzi la bɛ nye zo, na mɔɔ amgba noko bɛnwunle ye la a le kɛ, nrenyia ne mɔɔ ɛnee sunsum evinli ne ɛwolo ye nuhua la heda ɛdanlɛ, yezia yera ye dɛba nu, na ɔde Gyisɛse anyunlu ɛkɛ ne koonwu. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Menli mɔɔ ze ye na bɛnwunle kɛsi mɔɔ bɛyɛle ye ayile la hanle ɔ nwo edwɛkɛ hilele menli mɔɔ rale amozi ye la. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Akee menli ne bodole Gyisɛse kɛ ɔvi bɛ maanle ne anu ɔhɔ ɔluakɛ ɛnee ɛzulolɛ kpole ɛha bɛ. Ɔti ɔziale ɔ nzi ɔhɔvole ɛlɛne ne anu ɔpɛle azule tandane ne ɔhɔle ɔ nzi lɔ.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Nrenyia ne mɔɔ sunsum evinli ne vile ye nu minlinle la, bodole ye kɛ ɔ nee ye kɔ na Gyisɛse amkponle zolɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />Gyisɛse gyakyile ye adenle, na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Sia ɛ nzi kɔ wɔ mbusuafo anwo lɔ, na kɔha nwanwanedeɛ kpole ɛhye mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛyɛ ɛmaa wɔ la kile bɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Ɛhye ati ɔzile nu ɔhɔle, na ɔhɔhanle nwanwanedeɛ bedevinli ne mɔɔ Gyisɛse ɛyɛ ɛmaa ye la wɔ sua ne azo amuala.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔvile ewule nu ɔrale ngoane nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Wɔ azule tandane ne anzi nehane, menli ekpunli ekpunli ne mɔɔ ɛnee ɛhendɛ ye ɛhyɛ la liele ye awawatuu.<verse eid="LUK 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Ɔrale ye kɛ, nrenyia bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Gyeeyaelɛse, mɔɔ le Dwuuma ayiasua ne anu kpanyinli la rale, na ɔdule ɔdɔle aze wɔ Gyisɛse anyunlu ɔzɛlɛle ye kɛ, ɔ nee ye ɛhɔ ye sua nu, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />ɔluakɛ ɔ ra ralɛ raalɛ ekyi kokye, mɔɔ ɛli ɛvolɛ bulu nee nwiɔ la, ɛlɛdie ewule awu. Gyisɛse vale menli ekpunli ekpunli ne avinli na ɔ nee ye hɔle.<verse eid="LUK 8:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43-44" />Na mɔɔ bɛkɔ la, raalɛ bie mɔɔ mogya ɛdu ye dedee ɛvolɛ bulu nee nwiɔ, na awie biala ɛngola ye ayile yɛ la lile ɔ nzi; ɔzɔle Gyisɛse tɛladeɛ ne anloa, na ɛkɛ ne ala mogya ne mɔɔ tu ye la gyakyile.<verse eid="LUK 8:43-44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Gyisɛse bizale kɛ, “Nwane a zɔle me la?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Awie ko biala zale ɔ ne kɛ tɛ ɔdaye ɔ. Pita hanle kɛ, “Yɛmenle, ɛdawɔ ɛze kɛ menli pemgbenlamgbe ɛhomo yɛ nwo zo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ, awie anyefuu a zɔle me a, ɔluakɛ mete ye wɔ me nu kɛ me tumi ne azo ɛde.”<verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Mɔɔ raalɛ ne nwunle kɛ Gyisɛse ɛnwu mɔɔ ɛzi la, ɔvale anwowozolɛ ɔrahotole aze wɔ Gyisɛse anyunlu, na ɔhanle deɛmɔti mɔɔ ɔzɔle ye nu la, na ɔhanle kɛsi mɔɔ akee yede kpɔkɛ arɛlevilɛ nu la ɔhile ye wɔ menli ne kpokpoti anyunlu.<verse eid="LUK 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Bɛlɛra, wɔ diedi ɛmaa wɔde kpɔkɛ. Kɔ anzondwolɛ nu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Mɔɔ ɔ nloa wɔ zo ɔtendɛ ɔkile ye la, awie vi Gyeeyaelɛse aako nu rale rabɔle ye amaneɛ zele kɛ, “Ɛ ra raalɛ ne ɛwu. Ɔngyia kɛ ɛkɛgyegye Kilehilevolɛ ne bieko.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse dele ɛhye la, ɔzele kɛ, “Mmasulo! Wɔmɔ die me di, na ɔbade kpɔkɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Mɔɔ bɛhɔdwule Gyeeyaelɛse aako ne anu la, Gyisɛse ammaa awie biala adenle ammaa ɔ nee ye angɔ ekpumgbunli ne anu, kyesɛ Pita, Dwɔn nee Gyemise, boka kakula ne ɔ ze nee ɔ nli. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Mekɛ ɛhye anu ɛnee menli ne amuala mɔɔ wɔ aako ne anu la ɛlɛsu ye awolɛ. Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmmasu! Ɔtɛwule; yela ala!” <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Ɛhye maanle bɛzile ye amgbu na bɛzelele ye, ɔluakɛ bɛ muala bɛze kɛ yewu.<verse eid="LUK 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Gyisɛse zɔle bɛlɛra ne asa na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Bɛlɛra, dwazo!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Na ɛkɛ ne ala ɔ nye zo tetele ye, na ɔwulule ɔgyinlanle! Akee Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Bɛmaa ye aleɛ ɔli!” <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Edwɛkɛ ne yɛle bɛlɛra ne ye awovolɛma ne mɔ azibɛnwo totohyia, na akee bɛnyianle ahomeka molozo, na emomu Gyisɛse bɔle be nloa kɛ bɛmmaka mɔɔ yeyɛ mɔɔ bɛnwu ye la bɛkile awie biala.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Kenle ko bie, Gyisɛse vɛlɛle ye ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee nwiɔ ne ɔboale bɛ nloa, na ɔmaanle bɛ anwosesebɛ, akɛnrazilɛ, nee tumi wɔ mbɔnsam nwo zo, tumi mɔɔ bɛfa bɛtu bɛ, ɔ nee mɔɔ eza bɛkola bɛfa bɛtondo ewule ngakyile biala a. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Akee ɔzoanle bɛ kɛ bɛhɔha Nana Nyamenle Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anwo edwɛkɛ bɛhile aleɛabo amra kosooti, na bɛyɛ wuliravolɛma ayile.<verse eid="LUK 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Ɔzele bɛ wɔ tumi nu ala kɛ, “Bɛmmafa debie biala, bɔbɔ kpɔma, anzɛɛ kodoku, anzɛɛ aleɛ, anzɛɛ ezukoa bɛdɛ bɛ sa nu. Bɛmmafa adɛladeɛ mɔɔ bo ko bɔbɔ la bɛtu adenle ne. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Bɛkɔ sua anzɛɛ namule biala azo a, bɛzokoɛ aako kokye ala anu, na bɛdɛnla ɛkɛ ne ala kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛvi ɛkɛ la.<verse eid="LUK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />“Sua biala mɔɔ bɛkɛhɔ zo mɔɔ ye menli anlie bɛ la, saa bɛvi ɛkɛ ne bɛbahɔ a, bɛkpokpo bɛ gyakɛ abo munlutu bɛgua ɛkɛ ne bɛva bɛli daselɛ bɛtia bɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Ɔti bɛbɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛkpɔsɛkpɔsa namunamu ne mɔ azo, na bɛka Nyamenle edwɛkɛ ne, eza noko bɛyɛ wuliravolɛma ayile.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔyɛ Hɛlɔdo nee menli dɔɔnwo azibɛnwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Mɔɔ amɛnlado Hɛlɔdo dele nwanwane ninyɛne mɔɔ Gyisɛse ɛlɛyɛ la, ɔyɛle ye atetee somaa ne ala, na eza ye adwenle yɛle ye kpomgbondee, ɔluakɛ ɛnee menli ɛlɛkeha ye kɛ, “Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne a ɛvi ewule nu ɛdwazo la”; <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />yɛɛ bie mɔɔ noko zele kɛ, “Yilaegya anzɛɛ mɔmoane ngapezoma ne mɔ anu bie a ɛvi ewule ne ɛdwazo la.” Mekɛ ne anu ɛnee huhuhuhu ɛhye mɔ amuala ɛlɛkɔ zo wɔ maanle ne anu.<verse eid="LUK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Hɛlɔdo hanle kɛ, “Mempɛle Dwɔn ati, na nwane a le sonla ɛhye mɔɔ metɛte ɔ nwo edwɛkɛ ɛzulolɛ ɛzulolɛ zɛhae la?” Na ɔbɔle mɔdenle kɛ ɔbanwu sonla holɛ ko ne.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Mɔɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ziale rale Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ ne rahanle mɔɔ bɛyɛ la hilele ye la, ɔwolole bɛ sa abo nyaa na ɔ nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bɔle bɛ ti wɔ Bɛteseeyeda sua kpole ne azo. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Na menli ekpunli ekpunli ne nwunle ɛleka mɔɔ ɔlɛkɔ la, na bɛdoale ye. Ɔliele bɛ ɔ sa amu nwiɔ, ɔhilehilele bɛ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anwo edwɛkɛ, na ɔyɛle nuhua ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛnde kpɔkɛ la ayile.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Mɔɔ sɛnzɛne ne ɛlɛba aratolo la, ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee nwiɔ, ne amuala hɔle ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne, na bɛhɔzele ye kɛ ɔmaa menli ne bie mɔ ɛhɔ namunamu ɔ nee ɛya ɛya mɔɔ bikye bɛ la anu bɛhɔkpondɛ aleɛ nee dabelɛ bɛhendɛ aledwolɛ ne. Bɛhanle kɛ, “Debie biala ɛnle azɛlɛ ye mɔɔ menli ɛdu ɛvi zo la azo mɔɔ menli ne bali a.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ zele kɛ, “Bɛmɛ bɛmaa bɛ aleɛ!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Bɛannyia ye ndelebɛbo, ɔti bɛ nee ye zule kpolera bɛhanle kɛ, “Na duzu ɔ, yɛlɛ kpanwo dolɔfo nnu ɔ nee fɛlɛ nwiɔ wɔ ɛke, na emomu ɔnrɛza menli dɔɔnwo ɛhye; anzɛɛ ɛkulo kɛ yɛkɔ yɛkɔtɔ aleɛ dɔɔnwo yɛmaa bɛ ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Ɔluakɛ ɛnee menli mɔɔ wɔ ɛkɛ ne la kɛdwu kɛyɛ apenle nnu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Gyisɛse buale bɛ zele kɛ, “Wɔmɔ ka kile menli ne kɛ bɛdɛnlɛdɛnla aze ekpunli kɛyɛ abulanlu abulanlu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Na bɛyɛle ye zɔ.<verse eid="LUK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Gyisɛse vale kpanwo dolɔfo nnu ne boka fɛlɛ nwiɔ ne na ɔnleanle anwomanyunlu ɔyɛle mo. Akee ɔbubule kpanwo ne anu nzokenzoka na ɔvale ɔmaanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ bɛva bɛmaa menli ekpunli ekpunli ne mɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Na awie biala lile bie maanle ɔ ko yile tɛkɛɛ; bɔbɔ eza bɛnyianle ɔ bo zo mgbokpoleka ahɛndɛne bulu nee nwiɔ!<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Kenle ko bie mɔɔ ɛnee ɔ ngome ɔlɛyɛ nzɛlɛlɛ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛnee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bikye ye la, ɔhɔle bɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne na ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Kɛ menli si dwenle me ɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Bɛbuale ye bɛzele kɛ, “Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne. Bie mɔ noko se, Yilaegya ɔ, yɛɛ mɔɔ ɛha la se mɔmoane ngapezoma ne mɔ anu ko mɔɔ vi ewule nu ɛdwazo la ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Akee ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛdwenle kɛ nwane a le me?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Pita buale zele kɛ, “Ngoanedievolɛ, Kelaese mɔɔ le Nyamenle Ra ne la ɔ!”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Ɔbɔle bɛ nloa kɛ, bɛmmaka ɛhye bɛkile awie biala. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Ɔhanle kɛ, “Ɔwɔ kɛ Mame Sonla Ra ne menwu nyane dɔɔnwo, na eza noko Dwuuma mgbanyima mɔɔ li bɛ asɔne ne ati boka maanle mgbanyima, azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima, nee Mɛla kilehilevolɛma ne mɔ kpo me, na bɛku me; na ye kenle nsa anzi, mebadwazo meavi ewule nu meara ngoane nu bieko!”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Akee ɔhanle ɔhilele bɛ muala kɛ, “Bɛ nuhua ko biala mɔɔ kulo kɛ ɔtoa me bo zo la ɔwɔ kɛ fa ye ɛhulolɛdeɛ nee ye anyelielɛ muala sie ahanle, na ɔsoa ye meanubaka ne dahuu ɔbikye me! <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Bɛ nuhua biala mɔɔ ɔlua me ti ɔkɛhwele ye ngoane la, ɔ sa baha ye, na emomu nuhua biala mɔɔ kɛbɔ mɔdenle kɛgyinla zo ɛsesebɛ kɛ ɔfa ye ngoane yeazie la ɔkɛhwele ye. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Na duzu nvasoɛ yɛɛ awɔ ɛkɛ ne maa sonla, kɛ ɔkɛnyia ewiade ye ninyɛne muala na ɔkɛminli ye ɛkɛla a?<verse eid="LUK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />“Awie biala mɔɔ kɛze nyiane wɔ me nee me edwɛkɛ ne anwo la, saa medame Sonla Ra ne mesia meba wɔ me anyunlunyia nee Egya ne anyunlunyia nu nee anwumabɔvolɛma nwuanzanwuanzama ne mɔ duma nu a, mebaze ye nyiane zɔhane ala. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Nɔhalɛ sikalɛ ne a le kɛ, bɛ nuhua bie mɔ mɔɔ gyigyi ɛke kɛkala la ɛnrɛnwu ewule ɛlɛ, kyesɛ bɛnwu Nana Nyamenle Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne!”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse wɔ ye anyunlunyia nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Kenle mɔtwɛ pɛle nu zenle la, ɔvale Pita, Gyemise, nee Dwɔn ɔhɔle awoka ne mɔ azo kɛ ɔkazɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Na mɔɔ ɔyɛ nzɛlɛlɛ ne la, ɔ nyunlu bɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔta, na ye adɛladeɛ ne mɔ dale yɛle fufule nwohyee kɛ asukɔntweaba. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Ɛkɛ ne ala, menli nwiɔ, Mosisi nee Yilaegya, vindele ɛkɛ na bɛbɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛ nee ye tendɛ! <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Bɛ nwo te bɔkɔɔ wɔ anyunlunyia nu, na ɛnee bɛlɛdi ye ewule ne mɔɔ ɔbawu wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm kɛmɔ Nyamenle ngyehyɛleɛ ne se la anwo adwelie.<verse eid="LUK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Ɛnee Pita nee ɔ sa zo bɛmɛ nafelɛ ɛsosɔ bɛ nye kpomgbondee zɛhae ala. Ɔti ɛnee bɛla. Na mɔɔ bɛdwazole la, bɛnwunle kɛ Gyisɛse anyunlu ɛlɛta wienyi wɔ anyunlunyia nu, na menli nwiɔ gyi ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Mɔɔ Mosisi nee Yilaegya bɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛtwe bɛ nwo la, Pita, mɔɔ ɛnee ye adwenle ɛha ɛbɔ nu na ɔnnwu mɔɔ ɔlɛka la deanle nu zele kɛ, “Awulae, ɛhye yɛ azibɛnwo! Yɛbabɔ kpɔda nsa; wɔ deɛ ko, Mosisi deɛ ko, yɛɛ Yilaegya noko deɛ ko!”<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Na mɔɔ ɔ nloa wɔ zo ɔtendɛ la, amungu rahedale bɛ ti zo; na ɛzulolɛ kpole hanle bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Na ɛnelɛ bie vi amungu ne anu zele kɛ, “Ɛhye a le me Ra ne mɔɔ mekulo ye la; bɛdie ye.”<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Na mɔɔ ɛnelɛ ne gyakyile la, Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ angome a hale ɛkɛ ne a. Bɛanga edwɛkɛ mɔɔ zile ɛkɛ ne la bɛangile awie biala dedee ɔhyɛle kpalɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛra azɛlɛ ye azo bieko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Aleɛ hyenle mɔɔ bɛvi boka ne azo bɛdwu aze la, menli ekpunli bie nee ye yiale, <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />na nrenyia ko mɔɔ boka menli ekpunli ne anwo la deanle nu zele kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, mebodo wɔ, nea me ra ye, menlɛ bɛ nwiɔ, <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />na sunsum evinli bawolo ye nu, ɔmaa ɔkponle, na eza ɔmaa ɔfuandivuandi ɔ nwo kɛ asɛɛ anwuma ɛdɔ ɔ nwo zo la, na eza ɔ nloa pɛ awubue; dahuu biala ɔka ye mɔɔ ɔmmaa ɔnnyia ɔ nwo adenle a. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Membodole wɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ bɛdu sunsum evinli ne bɛvi ye nu, noko akee bɛangola.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Gyisɛse zele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Ao, bɛmɛ gyegyeravolɛma mɔɔ bɛnlɛ diedi a! Me nee bɛ ɛdɛnla na menzi bɛ nwo abotane mengɔndwu kenle nzu? Fa ɛ ra ne bɛla ɛke.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Mɔɔ kakula ne kɔ la, sunsum evinli ne pɛle ye finle aze, na ɔmaanle ɔvuandivuandinle ɔ nwo kɛ asɛɛ anwuma ɛdɔ ɔ nwo zo la. Gyisɛse deanle sunsum evinli ne nu maanle ɔvile ye nu ɔvindele, na ɔyɛle ye ayile ɛkɛ ne ala ɔvale ye ɔmaanle ɔ ze.<verse eid="LUK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Ɛzulolɛ hanle menli ne wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ bɛnwunle kɛ Nyamenle tumi ne ɛlɛyɛ ye gyima la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Mekɛ mɔɔ bɛkeha nwanwane ninyɛne mɔɔ Gyisɛse ɛlɛyɛ la, ɔzele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Bɛdie me, na bɛhakye mɔɔ meka la. Bɛbaye Mame Sonla Ra ne bɛamaa.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ande mɔɔ ɔka la abo, ɔluakɛ ɛnee bɛ adwenle ɛminli bɛ na eza bɛsulo kɛ bɛkɛbiza ye.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Akee kpolera zile bɛ avinli mɔɔ fale bɛ nuhua ko ne mɔɔ bayɛ kpole wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne mɔɔ ɛlɛba la anu la. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Na kɛmɔ Gyisɛse ze bɛ adwenle la ati, ɔvale kakula ekyi bie ɔziele ɔ nwo ɛkɛ, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Awie biala mɔɔ kɛlie kakula ekyi ɛhye wɔ me duma nu la, ɛnee yelie medame mumua ne! Yɛɛ awie biala noko mɔɔ kɛlie me la, ɛnee yelie Nana Nyamenle ne mɔɔ zoanle me la. Na mɔɔ le bɛ nuhua kakula la yemɔ a le kpole a.” <verse eid="LUK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Dwɔn, mɔɔ le ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu ko la hɔle ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Yɛmenle, yɛnwunle awie ko mɔɔ ɛlɛfa wɔ duma adu sunsum evinli evinli avi menli nu a. Na yɛzele ye kɛ ɔgyakyi. Ɔluakɛ ɔyɛ biala a, ɔmboka yɛ ekpunli ne anwo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Na Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Anrɛɛ ɔnle kɛ bɛyɛ zɔhane! Ɔluakɛ awie ko biala mɔɔ ɛngo ɛntia wɔ la ɛnee ɔwɔ wɔ afoa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Mekɛ mɔɔ ye anwuma maanle nu ɛhɔlɛ ne bikyele la, ɔdule ɔdenrɛle kɛ ɔkɔ Gyɛlusalɛm<verse eid="LUK 9:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Ɔzoanle menli lumuale ɔ nyunlu wɔ Samɛlea namule bie azo kɛ bɛhɔkpondɛ sua mɔɔ bɛkɔ a bɛbala nu la bɛzie ye ɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Na mɔɔ bɛhɔle la bɛvoanle bɛ! Menli mɔɔ wɔ namule ne azo la amkponle zo kɛ bɛkɛmaa bɛ dabelɛ, ɔluakɛ ɛnee Gyɛlusalɛm yɛɛ bɛlɛkɔ a.<verse eid="LUK 9:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Mɔɔ Gyemise nee Dwɔn dele mɔɔ zile la, bɛhanle bɛhilele Gyisɛse kɛ, “Awulae, asoo ɔle kpalɛ kɛ yɛkɛmaa adenle yɛkɛmaa senle vi anwuma kɛrayela menli ne amuala ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Na Gyisɛse angulo ɛhye, ɔti ɔdeanle bɛ, <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />na bɛhɔle namule gyɛne bieko azo.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Mɔɔ bɛlua bɛkɔ la, awie ko hanle hilele Gyisɛse kɛ, “Ɛleka biala mɔɔ ɛbahɔ la mebadoa wɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Na Gyisɛse buale ye zele kɛ, “Kakye kɛ, Menlɛ me ti anwo ɛleka bɔbɔ mɔɔ mefa me ti meto a. Nane ɛzonlɛ mɔ lɛ bɛ adunli mɔɔ bɛda nu a, yɛɛ nloma lɛ bɛ sane, na Mame, Sonla Ra ne, menlɛ aako biala fee wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Mekɛ guale nu bie la, eza ɔzele nrenyia bie kɛ, “Bɛla badoa me.” Na nrenyia ne zele ye kɛ, “Maa menumua mengɔ mengɔnzie egya kolaa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Gyisɛse buale zele kɛ, “Maa sunsum nu mɔwuamra ɛzie bɛ nwo. Na wɔmɔ, kɔ na kɔha Nana Nyamenle Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anwo edwɛkɛ kile ewiade amra amuala.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Na awie bieko noko ɔdaye ɔhanle kɛ, “Ɛhɛe, Awulae, mebara, na emomu maa menumua menzɛlɛ menli mɔɔ wɔ sua nu la adenle.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Awie biala mɔɔ kɛmaa ye adwenle kɛvi gyima mɔɔ mehyehyɛ memaa ye la azo la ɛnfɛta kɛ ɔkɛdɛnla Nana Nyamenle belemgbunli maanle ne anu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛzoa ye boavolɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Awulae akee yele ɛdoavolɛma abulasuu na ɔzoanle bɛ nwiɔ, nwiɔ wɔ azua ngyikyi nee mgbole mɔɔ yehyehyɛ kɛ ɔbahɔ zolɛ la azo.<verse eid="LUK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Akee Awulae zele bɛ kɛ: “Bɛzɛlɛ Awulae mɔɔ ye aleɛbulɛ mekɛ ne ɛdwu la kɛ aleɛ ne mɔɔ ɛra ɛya ne anu la zonle, na ɛkpavoma ne mɔ anzo. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Bɛhɔ kɛkala, na emomu bɛhakye kɛ melɛsoa bɛ kɛ mboane wɔ mbɛdi avinli. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Bɛmmafa ezukoa biala anzɛɛ koduku, anzɛɛ bɛ gyakɛ mgbɔlaboa mgbane bɔbɔ. Eza bɛmmabiza awie biala ahye wɔ adenle nu.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />“Aako biala mɔɔ bɛkɛwolo nuhua la, bɛze kɛ, ‘Anzondwolɛ ɛha aako ɛhye anu amra.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Saa aako ne fɛta anzondwolɛ ne a, anzondwolɛ ne baha ɛkɛ ne; na saa ɔnfɛta ɛdeɛ a, yemɔ ɔbazia ɔ nzi yeara bɛ ɛkɛ ne bieko.<verse eid="LUK 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />“Saa bɛkɔ namule ko azo a, bɛmmafi aako ko anu bɛkɔ bieko anu, na emomu bɛdɛnla ɛleka ko, bɛli na eza bɛnlo debie biala mɔɔ bɛkɛva bɛkɛmaa bɛ la, na bɛmmabiza nwolɛ edwɛkɛ biala. Eza noko boɛ biala mɔɔ awie biala kɛyɛ bɛ la bɛmmakpokpo bɛ ti, ɔluakɛ awie biala didi ye gyima nwo.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8-9" />“Saa bɛkɔ sua bie azo na ɛkɛ ne amra die bɛ to nu a, bɛli mɛla ɛhye mɔ azo; (1) Aleɛ biala mɔɔ bɛkɛva bɛkɛmaa bɛ la bɛli. (2) Bɛyɛ wuliravolɛma ayile; na wɔ mekɛ ko ne ala anu mɔɔ bɛyɛ ayile la bɛha ye kɛ, ‘Nana Nyamenle Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne ɛbikye wɔ.’<verse eid="LUK 10:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />“Na emomu sua biala mɔɔ bɛkɛhɔ zo na bɛanlie bɛ bɛando nu la, bɛhɔ ye awɔndenle ne mɔ azo na bɛha ye kɛ, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Bɔbɔ bɛ sua ye azo munlutu ne mɔɔ ɛha yɛ gyakɛ anwo la, yɛkpokpo yɛgua bɛ ti zo. Bɛhakye kɛ Nana Nyamenle Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne ɛbikye!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Sodɔm sua ne mɔɔ azo menli ɛnee le atisesebɛvoma bɔbɔ la ɛnrɛnwu amaneɛ kɛ sua ɛhye la wɔ Ndɛnebualɛ Kenle ne. <verse eid="LUK 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Munzule kpole ɛha Koleezen! Munzule kpole ɛha Bɛteseeyeda! Ɔluakɛ saa menyɛle nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ menyɛle memaanle bɛ la wɔ azua Taya nee Saedɛn azo a, anrɛɛ zolɛ ezuavolɛ hedale ɛrele, na bɛvuandinle nzonle bɛguale bɛ ti zo bɛdɛnlanle aze koonwu bɛlile nyane bɛvale bɛhilele bɛ anlubɛnwo mɔɔ bɛnyia ye la. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Nɔhalɛ nu, ɔbavuanyi Taya nee Saedɛn ɛtane ahatualɛ nwo ndeanlɛ ne yeadɛla bɛ deɛ ne wɔ Ndɛnebualɛ Kenle ne. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Na bɛmɛ Kapɛnayɛm amra, bɛdwenle kɛ bɛbanyia gyinlabelɛ kpole ɔ? Kyɛkyɛ, bɛ nee bɛ bahɔ abɔnsam senle nu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Akee ɔhanle ɔhilele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Menli mɔɔ kɛlie bɛ kɛdo nu la ɛnee bɛlie medame noko bɛdo nu. Menli mɔɔ kɛkpo bɛ la ɛnee bɛkpo me. Menli mɔɔ kɛkpo me la ɛnee bɛkpo Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ zoanle me la.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Mɔɔ ɛdoavolɛma abulasuu ne ziale rale la, bɛrabɔle ye amaneɛ ahomeka nu ala kɛ, “Awulae, saa yɛbɔ wɔ duma na mbɔnsam bɔbɔ te a bɛngola ɛhwee yɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Ɛhɛe, menwunle kɛ Abɔnsam vi anwuma ɛlɛba aradɔ aze kɛ ɛsɛlɛmanye! <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Eza noko memaa bɛ tumi wɔ kpɔvolɛma anwo zo, amaa bɛahola bɛatietia nwɔlɛ nee nyamenleakɛlɛ nwo zo bɛabɛtɛbɛtɛ bɛ, mɔɔ ɛhwee ɛnrɛyɛ bɛ a! <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Bɛmmadi fɛlɛko kɛ bɛlɛ tumi wɔ mbɔnsam nwo zo. Emomu bɛli fɛlɛko kɛ bɛhɛlɛ bɛ anluma kɛ bɛle anwuma maanle ne anu amra.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Ɛkɛ ne ala ɔlile fɛlɛko wɔ Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne nu, na ɔzele kɛ, “Meyɛ wɔ mo, O Egya, Awulae mɔɔ bɔle anwuma nee aze, kɛ wɔye ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ wɔvea menli mɔɔ ze nwoma nee ewiade ye anu nrɛlɛbɛ kpole kpokpoti, na wɔye bɛ wɔhile menli mɔɔ ɛdie bɛ ɛdi kɛ ngakula ngyikyi ɛhye mɔ la a. Nɔhalɛ, Egya, yɛyɛ wɔ mo, ɔluakɛ kɛ ɛkulo ye la ɛne. <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Mame a megyi Egya agyakɛ anu wɔ debie biala anu a; na awie biala ɛnze Sonla Ra ne, kyesɛ Selɛ ne angomekye, yɛɛ awie biala noko ɛnze Selɛ ne kyesɛ Sonla Ra ne angomekye ala, ɔ nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ Sonla Ra ne kulo kɛ bɛte ɔ nwo edwɛkɛ la.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Akee ɔguale ɔ nye aze bɛtɛɛ na ɔzele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Bɛ ti ɛyɛ boɛ kpole kɛ bɛnwu mɔɔ bɛnwu ye la. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Ngapezoma nee arelemgbunli dɛba dɔɔnwo ne ala hulole kɛ anrɛɛ bɛkɛnwu ye, na eza bɛkɛde mɔɔ bɛmɛ bɛnwu ye ɔ nee mɔɔ bɛde la!”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samɛleanli atiakunlukɛnlɛma ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Na ɔrale kɛ, kenle ko bie Mosisi mɛla kɛlɛhɛlɛvolɛ benlera ko bie rale razɔle Gyisɛse ye nrɛlɛbɛ kpole ne nleanle, na ɔbizale ye kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, duzu a ɔhyia kɛ sonla yɛ amaa ɔlua zo yeanyia damɛnlangoate ngoane wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu a?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Gyisɛse buale ye zele kɛ, “Duzu a Mosisi mɛla ne ka mɔɔ fale ɛhye anwo a?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Ɔbuale ɔzele Gyisɛse kɛ “Mɛla ne ka ye kɛ, Fa wɔ ahonle muala, ɔ nee wɔ ɛkɛla muala, ɔ nee wɔ anwosesebɛ muala, ɔ nee wɔ adwenle kɔsɔɔti kulo wɔ Awulae Nyamenle ne. Eza kulo ɛ gɔnwo kɛ ɛdawɔ ɛ nwo ala la pɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Wɔbua boɛ! Yɛ ɛhye na ɛbanyia ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ!”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Nrenyia ne, yemɔ ɔhulole kɛ ɔkɛbu ɔ nwo benle, ɔti ɔbizale Gyisɛse kɛ, “Na me gɔnwo mɔ a le nwane?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Gyisɛse bule ɛrɛlɛ vale yele ɛhye anloa ɔzele kɛ: “Kenle ko bie ɛnee Dwuunli bie ɛlɛtu adenle vi Gyɛlusalɛm yeahɔ Gyɛleko. Na ahodiawu bie tetale ye wɔ adevinli ne. Bɛkpolole ɔ nwo adɛladeɛ kosooti, bɛzale ye bɛliele ye ezukoa mɔɔ wɔ ɔ nwo la amuala, na bɛbole ye bɛbodɛbodale ye sesakaa ne ala, na akee bɛgyakyile ye wɔ ewule nee ngoane avinli wɔ adehanle ne.<verse eid="LUK 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />“Yeangyɛ biala, Dwuunli sɛlɛvolɛ bie ravale zɔhane adenle ne azo; na mɔɔ ɔnwunle nrenyia ne kɛ ɔla ye kagyaa la, ɔpɛle ɔlile adenle ne foa ko nehane na ɔzeanle ɔ nwo ɔhɔle ye ɛleka bie. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Livaenli bie noko radwule ɛkɛ la, ɔdaye ɔnwunle ye; ɔbikyele nrenyia ne, na ɔnleanle ye koonwu na akee ɔbule adenle ne foa ko ɔhɔle.<verse eid="LUK 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />“Akee Samɛleanli bie mɔɔ ɔdaye ɔlua ye adenle la radwule ɛleka mɔɔ nrenyia ne la la; na mɔɔ ɔ nye bɔle ɔ nwo zo ala la, ɔ kunlu yelɛyelale ye somaa ne ala. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Samɛleanli ne hotole ɔ nwo ɛkɛ, ɔmiemianle ɔ nwo nganle ne mɔ, na ɔvale ayile ɔguguale nu na ɔkyekyele ye gyɛlɛɛnye. Ɔvale ye ɔdɛnlanle ɔdaye ye afunlumu mɔɔ ɛnee ɔde zo la azo bɛdiale bɛtɛbɛtɛ kɔkpula kɛ bɛradwule sua mɔɔ nyɛvosua wɔ ɛkɛ ne a, na ɔnleanle ye. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Aleɛ hyenle la, ɔyele menli nwiɔ kenle ko ahatualɛ ezukoa ɔmaanle nyɛvosua menle ne na ɔzele ye kɛ, ‘Nea nrenyia ye boɛ maa me. Saa ɔ nwo kakɛ bo mɔɔ meva megyakyi wɔ la azo a, kenle biala mɔɔ menwɔzia menwɔra la mebadua meamaa wɔ.’<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />“Menli nsa ɛhye mɔ nuhua boni agɔnwo a le nrenyia ne mɔɔ dɔle ahodiawu sa nu la?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Nrenyia ne zele kɛ, “Nuhua ko ne mɔɔ zele nrenyia ne anwunvɔne la ɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Akee Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Wioo, kɔ na ɛdawɔ noko kɔyɛ zɔhane ala.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Na ɔrale kɛ, mɔɔ Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɛlɛtu adenle ahɔ Gyɛlusalɛm la, bɛhɔdwule namule bie azo, na bɛlɛra bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Maata la liele bɛ na ɔ nee bɛ hɔle sua nu. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Ɔ diema raalɛ, Male, dɛnlanle aze wɔ Gyisɛse agyakɛ anwo na ɔdiele ye ngilehile ne.<verse eid="LUK 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Maata yelele ɔ nwo ɔzonlenle somaa ne ala, na eza ɔfonlanle ɔ nwo noko wɔ aleɛdonlɛ nu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:40">Akee ɔrale Gyisɛse ɛkɛ ɔrazele ye kɛ, “Yɛmenle, asoo ɛnea a ɔle kpalɛ kɛ me diema raalɛ ne kɛdɛnla ɛleka ko kɛnlea me ɔkɛmaa me ngome menwɔzonle ɔ? Se ye kɛ ɔrɛla ɔrazɔ me nu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Awulae buale ye zele kɛ, “Maata, Maata, ɛdwenle na ɛfonla ɛ nwo wɔ debie ɛyɛlɛ nwo somaa! <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Debie titili kokye ala a hyia mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ɛdwenle nwolɛ a, na Male, yemɔ yenwu deɛ holɛ ko ne, na menrɛlie menrɛvi ɔ sa nu ɛlɛ!”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Nzɛlɛlɛ nee anwodelɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Kenle ko bie, Gyisɛse hɔle asɔne ɛyɛlɛ. Mɔɔ ɔwiele ala la, ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu ko hɔle ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Awulae, kile yɛ asɔne ɛyɛlɛ kɛmɔ Dwɔn hilele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ la.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Saa bɛyɛ asɔne a, anrɛɛ bɛha kɛ, ‘Egya, wɔ duma nwo ɛde. Wɔ Belemgbunlililɛ deɛ ne ɛrɛla. <verse eid="LUK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Maa yɛ kenle dahuu aleɛ; <verse eid="LUK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />na fa yɛ ɛtane kyɛ yɛ, kɛmɔ yɛfa yɛkyɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛyɛ ɛtane bɛtia yɛ la. Na mmamaa munzule biala to yɛ.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5-6" />Akee ɔhɔle zo ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛ nuhua ne boni, yɛɛ saa ɔ gɔnwo babɔ ye anlenkɛ nu alevinli-mu-nwiɔ-avinli na ɔse ye kɛ, ‘Agɔnwolɛ, fɛne me kpanwo dolɔfo nsa ɔluakɛ menyia ɛyɛvolɛ, na menlɛ aleɛ biala mɔɔ mefa meamaa ye a,’ <verse eid="LUK 11:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />ɔkɛbua ye ɔkɛvi suakunlu nehane ɔkeze ye kɛ, ‘Mmagyegye me na aleɛ ɛdwo, medo me anlenkɛ nu, yɛɛ me mra deda me nwo ɛke, ɔti menrɛhola dwazo a?’<verse eid="LUK 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />“Memaa bɛade ɔ bo kɛ, bɔbɔ ɛkɛdu agɔnwolɛyɛlɛ ne ɛkɛzie ahanle, na ɛnrɛdwazo ɛnrɛmaa ye ɛhwee, noko akee saa ɔkɔ zo ɔbɔ wɔ anlenkɛ ne anu a, ɔkɛyɛ wɔ abodelɛ ɔkɛmaa ɛkɛdwazo ɛkɛva debie biala mɔɔ ɔkpondɛ la ɛkɛmaa ye. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Memaa bɛade ɔ bo bieko kɛ, kɛ asɔneyɛlɛ de ala la ɛne, yemɔti bɛbiza, na bɛ sa kɛha ye; bɛkpondɛ, na bɛkɛnwu ye; bɛbɔ nu, na bɛkɛbuke bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Ɔluakɛ awie biala mɔɔ biza la asa ka ye; awie biala mɔɔ kpondɛ la nwu ye; yɛɛ awie biala mɔɔ bɔ anlenkɛ ne anu la bɛbuke ye.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />“Selɛ ne boni a saa ɔ ra biza ye aleɛ a ɔmaa ye bolɛ; anzɛɛ ɔbiza ye fɛlɛ a ɔmaa ye ɛwɔlɛ a? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Saa ɔbiza kolonvia a, ɛmaa ye nyamenleakɛlɛ ɔ?<verse eid="LUK 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />“Na saa bɛmɛ, ɛtanevolɛma mɔɔ le kɛ bɛdabɛ la, bɛze ahyɛlɛdeɛ kpalɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛmaa bɛ mra la a, ɛnee duzu ati a saa bɛbiza Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne bɛfi Egya ne mɔɔ wɔ anwuma maanle ne anu la ɛkɛ ne a, ɔnrɛva ɔnrɛmaa bɛ a?”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Ɔrale ye kɛ, ɛnee Gyisɛse ɛlɛtu sunsum evinli avi nrenyia bie mɔɔ le mumule la nu. Na mekɛ mɔɔ sunsum evinli ne vile ye nu vindele la, nrenyia mumule ne dendɛle, na ɔyɛle menli ne azibɛnwo; <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />na bɛ nuhua bie mɔ zele kɛ, “Ɔdua mbɔnsam belemgbunli Biyɛlezɛbɛle tumi nu a ɔtu mbɔnsam a!” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Bie mɔ noko zɔle ye nleanle na bɛzele ye kɛ ɔyɛ sɛkɛlɛneɛ bie wɔ anwomanyunlu ɔmaa bɛnlea ɔva ɔhile kɛ amgba ɔle Sonla Ra ne.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Gyisɛse nwunle bɛ adwenle ne mɔ, na ɔbuale bɛ ɔzele kɛ, “Belemgbunli maanle biala ko tia ɔ nwo a maanle ne ɛngola ɛngyinla; zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ aako mɔɔ nuhua menli ko tia bɛ nwo la ɛngola ɛngyinla a. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Ɔti saa Abɔnsam tu ɔ gɔnwo Abɔnsam a, ɛnee ɔlɛko yeatia ɔ ngomekye ɔ nwo, na eza ɔlɛsɛkye ɔdaye ɔ ngome ye belemgbunli maanle. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Na saa mame melua Biyɛlezɛbɛle anwo zo, anzɛɛ mbɔnsam tumi zo a metu mbɔnsam a, ɛnee duzu tumi a bɛ mra ne mɔ dua zo tu mbɔnsam a? <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Na saa melua Nana Nyamenle tumi zo melɛtu mbɔnsam ɛdeɛ a, ɛnee ɔkile kɛ Nana Nyamenle Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne ɛbikye ala ɛne.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Saa katakyie fa ye konlendeɛ siezie ɔ nwo sie sinza ye aako a, ye agyapandeɛ anwo ɛmbu ɛbonle; <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />na saa awie mɔɔ anwo yɛ ɛsesebɛ kpalɛ tɛla ye la wua ye wɔ konle nu di ɔ nwo zo konim a, ɔdie ye konlendeɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ ɔvale ɔ rɛle ɔwulale bɛ nu la ɔfi ɔ sa nu, na ɔwua ye agyapandeɛ ne bɔkɔbɔkɔ zɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />“Awie biala mɔɔ ɛnle me afoa la, ɛnee ɔle me kpɔvolɛ; yɛɛ mɔɔ nee me ɛnguohua la sande nu.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Saa bɛtu sunsum evinli bɛfi sonla nu a, ɔkɔ ɛsɛlɛ ne mɔ azo akpɔsa kɛ ɔkalie ɔ menle bie; na saa yeannyia ɛleka yeandɛnla a, akee ɔse kɛ, <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />‘Maa menzia mengɔ nrenyia ne mɔɔ menvile ye lɔ membale la ɛkɛ.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Na ɔkɔ ɔkɔfa ɔ gɔnwo mɔ sunsum evinlima nsuu mɔɔ anwo yɛ ɛsesebɛ kpalɛ tɛla ɔdaye mumua ne la, na ɔ nee bɛ batɛnla nrenyia ne nu na nrenyia ne tɛnlabelɛ nu yɛ ɛsesebɛ tɛla dɛba ne deɛ ne bɔbɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Mekɛ mɔɔ ɔ nloa wɔ zo ɔlɛtendɛ la, raalɛ bie mɔɔ wɔ menli ekpunli ekpunli ne anu la vale ɛnelɛ kpole bie zele ye kɛ, “Nyilalɛ ɛha ɛrɛladane holɛ ko ne mɔɔ wole wɔ la, ɔ nee nyɛfonlɛ ne mɔɔ ɛnlonle la.”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Gyisɛse buale raalɛ ne zele ye kɛ, “Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtie Nana Nyamenle Edwɛkɛ ne na bɛdi zo la emomu!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29-30" />Mekɛ mɔɔ menli ne yɛle pinopino kpalɛ la, Gyisɛse bɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔkilehile bɛ, na ɔzele kɛ, “Mekɛ ɛhye nee nuhua menli ɛnle kpalɛ. Dahuu bɛkɔ zo bɛbiza kɛ bɛkɛnwu sɛkɛlɛneɛ ɛzulolɛ ɛzulolɛ bɛkɛvi anwomanyunlu mɔɔ kile kɛ amgba mame a le Sonla Ra ne a; na emomu sɛkɛlɛneɛ mɔɔ mebayɛ meahile bɛ la a le nwanwanedeɛ ne mɔɔ zile Dwona anwo zo, mɔɔ ye anwubielɛ maanle Nenɛvɛ amra nwunle kɛ Nana Nyamenle a amgba zoanle ye la a.<verse eid="LUK 11:29-30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />“Wɔ Ndɛnebualɛ Kenle ne, Hyiba Belemgbunli Raalɛ ne badwazo adende ɔ sa wɔ ɛlɔnwɔne ɛhye anwo zo adendɛ atia ye, ɔluakɛ ɔvɛle ɔdule adenle tendenle ɔhɔzɔle Sɔlɔmɔn nrɛlɛbɛ ne ɔnleanle. Na emomu awie ko mɔɔ le kpole tɛla Sɔlɔmɔn la wɔ ɛke mɔɔ menli ekyii bie ala a tie ye a.<verse eid="LUK 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />“Nenɛvɛ amra noko badwazo adendɛ atia maanle ɛhye, ɔluakɛ bɛnlunle bɛ nwo wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ Dwona hanle Nyamedwɛkɛ ne hilele bɛ la; na awie ko mɔɔ le kpole tɛla Dwona la wɔ ɛke, na maanle ɛhye anu amra ɛndie ye.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Awie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔsɔ kɛnlaneɛ ɔfa ɔfea a! Emomu ɔfa ɔsie ye anwuma amaa yeada wienyi amaa awie biala anwu sua ne anu awolo. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Sonla nye le ye sonlabaka ne kɛnlaneɛ. Saa ɛ nye le kpalɛ a ɛnee wɔ sonlabaka ne lɛ kɛnlaneɛ, na saa ɛ nye ɛnle kpalɛ a, ɛnee wɔ sonlabaka ne de awozinli nu. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Zɔhane ati, bɛnlea boɛ na bɛ kɛnlaneɛ ne annu, ammaa awozinli anva bɛ aze. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Saa wɔ sonlabaka ne lɛ kɛnlaneɛ mɔɔ awozinli ekyi zɛ bɔbɔ ɛnle ye nu a, ɔbada yeayɛ wienyi kɛ asɛɛ bɛzɔ kɛnlaneɛ bɛzie ɛ nwo zo la.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛhwile adalɛ nabalabama ne mɔ anyunlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37-38" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse anloa dɔle la, Falasiima ne mɔ anu ko vɛlɛle ye kɛ ɔmaa bɛhɔkpula bɛ sa, ɔti ɔ nee ye hɔle. Mɔɔ bɛbɔle aleɛ ne ɛlilɛ bo la, Gyisɛse anwowo ɔ sa anwo kɛmɔ Dwuuma aleɛlilɛ nwo amaamuo ne kile la. Ɛhye yɛle Falasiinli ne mɔɔ dole ɛkponle ne la azibɛnwo totohyia.<verse eid="LUK 11:37-38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Bɛmɛ Falasiima, bɛnrinzi bɛ nwo na bɛgyakyi bɛ kunlu ne mɔɔ apobɔlɛ nee ɛtaneyɛlɛ ɛyi ye tɔ la. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Anzɛɛ bɛnze kɛ Nana Nyamenle bɔle sonla kunlu nee ɔ nzi ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Tenlene nwo daselɛlilɛ a le atiakunlukpalɛyɛlɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Munzule ɛha bɛ, bɛmɛ Falasiima! Ɔluakɛ bɔbɔ bɛbu bɛ gyima mɔɔ bɛyɛ la anwo ahatualɛ nu bulu na bɛfa nuhua ko bɛgua bɛ asɔne gya ne anu ɛdeɛ, noko akee bɛnli pɛlepɛle, yɛɛ eza noko bɛngulo Nana Nyamenle. Ɔle zɔ kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛtua bɛ asɔne adwule, noko akee ɔnle kɛ bɛgyakyi pɛpɛlilɛ nee Nana Nyamenle nwo ɛhulolɛ ne.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Munzule ɛha bɛ, bɛmɛ Falasiima! Bɛmɛ gyinlabelɛ mgbole ɛleka a bɛkpondɛ ye wɔ ayiasua ne mɔ anu bɛtɛnla a, yɛɛ dahuu bɛkulo bagua nu nganvolɛ! <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Munzule ɛha bɛ! Ɔluakɛ bɛle kɛ azɛka mɔɔ ndile ɛnyi ɛva bɛ na menli noko mɔɔ lua zolɛ la ɛnnwu bɛ la.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Dwuu lɔyanli bie mɔɔ ɛnee gyi ɛkɛ ne la zele ye kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, saa ɛka ɛhye a ɛnee wɔwɔ yɛdayɛ noko safule.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Gyisɛse buale ye zele kɛ, “Munzule ɛha bɛdabɛ noko! Ɔboalekɛ, bɛsoa menli adesoa mgbole mgbole, noko akee bɛmɛ bɛngulo kɛ bɛkɛva bɛ sa ɛlɛsɛka ko bɔbɔ bɛkɛha adesoa ne bie. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Munzule ɛha bɛ! Ɔboalekɛ bɛtu avunli ahuma bɛsie ngapezoma ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛ ze mɔ hunle bɛ la. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Bɛle ahodiawu! Ɔluakɛ bɛdi zɛhae gyima ne mɔɔ bɛ ze mɔ lile la anwo daselɛ, na bɛdie bɛto nuhua noko; bɛhunle ngapezoma ne mɔ yɛɛ bɛmɛ noko bɛdudu ahuma bɛziezie bɛ nu.<verse eid="LUK 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />“Nyɛleɛ ɛhye a Nana Nyamenle ɛha nwolɛ edwɛkɛ ɛdo ye ɛkɛ a, kɛ: ‘Mebazoa ngapezoma nee ɛdoavolɛma wɔ bɛ nwo, na bɛbahwi bie mɔ anyunlu na bɛahu bie mɔ noko.’<verse eid="LUK 11:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />“Na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ wɔ aleɛabo kɛkala la bali ngapezoma mɔɔ bɛhu bɛ la kpokpoti mogya nwo ɛzonle; <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />bɛbali Ebulu mɔɔ bɛhunle ye la mogya nwo ɛzonle yeahɔkpula Zɛkalaya mɔɔ bɛhunle ye wɔ asɔne sua ne azukponle Nwuanzanwuanza ne anwo la mogya nwo ɛzonle. Nɔhalɛ nu mese bɛ kɛ, bɛbabua bɛ nwolɛ ndɛne.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Bɛmɛ mɛla kilehilevolema, munzule ɛha bɛ! Ɔluakɛ bɛva nɔhalɛ ne bɛvea menli; bɛdabɛ mumua ne bɛnrɛli nɔhalɛ yɛɛ bɛnrɛmaa awie mɔ noko adenle bɛnrɛmaa bɛnrɛli nɔhalɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53-54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53-54" />Ɛhye maanle Falasiima nee Mɛla kilehilevolɛma ne mɔ vale ɛya kpole. Ɔti ɔvi zɔhane melɛ ne mɔɔ kɔ la, bɛbɔle mɔdenle kɛ bɛkɛva kpuyia bɛkɛbɛla ye nu amaa ɔlua zo bɛ sa aha ye bɛahye ye.<verse eid="LUK 11:53-54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse dendɛle hilele menli ekpunli ekpunli ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Mekɛ zɔhane anu ala, ɛnee menli dɔɔnwo ne ala ɛra dedee mɔɔ ɛto bolɛ bɔbɔ a ɔnga aze a. Na akee ɔhakyile ɔ nye ɔzele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Bɛnlea bɛ nwo boɛ kpalɛ kpalɛ wɔ Falasiima ne mɔ anwo, ɔluakɛ bɛle mgbɔvonle. Na bɛ mɛlɛbɛla ne noko ɛnrɛha ɛkɛ ne dahuu. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Ɔbala ali wienyi kɛ mgbɔvonle mɔɔ wɔ ɛdɔkɛ nu la pɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Mɔɔ bɛheha ye azule bo la kpokpoti bala ali wienyi; yɛɛ mɔɔ bɛha ye huhuhuhu wɔ suakunlu noko la, bɛbabɔ bɛ nolo wɔ gua bile zo lɔ!<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Ɛhye ati, ayi mɔ, bɛmmasulo ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ kpondɛ ahu bɛ la, ɔluakɛ nwonane ne ala a bɛkɛhola ye ku a; na bɛnlɛ ɛkɛla ne anwo zo tumi biala. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Emomu mɔɔ bɛzulo ye la a le Nana Nyamenle, ɔluakɛ yemɔ yɛɛ ɔkola ɔku nwonane ne na eza ɔfuandi ɛkɛla ne ɔto abɔnsam senle ne anu a. Mesi bɛ zo bieko kɛ, ‘Bɛzulo ye.’<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />“Tɛ ezukoa ngapɛlɛ nsa bie a bɛfa bɛtɔ kɛsanloma nnu ɔ? Noko Nana Nyamenle anye ɛmkpa ko bɔbɔ anwo zo ɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Na yɛmɛ yɛ ti enrinli mgbane ne bɔbɔ, ɔze ɔ muala ye dodo! Bɛmmasulo, ɔluakɛ bɛsonle bolɛ bɛtɛla kɛsanloma apenle kɛyɛ nyɛ.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Na mesi ye pi meahile bɛ kɛ: Saa bɛdie Mame, Sonla Ra ne bɛto nu wɔ bagua nu kɛ me deɛ a le bɛ a, medame noko mebahanvo bɛ wɔ Nana Nyamenle anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ anyunlu. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛkpo me wɔ aleɛabo la, medame noko mebakpo bɛ wɔ Nana Nyamenle anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ anyunlu. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Saa bɛbava sonla mɔɔ ɛdendɛ ɛtia Mame, Sonla Ra ne la ɛtane bɔbɔ bɛahyɛ ye a, ɛnee tɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtendɛ bɛtia Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne la ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Eza noko saa bɛkye bɛ, bɛ nee bɛ kɔ Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ anyunlu wɔ ayiasua ne mɔ anu a, bɛmmadwenle mɔɔ bɛkɛha bɛkɛlie bɛ nwo la anwo, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />ɔluakɛ Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne bahile bɛ wɔ dɔnehwele ne anu edwɛkɛ fɔɔnwo ne mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛka la.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Na akee awie vi menli pemgbenlamgbe ne anu deanle nu zele kɛ, “Yɛmenle, mebodo wɔ, se me diema ne kɛ ɔmaa yɛhyɛ egya agyapadeɛ mɔɔ ɔvale ɔgyakyile yɛ la anu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Gyisɛse buale ye zele kɛ, “Adiema, nwane a yɛle me ndɛnebuavolɛ anzɛɛ ninyɛne ɛhyɛlɛ zo neazovolɛ a? <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Bɛnlea boɛ! Bɛmmayɛ anyebolo, ɔluakɛ anyiabɛnwo ɛngile ɛbɛlabɔlɛ tenlene.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Akee ɔbule bɛ ɛrɛlɛ kɛ: “Nrenyia sukoavolɛ bie zonle ye ɛya, na ɛya ne hyenle kpole. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Na mɔɔ bɛbule la, ye mbonwole mɔɔ ɔlɛ bɛ la amuala yiyile tetɛkɛɛ bulubulule zolɛ. Ɛhye gyegyele ye adwenle kpole, <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />na nzinlii ɔyɛle ye adwenle na akee ɔzele ɔ nwo kɛ, ‘Kɛ menzi menyɛ me nwo ɛ? Mebabubu me mbonwole ne mɔ meagua, na meazi mgbole kpalɛ mɔɔ tɛla ɛhye mɔ la, amaa meanyia ɛleka meagua me aleɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Akee mebadɛnla meanlea me ninyɛne ne mɔ, na akee meaze me nwo kɛ, Wɔzie aleɛ dɔɔnwo wɔmaa ɛvolɛ tendendenlenle mɔɔ bara la. Die ɛ menle bie! Di na no maa ɛ nwo ɛdɔ wɔ.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />“Na Nana Nyamenle zele ye kɛ, ‘Koasea!’ Ɛnɛ nɔe ala bɛbalie wɔ ɛkɛla ne bɛavi ɛ sa nu. Na nwane a ɛhye mɔ amuala bayɛ ye deɛ a?”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />“Ɔle nɔhalɛ kɛ, awie biala mɔɔ kɛkpondɛ agyapadeɛ kɛzie azɛlɛ ye azo, na yeamkpondɛ bie yeangua anwuma maanle ne anu la, ɛnee ɔle tomiamgba amgba.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Akee ɔzele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Bɛmmadwenledwenle mɔɔ bɛkɛli anzɛɛ bɛkɛnlo, anzɛɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛheda la anwo. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ɔluakɛ ngoane hyia tɛla aleɛ nee ndanlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Bɛnlea anwomanyunlu nloma bɔbɔ bɛnlua yɛɛ bɛmbu, yɛɛ bɛnlɛ bonwole bɔbɔ na bɛava debie bɛagua zo, noko dahuu bɛnyia mɔɔ bɛdi la, ɔluakɛ Nana Nyamenle maa bɛ aleɛ. Na asoo bɛnzonle bolɛ bɛndɛla nloma ne mɔ noko ɔ?<verse eid="LUK 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />“Na bɛ nuhua ne boni bɔbɔ a ɔdaye ɔse ɔkɛhola ɔkɛva kenle kokye bɔbɔ ɔkɛzɔ ye ngoane zo a? Awie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ ne zɔhane! <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Na saa adwenledwenle ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛmaa yɛnrɛyɛ ɛhye mɔ bɔbɔ mɔɔ le ekyi la a, ɛnee akee duzu ati a yɛkɛdwenledwenle mɔɔ tɛla ɛhye mɔ la anwo a?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />“Bɛnlea ɛya nu silikoko bɔbɔ! Bɛnyɛ gyima, yɛɛ bɛmpomgba adɛladeɛ bɛnwula, noko akee Sɔlɔmɔn bɔbɔ, wɔ ye anyunlunyia kosooti anu anziezie ɔ nwo kɛ bɛmɛ la. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Na saa Nana Nyamenle keda ndotolo mɔɔ bɛwɔ ɛke ɛnɛ, ɛhyema ɛnee bɛminli la ɛdanlɛ zɛhae a, ɛnee bɛnlie bɛnli kɛ ɔkɛheda bɛdabɛ noko ɛdanlɛ ɔ, bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛnlɛ diedi a? <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Eza noko bɛmmadwenle aleɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛli anzɛɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛnlo la anwo fee zɛ; bɛmmamaa bɛ adwenle yɛ bɛ kesee. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Deɛ mɔɔ aleɛabo maanle maanlema kpondɛ la ala a le ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ, noko bɛ Ze ne mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la ze mɔɔ hyia bɛ la amuala kpokpoti. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Bɛmaa ye Belemgbunli maanle ne anwo ɛhyia bɛ ɛdɛla debie biala, na ɔdaye noko ɔbava ɛhye mɔ amuala yeaboka bɛ nwo.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Ɛhye ati bɛmmasulo, bɛmɛ mboane ekpunli ekyi. Ɔluakɛ ɔyɛ bɛ Ze fɛ totohyia kɛ ɔkɛva Belemgbunli maanle ne ɔkɛmaa bɛ a. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Bɛdɔne mɔɔ bɛlɛ ye la, na bɛva bɛhyɛ ehyiavolɛma. Ɛhye bamaa bɛanyia ahatualɛ kpalɛ mgbole wɔ anwuma maanle ne anu! Agyapadeɛ mɔɔ bɛkpondɛ bɛzie ye wɔ anwuma maanle ne anu la ɛnwie ɛlɛ. Awule noko ɛnwua, yɛɛ nvɔlekɛ noko ɛngola ɛnzɛkye ye. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Na bɛhakye kɛ, ɛleka mɔɔ wɔ agyapadeɛ wɔ la, ɛkɛ ne a wɔ ahonle ne nee wɔ adwenle noko wɔ a.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Bɛboɔboa bɛ nwo na bɛmaa bɛ kɛnlaneɛ ne ɛda, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />amaa bɛahola bɛahendɛ bɛ Awulae wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔkɛvi atɔfolɛlielɛ bo ɔkɛra la, amaa saa ɔba na ɔbabɔ anlenkɛ ne anu a, bɛabuke ye ndɛndɛ ne ala. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Nyilalɛ nee fɛlɛko kpole baha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ saa menlelɛ ne ba a ɔbarado bɛ kɛ bɛlɛkendɛ ye la. Ɔdaye mumua ne a ɔbamaa bɛ ebia na eza yeazonle bɛ a! <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Bie a ɛnee ɔbara kɛyɛ nɔɔzo dɔne ngɔnla, anzɛɛ alevinli-mu-nwiɔ avinli bɔbɔ. Noko akee mekɛ biala mɔɔ ɔkɛra la, menli mɔɔ bali fɛlɛko kpalɛ ne la a le nuhua ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛboɔboa bɛ nwo bɛwie la.<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />“Saa aakomenle ze mekɛ mɔɔ awule barawua ye a, anrɛɛ ɔnrɛdo ye aako ne mgbane. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Ɛhye ati bɛziezie bɛ nwo dahuu, ɔluakɛ Sonla Ra ne bara wɔ melɛ mɔɔ awie biala anye ɛnla ye adenle la.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Pita bizale ye kɛ, “Awulae, ɛnee yɛ ngome a ɛlɛka ɛhye wɔahile yɛ anzɛɛ yɛ muala ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42-44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42-44" />Na Awulae buale ye zele kɛ, “Melɛka meahile awie biala mɔɔ di nɔhalɛ, na ɔ nye gyi ɔ ti anwo kpundii na ɔ menle ɛva gyima ɛwula ɔ sa kɛ ɔmaa ye ngɛkɛlɛ mɔɔ ɛha la aleɛ la. Saa ɔ menle ne sia ba bato kɛ ye kanranli ne amgba ɛyɛ ye gyima ne bɔkɔɔ a, ɔbamaa ye nwolɛ ahatualɛ, na eza noko yeava debie biala mɔɔ ɔlɛ ye la yeawula ɔ sa nu yeamaa yeanlea zo.<verse eid="LUK 12:42-44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />“Na saa ɔba ye kɛ, ahenle ne suzu kɛ, ‘Me menle ɛtɛnyianle ɛtɛsiale ɛtɛbale’, na ɔbɔ ɔ bo kɛ ɔbo mrenyia nee mraalɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛva bɛwula ɔ sa kɛ ɔnlea bɛ la, na eza ɔto ɛkponle mgbole yeanlo ye nza yeabo a, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />yemɔ mɔɔ bazi la a le kɛ, ɔ menle ne bazia ara wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔ nye ɛnla la, na yeadu ye yeavi ɛkɛ ne yeamaa yeahɔboka menli mɔɔ ɛnli nɔhalɛ la anwo. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Ɔ nzohwenlɛ ɛdeɛ ne bayɛ totohyia, ɔluakɛ ɔze mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ɔyɛ la yɛɛ yeanyɛ a.<verse eid="LUK 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />“Na awie mɔɔ ɛnze kɛ mɔɔ ɔlɛyɛ la ɛnle kpalɛ la, yemɔ bɛbazuzu bɛahwe ɔ nzo. Ɔboalekɛ awie biala mɔɔ bɛkɛmaa ye dɔɔnwo la, yemɔ a bɛkpondɛ dɔɔnwo bɛfi ɔ sa nu a.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Mera kɛ mefa senle meara azɛlɛ ye azo, na me kunlu anu a anrɛɛ yezɔ dɛbadɛba! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Azubɔlɛ mɔɔ sonle bolɛ la wɔ ɛkɛ mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛbɔ me a, na saa me sa ɛtɛkanle zɔhane azubɔlɛ ne a, me nwo ɛtɛtɔle me!<verse eid="LUK 12:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />“Bɛdwenle kɛ anzondwolɛ a me nee ye ɛra azɛlɛ ye azo anzɛɛ? Mese bɛ kɛ, Kyɛkyɛ! Ɔnle zɔ! Emomu konle nee mgbakyemgbakyenu ɔ! <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Ɔvi ɛnɛ mɔɔ kɔ la, mbusua nu bakpakyekpakye; saa bɛlua nnu a, ɔlua me ti, nuhua nsa ne batia nwiɔ, ne, na nwiɔ ne noko batia nsa ne. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Selɛ batia ralɛ nrenyia; yɛɛ ninli noko batia ralɛ raalɛ; yɛɛ azebia nee azebia, ɔ nee azebɛla nee azebɛla avinli badondo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Akee ɔdole ɔ nye wɔ menli dɔɔnwo ne anwo na ɔzele kɛ, “Saa amungu ye kisikisi wɔ sɛnzɛndɔleɛ a, bɛse, ‘Ezule ne badɔ.’ Na ɔyɛ zɔ noko amgba.<verse eid="LUK 12:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />“Yɛɛ saa bɛnwu kɛ nyevile nu anwoma ɛlɛbɔ a, ɛnee bɛse, ‘Wuluwulu ɛlɛba.’ Na amgba noko ɔye zɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Bɛmɛ adalɛ nabalabama! Duzu ati a bɛkola bɛnea anwomanyunlu bɛka mɔɔ bazi la, na akee bɛyɛ kɛ asɛɛ bɛtɛnwunle mɔɔ ɛlɛsisi ɛnɛ mekɛ ye anu la a? <verse eid="LUK 12:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Duzu ati a bɛkpo kɛ bɛkɛva ɛzukoalɛdeɛ bɛkɛvi nu a?<verse eid="LUK 12:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />“Saa ɛnwu kɛ wɔ kpɔvolɛ bie nee wɔ ɛlɛkɔ kɔɔto a, bɔ mɔdenle kɛ ɛ nee ye bɛkɛziezie bɛ avinli, kolaa na edwɛkɛ ne adwu ndɛnebuavolɛ ne anyunlu; wɔanyɛ ye zɔ na bɛkɔdwu lɔ a, yemɔ bɛbua wɔ fɔlɛ na bɛto wɔ efiade. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Na saa ɔba ye zɔhane noko a, kyesɛ ɛda nu dedee kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛhile wɔ la dwu, anzɛɛ kɛ ɛkɛdua kapɛlɛba ne bɔbɔ mɔɔ wɔ kakɛ biala mɔɔ bɛkɛbɔ wɔ la azo la tua la.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Anwuma belemgbunli maanle adenle ne le feɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Ɔrale ye kɛ, mekɛ ne anu, bɛhanle bɛhilele ye kɛ, Paelɛte ɛhu Dwuuma bie mɔɔ vi Galeli rale Gyɛlusalɛm Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu na bɛlɛbɔ azu la.<verse eid="LUK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Na ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Asoo bɛdie bɛdi kɛ menli zɔhane bɛ ɛtane zonle tɛla Galelima mɔɔ ɛha la ɛdeɛ ne la ati a bɛnwunle zɔhane anwubɛnyunlu ne la ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Tɛ ye zɔ ɔ! Na memaa bɛade kɛ, saa bɛdabɛ noko bɛannu bɛ nwo a, zɔhane ala a bara bɛ nwo zo a.<verse eid="LUK 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />“Na menli bulu nee mɔtwɛ ne noko mɔɔ Saelowam Tawa ne bule guale bɛ nwo zo la ɛ? Asoo bɛ ngomekye a ɛnee bɛyɛ ɛtane mgbole mgbole wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm anzɛɛ? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Kyɛkyɛ, tɛ ye zɔ ɔ! Na zɔhane ala yɛɛ saa bɛdabɛ noko bɛannu bɛ nwo a bɛbaminli a.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Akee ɔbule bɛ ɛrɛlɛ ɛhye kɛ: “Nrenyia bie luale dɔma baka wɔ ye tola nu; na ɔdoale zo ɔrale fane dɔɔnwo ne ala kɛ ɔbakpondɛ zolɛ ma ne bie, noko yeannyia ɛhwee. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Nzinlii, ɔzele ye tola neazovolɛ ne kɛ ɔpɛ ye ɔdo. Ɔse, ‘Ɛvolɛ nsa ye anu mehendɛ dedee noko metɛnyianle ma kokye bɔbɔ wɔ zo. Na mefa ɛhye anwo meayɛ duzu bieko? Ɔlɛsɛkye azɛlɛ ne gyɛne.’<verse eid="LUK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />“Tola neazovolɛ ne buale ye zele kɛ, ‘Maa yɛnlea ye ekyii wɔ ɛvolɛ bieko, na mengugua ɔ bo ewula, menvede me nye menea ye boɛ. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Saa ɛvolɛ bieko kara na yezo a, ɛnee ye kpalɛ nu ɔ; yeamba ye zɔ noko a, ɛnee akee bɔ zo mɔɔ yedwu ye ɛpɛlɛ ɔ.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Na wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ko bie, mɔɔ ɛnee ɔlɛkilehile wɔ ayiasua ne anu la, <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />ɔnwunle raalɛ bie mɔɔ ewule ɛmaa yekpo zo too ɛvolɛ bulu nee mɔtwɛ a, na ɔtenrɛ ɔ nwo a ɔnyɛ boɛ fee zɛ.<verse eid="LUK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Gyisɛse vɛlɛle ye ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Raalɛ ye, ɛ nwo ɛza!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Akee ɔvale ɔ sa ɔhanle ye, na amgba noko raalɛ ne denrɛle fɔɔnwo ɛkɛ ne ala. Na ɔhanvole Nana Nyamenle, na ɔyɛle ye mo!<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Na Dwuunli kpanyinli ne mɔɔ nea ɛkɛ ne ayiasua ne azo la vale ɛya totohyia na ɔzele kɛ, “Dapɛne ne anu kenle nsia wɔ ɛkɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛyɛ gyima a; ɔti ɛdawɔ biala mɔɔ ɛkpondɛ kɛ bɛyɛ wɔ ayile la, bɛla zɔhane melɛ ne, na tɛ wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne ɔ!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Awulae buale ye zele kɛ, “Adalɛ nabalaba! Asoo Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne dwu a ɛnzanyi wɔ ɛkpɔnwɔ ɛmmaa ɔnno nzule ɔ? Na ɛhye ɛnle gyimayɛlɛ ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Na duzu ati yɛɛ Ebileham dehelɛ ye mɔɔ Abɔnsam ɛkyekye ye too ye ɛvolɛ bulu nee mɔtwɛ ɛne la, saa memaa ɔ nwo ɛza a ɛnee ɛsuzu kɛ ɔle ɛtaneyɛlɛ ɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Mɔɔ ɔhanle ɛhye la ye kpɔvolɛma ne anyunlu nyiane guale aze. Na menli dodo ne amuala nyianle ye nwanwane gyima ne mɔɔ ɔlile la anwo ahomeka totohyia.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Ɛhye anzi ye, ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔkilehile bɛ Nana Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle ne anwo debie. Ɔbizale bɛ kɛ: “Nana Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle mumua ne le kɛ duzu debie? Duzu debie a menva mendo nwo memaa bɛde ɔ bo a? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Ɔle kɛ dubinli ma mɔɔ bɛlua ye wɔ tola nu la; ɔngyɛ na yeanyi yeayɛ baka buzuu, mɔɔ nloma yɛ bɛ sane wɔ ye ngane ne mɔ anu la. <verse eid="LUK 13:19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20-21" />Ɔle kɛ mgbɔvonle mɔɔ bɛva bɛfɔtɔ kpanwo la; ɛkanwu ye kokye la, ɛnee yemaa kpanwo ne ɛdu ɛyɛ wuduluu zɛhae.”<verse eid="LUK 13:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Ɔhɔle azua mgbole mgbole nee ngyikyi ngyikyi ne mɔ azo ɔhilehilele bɛ, na ɛhye mɔ amuala anu, ɛnee Gyɛlusalɛm ɛhɔlɛ ala a wɔ ye adwenle nu ɛsesebɛ a.<verse eid="LUK 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Na awie bizale ye kɛ, “Anzɛɛ ɛnee menli ekyii bie ala a banyia ngoanelielɛ ɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Na ɔbuale bɛ ɔzele kɛ, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24-25" />“Bɛbɔ mɔdenle kɛ bɛkɛwolo anlenkɛ ekyi ne anu; ɔluakɛ mese bɛ nɔhalɛ nu kɛ, menli dɔɔnwo ne ala bapele kɛ bɛbawolo nu, noko akee bɛnrɛhola. Aakomenle ne badwazo ado ye anlenkɛ ne anu, na awie biala mɔɔ gyi anlenkɛ ne anzi la babɔ nu aze kɛ, ‘Awulae, Awulae, buke yɛ anlenkɛ ne.’ Na ɔbabua yeaze bɛ kɛ, ‘Menze bɛ.’<verse eid="LUK 13:24-25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />“Akee bɛbabɔ ɔ bo bɛaze kɛ, ‘Yɛ nee wɔ lile, na yɛnlonle na ɛhilehilele yɛ wɔ awɔndenle ne mɔ azo.’<verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />“Na ɔbabua bɛ yeaze bɛ bieko kɛ, ‘Mese bɛ nɔhalɛ nu kɛ, menze ɛleka mɔɔ bɛvi a. Bɛvi ɛkɛ ne bɛhɔ, bɛmɛ ɛtanevolɛma.’<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />“Na ɛkɛ ne, akee ɛzunlɛ nee ahwibɛgye bara totohyia, wɔ melɛ mɔɔ bɛ nye dua Ebileham nee Ayezeke nee Gyekɔbo, nee kapezoma ne mɔ amuala wɔ Nana Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle ne anu la, noko akee bɛmɛ mɔ bɛye bɛ bɛvi nu. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Menli vi aleɛabo kpokpoti bara aradɛnla aze ado ɛsalɛ wɔ Nana Nyamenle Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Na bɛhakye kɛ: Alumuama bali amozi, yɛɛ amozi amra noko balumua.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Na dɔnehwele ko ne ala anu, Falasiima bie rale razele ye kɛ, “Ɛvi ɛke nriandi kɔ, ɔluakɛ Belemgbunli Hɛlɔdo kpondɛ wɔ ahu wɔ!”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ zele kɛ, “Bɛhɔze zɔhane ɛzonlɛ ne kɛ, mebahɔ zo meadu awozonle awozonle, na eza meayɛ ayileyɛlɛ nwo nwanwanendeɛ wɔ ɛnɛ nee ɛhyema; na ye kenle nsa ne azo a akee mebadwu ɛleka mɔɔ mekɔ la a. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Ɔle nɔhalɛ kɛ, ɔwɔ kɛ mefa ɛnɛ nee ɛhyema nee ye alehyenlɛ metu adenle ne! Ɔluakɛ sua biala ɛnle ɛkɛ boka Gyɛlusalɛm anwo, mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle kapezonli badɔ wɔ ɛkɛ ne a!<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Oo, Gyɛlusalɛm, Gyɛlusalɛm! Wɔmɔ mɔɔ ɛku ngapezoma ne mɔ, na ɛsi bɛdabɛ mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛzoa bɛ wɔ ɛ nwo lɔ la awolɛ a! Fane nyɛ yɛɛ mengulole kɛ menwɔhuohua ɛ mra anloa, kɛmɔ akɔlɛ di ɔ mra adane wɔ ɔ ndɛba abo la a; noko akee wɔammaa me adenle! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Na kɛkala bɛgyakyi wɔ aako ne bɛmaa ye nee ye gyinlabelɛ biala mɔɔ ɔwɔ nu la. Ɛbadɔ mgbane. Na akee meka meahile bɛ wienyi kɛ, bɛnrɛnwu me bieko ɛlɛ, kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛze kɛ, ‘Nyilalɛ ɛha mɔɔ lua Awulae duma nu ɛlɛba la.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1-2" />Na ɔrale ye kɛ, wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ko bie, Gyisɛse hɔle Dwuuma Mɛlalilɛ Eku ne anu mgbanyima ne mɔ ko sua nu hɔkpulale ɔ sa. Na Falasiima ne mɔ ziale mgbumgboonwu kɛ ahɔleɛ la nleanle kɛ saa ɔkɛyɛ nrenyia bie mɔɔ mgbutike ɛpɛ ye la ayile a.<verse eid="LUK 14:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Gyisɛse zele Falasiima nee mɛla kɛlɛvoma ne mɔ mɔɔ wɔ ɛkɛ ne la kɛ, “Asoo mɛla maa adenle kɛ bɛyɛ ayile wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne, anzɛɛ ɔnle zɔ ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Bɛangola ɛhye anloa ye; ɔti Gyisɛse zɔle nrenyia ne mɔɔ ɛnde kpɔkɛ la asa yɛle ye ayile, na ɔmaanle ɔhɔle.<verse eid="LUK 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Akee ɔdole ɔ nye wɔ bɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne na ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛ nuhua ne boni yɛɛ saa ɔ ra nrenyia anzɛɛ ye ayɛmoa tɔ, kuma nu wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle a ɔnrɛye ye ndɛndɛ zo a?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Bɛangola bɛanye ye ɔ nloa.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmapele gyinlabelɛ nwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Na mɔɔ ɔnwunle kɛ menli mɔɔ rale ɛkponledolɛ ne abo la anu ko biala kpondɛ enililɛ tɛnlabelɛ adɛnla la, ɔbule bɛ ɛrɛlɛ ɔzele bɛ kɛ: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Saa bɛfɛlɛ wɔ wɔ atɔfolɛ ɛkponledolɛ bo a, mmapele kɛ ɛkadɛnla ɛleka kpalɛ ne. Ɔboalekɛ, saa gyengyɛne nu bie ala awie mɔɔ tɛla wɔ gyinlabelɛ la ba a, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />mɔɔ liele atɔfolɛ ne la nee ye bara ɛleka mɔɔ ɛde la yearaze wɔ kɛ, ‘Dwazo maa nrenyia ɛhye ɛdɛnla ɛkɛ ne.’ Na saa ɔba ye zɛ noko a, ɛnee akee wɔmɔ ɛhye, mɔɔ nyiane ɛhu wɔ a!<verse eid="LUK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />“Emomu saa bɛfɛlɛ wɔ wɔ atɔfolɛ ɛkponledolɛ bo a, wɔmɔ kɔdɛnla ahanle ɛleka bie koonwu, amaa saa atɔfolɛ menle ne ba a, yeaze wɔ kɛ, ‘Ayi, tɛ wɔ tɛnlabelɛ ɛne! Bɛla nehae!’ Ɛbanwu kɛ ɛnee wɔnyia anyunlunyia totohyia wɔ atɔfolɛ ne abo wɔ menli ne kpokpoti anyunlu. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Ɔluakɛ awie biala mɔɔ kɛmaa ɔ nwo zo la bɛkɛbɛlɛ ye aze, yɛɛ awie biala noko mɔɔ kɛbɛlɛ ɔ nwo aze la, bɛkɛmaa ye zo.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Akee Gyisɛse zele nrenyia ne mɔɔ dole ɛkponle ne la kɛ, “Saa ɛto ɛkponle a; anrɛɛ mmafɛlɛvɛlɛ ɛ gɔnwo mɔ, anzɛɛ ɛ nwo amra, anzɛɛ azukoavolɛ mɔɔ zua wɔ la angomekye! Ɔluakɛ kɛ ɔkɛyɛ biala la bɛbayɛ bie bɛazie ɔ bo zo. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Emomu, saa ɛto ɛkponle a, anrɛɛ fɛlɛvɛlɛ ehyiavolɛma; abuburavolɛma, ɔ nee anyezinliravolɛma. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Ɛhye bamaa Nana Nyamenle ayila wɔ kpole. Ɛbanyia nwolɛ ahatualɛ wɔ Ewuledwazolɛ Mekɛ ne anu, ɔluakɛ bɛmɛ bɛnlɛ bie mɔɔ bɛbava bɛadua wɔ kakɛ bɛazie ɔ bo zo a.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Nrenyia ko bie mɔɔ ɛnee de Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ ne la deanle nu zele kɛ, “Nyilalɛ ɛha sonla ne mɔɔ banyia Nana Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle ne anu ɛkponledolɛ bo ahɔ la!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Gyisɛse bule ɛrɛlɛ ɛhye vale buale ye zele kɛ: “Nrenyia sukoavolɛ bie dole ɛkponle totohyia bie na ɔdole ɛsalɛ ɔvɛlɛle menli dɔɔnwo. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Mɔɔ bɛwiele aleɛ ne to la, ɔzoanle kɛ bɛhɔvɛlɛvɛlɛ menli mɔɔ ɔdole ɛsalɛ ɔvɛlɛle bɛ la kɛ bɛrɛla. <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Na bɛ muala bɛbɔle adwenle kɛ bɛsɛlɛzɛlɛ adenle. Nuhua ko zele kɛ, ‘Medɔ azɛlɛ, ɔti ɔhyia kɛ menwɔhɔ menwɔnlea. Mebodo wɔ, maa me adenle.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Ko noko zele kɛ, ‘Medɔ nlankɛ nnu, mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ mekɔnea bɛ a. Mebodo mɛsɛlɛ wɔ, maa me adenle.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Mɔɔ tɔ zo nsa ne la noko zele kɛ, ‘Melie atɔfolɛ. Zɔhane ati menrɛnyia adenle.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />“Akɛlɛ ne ziale rahanle ɛhye mɔ amuala hilele ɔ menle ne. Nrenyia ne vale ɛya na ɔzele ye akɛlɛ ne kɛ, ‘Kɔ gua nee awɔndenle ne mɔ azo na fɛlɛ awie biala, abuburavolɛma, anyezinliravolɛma nee ehyiavolɛma kɛ bɛrɛla atɔfolɛ ne abo.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Akɛlɛ ne buale zele kɛ, ‘Yɛmenle, meyɛ mɔɔ ɛhanle la mewie, noko akee ɛleka tɛbɔ ɛkɛ!’<verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />“Ɔ menle ne zele ye kɛ, ‘Mede, tɛla ɛweɛne, na kɔvɛlɛ awie biala mɔɔ ɛkɛnwu ye la kɛ ɔrɛla atɔfolɛ ne abo, amaa me aako ne ayi. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Akee mese bɛ kɛ, menli mɔɔ menlumuale menvɛlɛle bɛ na bɛamba la nuhua kokye bɔbɔ ɛnrɛzɔ me aleɛ ne bie ɛnrɛnlea ɛlɛ.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Menli dɔɔnwo ne ala dule wii doale ye. Na ɔdole ɔ nye ɔ nzi na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Awie biala mɔɔ kpondɛ kɛ ɔyɛ me ɛdoavolɛ la, ɔwɔ kɛ ɔkulo me ɔtɛla ɔ ze, ɔ nli, ɔ ye, ɔ mra, yɛɛ ɔ mediema, bɔbɔ ɔfa ɔdaye mumua ne ye ngoane ɔto aze, anrɛɛ yemɔ ɔnrɛhola ɔnrɛyɛ me ɛdoavolɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Yɛɛ mɔɔ anva ye meanubaka ne ando ɔ kɔme zo anli me nzi la, ɔdaye noko ɔnrɛhola ɔnrɛyɛ me ɛdoavolɛ.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Ɛhye ati dumua yɛ wɔ adwenle ngyehyɛleɛ kpalɛ kolaa na wɔabɔ ɔ bo. Ɔluakɛ awie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔkazi sua a ɔnlumua ɔnsese nwolɛ kakɛ ne ɔnnea kɛ saa ɔlɛ nwolɛ ezukoa a. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Yemɔ anrɛɛ ɔkawula bolɛ aze yeawie la, ɛnee yepɛ ɛhwɛ. Na ɔba ye zɛ noko a, ɛzelekɛ ala a bɛbazele ye a!<verse eid="LUK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />“Bɛbazi ye amgbu bɛaze kɛ, ‘Bɛnnea asomasi. Ɔdaye sua ko mɔɔ ɔse ɔsi la, yemɔ a ɛkpo ɛhɛlɛ mɔɔ ɛha ndile ne anu lɔ la!’<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Anzɛɛ belemgbunli ne boni yɛɛ kɛha ɛlalɛ kɛ ɔkɔ konle, na ɔnrɛlumua ɔ nee ye mgbanyima ɛnrɛhɔ agyinla ɛnrɛnwu ye kɛ saa ye azogya apenle bulu ne kɛhola apenle abulanwiɔ ne mɔɔ ɛlɛba ɔ nwo zo la a?<verse eid="LUK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />“Saa ɔnea na ɔnrɛyɛ boɛ a, mɔɔ ɔyɛ la a le kɛ, ɔsoa menli ɔmaa bɛkɔyia ɛlɔne ne adenle nu, na bɛ nee bɛ siezie bɛ avinli bɛmaa anzondwolɛ ba.<verse eid="LUK 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />“Zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ awie biala mɔɔ amkpo ye agyapadeɛ nee ewiade fɛlɛkolilɛ la ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛyɛ me ɛdoavolɛ a!<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Ngyenle le kpalɛ; na saa ye menlemenle ne fi nu a, ɛnee duzu nvasoɛ bieko a wɔ zo a? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ngyenle mɔɔ nuhua fɛlɛko ne kɛdu la, ɛnee yeyɛ mgbane bɔkɔɔ, nwolɛ ɛnlɛ nvasoɛ biala bieko, ɛvuandinle ala a ɔwɔ kɛ bɛfuandi bɛgua ye lɔ a. Ɛhye ati mɔɔ lɛ ɛnzolɛ la ɛdie.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔminlinle, na bɛnwu ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Ɛnee adwuledievolɛma mɔɔ nzisi ɛhu bɛ kuu, nee menli mɔɔ ɛtaneyɛlɛ a bɛdi bɛda la, ta ba kɛ bɛbadie Gyisɛse Nyamedwɛkɛ ne bie. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Ɛhye maanle Falasiima anzɛɛ Dwuuma asɔne mgbanyima ne mɔ nee mɛlakɛlɛvoma ne mɔ dendɛle dɔɔnwo, ɔluakɛ bɛnea a ɛnee Gyisɛse nee menli mɔɔ anwo ɛnde la ala a tu a, bɔbɔ ɔ nee bɛ a di aleɛ a! <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3-4" />Ɛhye ati Gyisɛse bule ɛrɛlɛ ɛhye hilele bɛ: “Bɛ nuhua ne boni a saa ɔlɛ mboane ɛya ko na bɛ nuhua ko minli a, ɔnrɛhɔkpondɛ ko ne mɔɔ ɛminli la kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ ɔkɛnwu ye la a? <verse eid="LUK 15:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Na saa ɔnwu ye a asoo ɔnrɛzoa ye ɔ kɔme zo ɔnrɛra sua zo ɔnrɛli nwolɛ fɛlɛko ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Na saa ɔba suazo noko a asoo ɔnrɛvɛlɛvɛlɛ ɔ gɔnwo mɔ nee ye aako nu amra kɛ bɛ nee ye ɛrali fɛlɛko, ɔluakɛ yenwu ye boane ko ne mɔɔ minlinle la ɔ?<verse eid="LUK 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />“Nɔhalɛ nu, zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ anwuma maanle ne bali fɛlɛko wɔ ɛtanevolɛ ko mɔɔ kɛzia kɛra Awulae ɛkɛ ne la anwo, tɛla abulahɔnla nee ngɔnla mɔɔ ɛtɛminlinle la anwo a!<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Anzɛɛ raalɛ ne boni a lɛ ye ezukoa nvutuke asomade bulu, na nuhua ko minli a, ɔnrɛzɔ nwolɛ tɛkɛ anzɛɛ kɛnlaneɛ ɔnrɛnleɛnlea ahodoka ne kpokpoti anu, na ɔnrɛkpoɔkpoa sua ne anu ɛnwea ne amuala ɔnrɛkegya dedee kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ ɔkɛnwu ye ɛ? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Na saa ɔnwu ye noko a, asoo ɔnrɛvɛlɛvɛlɛ ɔ gɔnwo mɔ nee ye aako nu amra kɛ bɛ nee ye ɛrali fɛlɛko ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Zɔhane ala yɛɛ Nana Nyamenle anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ di fɛlɛko wɔ ɛtanevolɛ kokye mɔɔ kɛnyia anlubɛnwo la anwo a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:10">Amaa bɛade ɛhye abo kpalɛ kpalɛ la, eza ɔbule bɛ ɛrɛlɛ ɛhye: <verse eid="LUK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />“Nrenyia bie lɛ mralɛ mrenyia nwiɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Na nuhua ekyi ne rale razele ɔ ze kɛ, ‘Egya, kyɛ wɔ agyapadeɛ ne anu na fa me afoa nu deɛ mɔɔ saa ɛwu a ɔkɛyɛ me deɛ la maa me!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:12">Amgba noko ɔhyɛle ye agyapadeɛ ne anu na ɔvale ye afoa nu deɛ ne ɔmaanle ye.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />“Na yeangyɛ biala, kpavolɛ ne zoale ye ninyɛne ne dule adenle hɔle moamoa. Na ɔzɛkyele ye ezukoa nee ɔ nwo ninyɛne muala wɔ huhunli nyɛleɛ nee ɛbɛlabɔlɛ ɛtane nwo. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Zɔhane mekɛ ne anu ala, ɛhɔne totohyia bie noko zile maanle ne anu. Kpavolɛ ye ɛhye mɔɔ ɛwie mia a! Ɛhɔne nee alɔbɔlɛ ngome ɛmaa ɔ nwo ɛli kɛ silikoko. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Ɔvale ɔ nwo ɔhɔbetanle maanlema ne mɔ bie mɔɔ sie agbolike la anwo. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Ɛhɔne anyezota ngome maanle ɔ nye bolole agbolike ne mɔ aleɛ mgbane ne bɔbɔ; noko nwane a amaa ye debie a?”<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />“Na nzinlii mɔɔ awieleɛ ne wiele ye la, akee ɔzele ɔ nwo kɛ, ‘Anzɛɛ Egya ɛnlɛ ngɛkɛlɛ dɔnwo bɛnli aleɛ ɔmbo bɛ nwo zo mɔɔ akee mame mela ɛke ɛhɔne ku me ado me lɔ a! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />“Mebahɔ egya anwo lɔ, na meahɔze ye kɛ, Egya; meyɛ ɛtane metia anwuma nee aze wɔ ɛ nyunlu, <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />na mendwu kɛ ɛkɛvɛlɛ me ɛ ra bieko bɔbɔ; emomu mesɛlɛ wɔ, fa me yɛ wɔ ngɛkɛlɛ ne mɔ anu ko ala.” ’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />“Ɔti amgba noko ɔzile nu kɛ ɔsia yeahɔ sua nu. Na mɔɔ ɛnee ɔtɛdua moa lɔ la, yɛɛ ɔ ze nwunle ye a. Na ɔvale ɛhulolɛ nee anwunvɔnezelɛ ɔnriandinle ɔhɔyiale ye, na ɔyɛle ye awawaatuu, na ɔvole ɔ nloa anwo.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />“Na ɔ ra ne zele ye kɛ, ‘Egya, meyɛ ɛtane metia anwuma nee aze wɔ ɛ nyunlu; na mendwu bɔbɔ kɛ bɛkɛvɛlɛ me ɛ ra bieko.’<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />“Noko ɔ ze ammaa ɔ nloa andɔ bɔbɔ. Ɔvɛlɛle ye ngɛkɛlɛ ne mɔ bie na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, ‘Bɛmaa bɛ nwo ɛyɛ ndɛ! Bɛva aboka ngɛnlɛma kpalɛ ne ko bɛraheda ye! Eza bɛva mgbɔdelera bɛrawula ɔ sa; na bɛva mgbɔlaboa bɛrawula ɔ gyakɛ! <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Na bɛhu nlankɛ mgbole ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛlɔ kpalɛ la anu ko bɛmaa yɛva yɛlie yɛ nye. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Ɔboalekɛ, me ra ɛhye, yemɔ nɔhalɛ nu, ɔwule, yɛɛ eza yezia yera ngoane nu a. Ɔminlinle bɔkɔɔ, yɛɛ eza yɛnwu ye a!’ Ɔti amgba noko bɛbɔle pilasilililɛ ne abo.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Mekɛ ɛhye anu, ɛnee ɔ ra kpanyinli ne ɛlɛyɛ gyima wɔ ɛya nu lɔ. Na mɔɔ ɔwiele, na ɔba sua nu la, ɛnee ɔte kɛ anyelielɛ ɛmaa aako ne anu ɛkpudwu kɛ mgbudwu zɛhae ala. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Ɔti ɔvɛlɛle ngɛkɛlɛ ne mɔ ko na ɔbizale ye kɛ, ‘Na duzu edwɛkɛ a ɛzi ɛke a?’<verse eid="LUK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />“Na akɛlɛ ne buale ye zele kɛ, ‘Ɛ diema ne ɛzia ɛra bieko, yɛɛ ɛ ze ɛmaa bɛhu ɛnlankɛ bedevinli kpalɛ ne bɛlɛto ye ɛkponle a; ɔboalekɛ ɔse, ɔyɛ ye fɛ kɛ debie anyɛ ye ɛmaa yeva ɔ nwo kɔlɔɔnwo yezia yera anzondwolɛ nu a.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />“Ɛhye yɛle ɔ diema kpanyinli ne ɛya totohyia, ɔti ɔkpole kɛ ɔkɛhɔ sua nu bɔbɔ. Na ɔ ze rale rabodole ye dedee la, <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />ɔzele ɔ ze kɛ, ‘Asoo ɛdawɔ nea kɛ mezi meyele me nwo mezonle wɔ wɔ ɛvolɛ dɔɔnwo ɛhye mɔɔ ɛze ɛhɔ la anu a; kenle ko bɔbɔ ɛnle ɛkɛ, mɔɔ mendule me gye wɔ wɔ ɛzoanlɛ nwo a. Noko ɛtɛsele me kɛ, Fa abɔnkye ralɛ ɛhye bɔbɔ ɛ nee ɛ gɔnwo mɔ bɛva bɛlielie bɛ nye ɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Noko akee ɛ ra ɛhye mɔɔ yehɔzɛkye wɔ ezukoa wɔ mraalɛ nee ɛbɛla funli nwo la, kɛ yemɔ ɔdwu ɛke ala la, wɔmaa bɛhu ɛnlankɛ bedevinli kpalɛ ko ye mɔɔ wɔ ɛke la bɛmaa ye.’<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />“Na ɔ ze buale ye zele kɛ, ‘Awolɛ, wɔmɔ a dahuu me nee wɔ de a, ɛhye ati mɔɔ melɛ ye biala la le wɔ deɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Noko ɔfa adenle nu kɛ yɛkɛli pilasili ɛhye. Ɔboalekɛ ɛ diema ɔ; ɔwule, yɛɛ yezia yera ngoane nu bieko a! Ɔminlinle, na yɛnwu ye!’ ” <verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Adawu adawu dɔɔnwo mɔɔ ɛzukoalɛndeɛ wɔ nu a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Gyisɛse akee bule ɛrɛlɛ ɛhye hilele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ: “Nrenyia sukoavolɛ bie bɔle awie ɛkpa kɛ ɔranlea ye gyima zo ɔmaa ye. Yeangyɛ biala yɛɛ bɛdoanle ye bɛhilele ye kɛ ɔnli nɔhalɛ a. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Ɛhye maanle ɔvɛlɛle ye na ɔbizale ye kɛ, ‘Na duzu ati a mete edwɛkɛ ɛtane zɛhae wɔ ɛ nwo ɛ? Ka ɛ nwo babu wɔ gyimanleanlɛ ne azo mgbonda kile me, ɔluakɛ mebaye wɔ ali ɛnɛ ala.’<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />“Ɛhye maanle ɛkpavo ne ati zile aze na ɔzele ɔ nwo kɛ, ‘Na kɛ mekɛyɛ ye ɛ? Mame ɛhye mɔɔ me nwo ɛnyɛ se wɔ akumadolɛ nwo a, na eza asɛlɛ noko yɛ me nyiane. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ɔnyɛ ɛhwee! Meze mɔɔ mebayɛ a, amaa saa ɔye me ali bɔbɔ a meanyia awie mɔ dɔɔnwo anlea me a!’<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5-6" />“Akee ɔvɛlɛvɛlɛle menli mɔɔ tua ɔ menle ne kakɛ la ngoko ngoko kɛ bɛranwu ye na bɛva nwolɛ adwenle. Ɔbizale mɔɔ lumua la kɛ, ‘Bosea ɛzɛ a ɛbɔle ye wɔ me menle ɛkɛ a?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:5-6">“Nrenyia ne buale ye kɛ, ‘Metua ye nwole nzuzulɛ apenle nsa ɛya nna.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:5-6">“Na ɔzele ye kɛ, ‘Ɔle zɔ. Nwolɛ daselɛlilɛ kɛlata ɛne. Die na tete yemɔ anu gua ye lɔ, na kɛlɛ wɔ kakɛ ne foa ko ala wɔ kɛlata fofolɛ zo!’<verse eid="LUK 16:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />“Eza ɔbizale mɔɔ doa ye la kɛ, ‘Na wɔmɔ noko ɛ? Ɛzɛ a ɛtua ye a?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">“Ɔdaye noko ɔbuale ye ɔzele kɛ, ‘Metua ye esamo ahodoku apenle ko.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">“Na ɔzele ye kɛ, ‘Die kɛlata dɛba ye tete nu, na kɛlɛ ahodoku ɛya mɔtwɛ!’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />“Ɛhye yɛle gyimamenle ne ahomeka totohyia, ɔluakɛ ye ɛkpavonli ne ze nrɛlɛbɛ wɔ ye ɛbɛlabɔlɛ nwo. Na amgba noko aleɛabo amra ze bɛ gyima nwo nrɛlɛbɛ tɛla adenle mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle menli deɛ ne pe zo bɔ bɛ ɛbɛla la. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Akee Gyisɛse hɔle zo zele bɛ kɛ, ɛhye ati memaa bɛade kɛ, anrɛɛ bɛva bɛ ninyɛne mɔɔ bɛlɛ ye wɔ ewiade anu la bie bɛyɛ ahunlunyele, amaa mekɛ mɔɔ ɔkɛwie la bɛalie bɛ bɛ sa amu nwiɔ, wɔ bɛ azua ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛmbɔ aze ɛlɛ la anu. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Mɔɔ mekile la a le kɛ, saa wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ da ali wɔ ninyɛne ngyebangyeba nwo a, yɛɛ ɔkile wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ wɔ mɔɔ sonle bolɛ noko la anwo a. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Na kakye kɛ, saa wɔanli aleɛabo agyapadeɛ nwo nɔhalɛ a, awie biala sulo kɛ ɔkɛva anwuma maanle ɛdeɛ ne mɔɔ anwo hyia kpalɛ ne la ɔkɛwula ɛ sa nu. <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Yɛɛ saa wɔanli awie mɔ ezukoa nwo nɔhalɛ noko a, bɛnrɛva mɔɔ le ɛdawɔ mumua ne wɔ deɛ la bɛnrɛwula ɛ sa; bɛbasisi ɛdawɔ noko wɔ wɔ deɛ ne anwo.<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Dasanli biala ɛngola ɛnzonle menlelɛ nwiɔ ɛmmaa ɔnyɛ boɛ. Saa ɔba ye zɛ a, ɔbahulo ko edwɛkɛ na yeakpo ko. Ɛhye ati ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛzonle Awulae Nana Nyamenle nee ezukoa noko.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Falasiima ne mɔ mɔɔ ezukoa ala a bɛkulo la zile ye amgbu wɔ ɛhye mɔɔ ɔhanle la anwo.<verse eid="LUK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmɛ mɔ menli anyunlu yɛɛ bɛyɛ kɛ asɛɛ bɛ nwo te a, na Nana Nyamenle noko anye dua bɛ ahonle evinli ne mɔ anu. Bɛ mɛlɛbɛla ne maa menli di bɛ eni, noko akee wɔ Nana Nyamenle anyunlu, yemɔ ɔle kyibadeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Mekɛ mɔɔ ɛnee Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne ɛtɛbale la, ɛnee Mosisi mɛla ne nee ngapezoma edwɛkɛ ne ala a bɛdi zo a. Mɔɔ Dwɔn Edwɛkpa ne ralale ye ali kɛ Awulae Belemgbunli maanle ne ɛbikye la, menli dɔɔnwo ne ala nriandinle kɛ bɛkɔ maanle zɔhane anu. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Noko ɛhye ɛngile kɛ Mɛla ne azo ɛde. Ɔtɛgyi ɛkɛ ne kpundii kɛ anwuma nee aze la.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Zɔhane ati awie biala mɔɔ kɛbɔ ɔ ye ewuole, na ɔkɛgya fofolɛ la ɛnee yezɛkye agyalɛ; yɛɛ awie biala noko mɔɔ kɛgya raalɛ mɔɔ bɛbɔ ye ewuole la, ɛnee yedo agyalɛ mɛla.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Eza Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Nrenyia sukoavolɛ bie wale ɛkɛ. Alehyenlɛ biala ɔbɔ ye aboka ɔgua nu, na ɔto ɛkponle ɔdielie ɔ nye. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Nrenyia ehyianli bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Lazalɛse mɔɔ nganlɛ ɛdudu ye la noko ɛnee bada nrenyia sukoavolɛ ne ɛbolɔnsane ne abo, amaa saa nrenyia sukoavolɛ ne aleɛ ne bie kpokpo gua aze a, yeasesa yeali. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Mekɛ mɔɔ ɔsesa mgbokpoleka ne yeali la, ɛnee ahwea noko ɛlɛtafetafe ye nganlɛ ne mɔ anu. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Ɔrale ye kɛ, Lazalɛse ehyiavolɛ ne wule, na anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ ramaanle ye zo hɔdole Ebileham akɛnra nu. Nrenyia sukoavolɛ ne ɔdaye noko ɔwule na bɛziele ye, <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />na ye ɛkɛla ne hɔle abɔnsam sua zo. Mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnwu amaneɛ la, ɔnwunle kɛ Lazalɛse noko nee Ebileham ɛlɛdi fɛlɛko wɔ moamoa nehane.<verse eid="LUK 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />“Na ɔdeanle nu ɔzele kɛ, ‘Egya Ebileham, nwu me anwunvɔne! Soa Lazalɛse maa ɔva ɔ sa ɛrɛlɛsɛka mgbane bɔbɔ ɔbɔ ye nzule nu ɔva ɔrape me tafinlima azo ɔmaa me ahonle ɛnlu fɔɔnwo, na melɛnwu amaneɛ wɔ sendɔlɛra ye anu!’<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />“Ebileham buale ye zele kɛ, ‘Ralɛ, kakye kɛ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛde aze mɔɔ ɛdi fɛlɛko la, ɛnee Lazalɛse noko ɛlɛdi ehyia nee nyane, Ɔti ɛnɛ ɔdaye noko ɔ rɛle ɛkyekye wɔ ɛke, yɛɛ ɛdawɔ noko ɛlɛnwu amaneɛ a. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Eza yeanga ye zɔ noko, kuma kulongulo bie la yɛ nee wɔ avinli mɔɔ ɔlua zo awie vi ɛke ba lɔ a ɔnyɛ boɛ, yɛɛ awie noko vi lɔ ba ɛke a ɔnyɛ boɛ a.’<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />“Akee nrenyia sukoavolɛ ne buale ye zele kɛ, ‘Ao, Egya Ebileham, mebodo wɔ, soa ye maa ɔhɔ egya sua nu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />na ɔhɔbɔ me mediema nnu ne kɔkɔ, ammaa bɛanyɛ mɔɔ mede aze la menyɛle la bie, na kenle bie bɛdabɛ noko bɛannwu amaneɛ kɛmɔ melɛnwu ye la.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />“Ebileham buale ye kɛ, ‘Dahuu bɛka Mosisi nee ngapezoma ne mɔ anwo edwɛkɛ bɛkile bɛ, ɔti maa bɛva bɛdu bɛ nwo folɛ.’<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />“Nrenyia sukoavolɛ ne buale ye zele kɛ, ‘Kyɛkyɛ, Egya Ebileham, ɔnrɛkputi bɛ ahonle bɔbɔ kɛ bɛkenga. Na emomu, saa awie vi ɛbolɔ ɛke kɔ kɔkakile bɛ a, yɛɛ bɛbanlu bɛ nwo a.’<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />“Na Ebileham zele ye kɛ, ‘Saa bɛandie Mosisi nee ngapezoma ne mɔ bɔbɔ a, ɛnee noko saa awie vi mɔwuamra anu dwazo kɔ bɔbɔ a, bɛnrɛdie ye.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Kenle ko bie Gyisɛse zele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Kɛ ɔkɛyɛ biala la, sɔnea bara amaa menli ayɛ ɛtane, na emomu ɛdawɔ mɔɔ ɛkɛmaa sɔnea ne kɛlua ɛ nwo zo kɛra la, ɛnee wɔ gyakɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2-3" />Mebɔ bɛ kɔkɔ kɛ, ɛdawɔ mɔɔ ɛkɛmaa ngakula ngyikyi ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ ɛnze nwolɛ bie la anu ko bɔbɔ anwo kɛbu ɛbonle la, saa bɛkyekyele ɛ kɛnra ɛdibolɛ bɛhɔdole wɔ nyevile ne akɔme zo nehane bɔbɔ a, anrɛɛ ɛnee ɔle kpalɛ!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:2-3">“Ɛhye ti saa ɛ diema yɛ wɔ ɛtane a tea ye, ɔnu ɔ nwo a, fa kyɛ ye. <verse eid="LUK 17:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Saa kenle ko bɔbɔ ɔyɛ wɔ ɛtane fane nsuu na eza noko ɔsɛlɛ wɔ fakyɛ fane nsuu wɔ ɛtane ko biala anwo a, fa kyɛ ye.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Diedi nee nyele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Mekɛ bie ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ zele Gyisɛse kɛ, “Awulae, wula yɛ diedi kpundii!”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ zele kɛ, “Saa bɛlɛ diedi mɔɔ ye kpole le kɛ dubinli ma bɔbɔ la a, anrɛɛ bɛse baka kɛ ɔdudu ɔhɔgua nyevile nu a, saa ɔyɛ zɔ; anrɛɛ bɛka edwɛkɛ biala a ɔnrɛli mgba ɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:6" /><verse number="7-9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7-9" />Saa akɛlɛ kɔso ɔ menle ɛya anzɛɛ ɔkɔnea ɔ menle mboane, na ɔkpɔne ɔba a, ɛkɛ ne ala ɔngɔndɛnla aze ɔnli aleɛ, emomu ɔdumua ɔto ɔ menle ne aleɛ ɔnea ɔmaa ɔdi ye deɛ ɔwie bɔkɔɔ na ɔdaye mumua ne yeali ye deɛ ne. Noko mo mgbane bɔbɔ bɛnyɛ ye bie, ɔluakɛ ɔle ye gyima mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ɔyɛ a. <verse eid="LUK 17:7-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Zɔhane ala noko, yɛɛ saa bɛdabɛ noko bɛtie me ne na bɛyɛ mɔɔ meka mekile bɛ la a, ɔnle kɛ bɛkpondɛ moyɛlɛ biala a. Ɔluakɛ ɛnee mɔɔ le bɛ gyima ala la yɛɛ bɛyɛ la!”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Mɔɔ bɛkɔ Gyɛlusalɛm la, bɛhɔdwule Galeli nee Samɛlea ɛweɛne zo, <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />na mɔɔ ɛnee bɛlɛkɔ bɛahɔvo namule bie azo la, kokobɛvolɛma bulu bie yiale ye adenle; bɛgyinlanle moamoa nehane <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />na bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Awulae Gyisɛse, nwu yɛ anwunvɔne!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Ɔnleanle bɛ koonwu na ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛhɔva bɛ nwo bɛhile Dwuuma azɛlɛvolɛ ne mɔ!” Na ɔrale ye kɛ, mɔɔ bɛkɔ la bɛnwunle kɛ bɛ nwo ɛza.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Bɛ nuhua ko ziale rale Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ na ɔvale fɛlɛkolilɛ ɔhanle kɛ, “Nyilalɛ ɛha Nana Nyamenle. Ɔluakɛ me nwo ɛza bɔkɔɔ!” <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Ɔrabutule Gyisɛse anyunlu ɛkɛ, na ɔyɛle ye mo wɔ mɔɔ yeyɛ yemaa ye la anwo. Nrenyia ɛhye ɛnee le Samɛleanli.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Gyisɛse bizale bɛ kɛ, “Anzɛɛ tɛ menli bulu yɛɛ menyɛle bɛ ayile ɔ? Na nuhua ngɔnla ne wɔ nienwu? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Yemɔti ɛyɛvolɛ kotokokye ɛhye ala yɛɛ ziale rale kɛ ɔbayɛ Nana Nyamenle mo ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Akee Gyisɛse zele nrenyia ne kɛ, “Dwazo na kɔ. Wɔ diedi ɛlie wɔ ngoane.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Siezie ɛ nwo kendɛ me ɛzialɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Kenle ko bie Falasiima ne mɔ bizale Gyisɛse kɛ, “Kenle nzu a Nana Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle ne bara a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:20">Gyisɛse buale zele kɛ, “Nana Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle ne ye ɛralɛ ɛnle deɛ mɔɔ bɛnwu ye bɛ nye zo a. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Bɛnrɛhola bɛnrɛze kɛ, ‘Yebɔ ɔ bo wɔ ɛke anzɛɛ nehane.’ Ɔboalekɛ Nana Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle mumua ne de bɛ nu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Nzinlii, ɔhanle ɛhye anwo edwɛkɛ ɔhilele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Melɛ bie ɛlɛba mɔɔ bɛ kunlu anu a anrɛɛ bɛbanyia Sonla Ra ne bɛ nee ye adɛnla kenle ko bɔbɔ ala a, noko akee bɛnrɛnyia ye zɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Bɛbatete ye huhuhuhu kɛ Sonla Ra ne ɛzia ɛra, na ɔwɔ ɛke anzɛɛ nehane. Noko akee bɛmmadie bɛdi, yɛɛ bɛmmase kɛ bɛkɔ bɛahɔkpondɛ ye. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Nɔhalɛ mɔɔ wɔ nu la a le kɛ saa ɔsia ɔba a, ɔbala ali wienyi; tɛ awie yɛɛ abaha ahile wɔ a. Ɔluakɛ Sonla Ra ne maleɛ ne bayɛ kɛ ɛsɛlɛmanye mɔɔ ɛlɛfedevede anwomanyunlu la. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Noko akee ɔwɔ kɛ ɔdumua ɔnwu amaneɛ kpole kpalɛ, na ɛlɔnwɔne ɛhye kpokpoti kpo ye.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />“Kɛmɔ Nowa melɛ zo menli anva Nana Nyamenle edwɛkɛ biala anyɛ ɛhwee la, zɔhane ala a ɔbayɛ wɔ Sonla Ra ne mekɛ ne a. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Bɛlile na bɛnlonle, na bɛgyale bɛ nwo; na bɛlɛ ye zɔ dedee hɔkpulale kenle ko demua ne mɔɔ Nowa hɔle ɛlɛne ne anu na azuyilɛ ne razɛkyele bɛ kpokpoti la.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />“Bieko, kɛmɔ ɛnee ɔde ye wɔ Lɔɔto mekɛ zo la, kɛ ɔbayɛ ye ala ɛne: ɛnee menli ɛlɛdi bɛ gyima mɔɔ hyia bɛ la: bɛlile, bɛnlonle, bɛlile gua, bɛzonle ɛya, na bɛsisile azua, <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />hɔkpulale nwonlomɔ ne mɔɔ Lɔɔto vile Sodɔm yele ɔ nwo na sendɔlɛra vi anwuma rale razɛkyele bɛ kosooti la. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Zɔhane ala yɛɛ ɔbayɛ wɔ mekɛ ne mɔɔ bɛbaye Sonla Ra ne bɛahile la a.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />“Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ zɔhane kenle ne ɛnee bɛhɔ ɛbɔ nu la, mmase kɛ bɛsia bɛara sua zo; yɛɛ bɛdabɛ noko mɔɔ bɛvi sua nu zɔhane kenle ne la mmase kɛ bɛsia bɛ nzi bɛarasesa bɛ ninyɛne. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Bɛhakye mɔɔ zile Lɔɔto aye ne anwo zo la! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Awie biala mɔɔ kɛpele kɛ ɔdie ye ngoane la, ɔbaminli ye; na emomu awie biala noko mɔɔ kɛhwele ye ngoane la asa baha ye. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Zɔhane nɔe ne ɔbara ye kɛ menli nwiɔ mɔɔ la ɛsokpa ko azo la, bɛbava ko na bɛagyakyi ko ne. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35-36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35-36" />Mraalɛ nwiɔ mɔɔ ɛlɛpe abɛlɛ wɔ agyaade la, bɛbava ko bɛagyakyi ko ne; yɛɛ zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ ɔbayɛ wɔ mrenyia mɔɔ ɛnee ɛlɛyɛ gyima wɔ ɛleka ko la afoa nu a.”<verse eid="LUK 17:35-36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Akee ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bizale ye kɛ, “Awulae, ɛnee nienwu a bɛ nee bɛ bahɔ a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Gyisɛse buale bɛ zele kɛ, “Ɛleka mɔɔ debie funli la la, ɛkɛ ne a: mgbɔtɛ ne mɔ noko kuohua bɛ nloa a!”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Kɔ zo sɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Kenle ko bie, Gyisɛse bule ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɛrɛlɛ vale hilele ɛhyianlɛ mɔɔ ɔhyia kɛ bɛkɛyɛ asɔne dahuu, kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ bɛ sa kɛha bɛ ɛbizalɛndeɛ la.<verse eid="LUK 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Ɔzele kɛ: “Ɛnee ndɛnebuavolɛ bie wɔ sua bie azo. Ɔnzulo Nana Nyamenle bɔbɔ, na yeabu dasanli biala bie. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Kunlavolɛ raalɛ bie mɔɔ ɛnee awie ɛlɛsisi ye la, vale ye edwɛkɛ radole ɔ nyunlu mekɛ dɔɔnwo ne ala kɛ ɔli ɔmaa ye. Dahuu biala kɛ ɔgyi ndɛnebuavolɛ ne anwo zo ala ɛne. <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4-5" />Ndɛnebuavolɛ ne ɛmpili ɔ nwo; noko yeangyakyi ɛralɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:4-5">“Nzinlii, akee ɔzele ɔ nwo kɛ, ‘Aa, medame a mese menzulo Nyamenle na meazulo sonla dasanli a, noko akee saa meanli raalɛ ɛhye ye edwɛkɛ ne meammaa ye a ɔnrɛmaa me nwo ɛnrɛdɔ me ɛlɛ!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Akee Awulae zele kɛ, “Saa ndɛnebuavolɛ atisesebɛvo ye bɔbɔ ɛlɛka ɛhye a, <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />ɛnee ɛnzuzu kɛ kɛ ɔkɛyɛ biala la, Nana Nyamenle noko baho alie ye menli mɔɔ nɔɔzo nee ewiazo bɛsu bɛsɛlɛ ye moalɛ la ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Nɔhalɛ nu, ɔbabua bɛ ndɛndɛ ne ala! Noko akee edwɛkɛ ne a le kɛ: Saa sonla Ra ne ba a, menli nyɛ yɛɛ ɔbarado bɛ kɛ bɛlɛ diedi na bɛlɛsɛlɛ a?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Akee ɔhanle ɛhye ɔhilele bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛbu bɛ nwo kɛ bɛle tenlenema, na bɛtoto awie mɔ anwo nyɛlɛ la kɛ:<verse eid="LUK 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Mrenyia nwiɔ hɔle asɔne sua nu kɛ bɛkazɛlɛ. Ko le Falasiinli, mɔɔ mgbanyizonle nee amemaabɛnwozo ɛhu ye kuu, yɛɛ ko ne noko le adwuledievolɛ nzisivo. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Falasiinli ne ‘zɛlɛle’ kɛ: ‘O, Nana Nyamenle, meyɛ wɔ mo kɛ menle ɛtanevolɛ kɛ menli mɔɔ ɛha mɔɔ bɔ apo, na bɛnli pɛlepɛle, na bɛsɛkye agyalɛ, bɔbɔ kɛ adwuledievolɛ ne mɔɔ gyi nehane la; <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />mekye ɛhɔne kenle nwiɔ wɔ dapɛne ko anu, yɛɛ debie biala mɔɔ melɛ ye la, mekyɛ nuhua bulu mefa ko megua asɔne gya ne anu.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />“Na adwuledievolɛ ne mɔɔ nzisi ɛhu ye kuu la, noko gyinlanle moamoa na ɔzile ɔ ti aze, na ɔvale ɔ sa ɔbilebilale ɔ kɛnra azo wɔ anwoazehanlɛ nu ala na ɔzele kɛ, ‘Nana Nyamenle, nwu me anwunvɔne, ɔluakɛ mele ɛtanevolɛ.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Na meka meahile bɛ wienyi kɛ, adwuledievolɛ ɛhye nyianle ɛtanefakyɛ wɔ Nana Nyamenle anyunlu gyakyile Falasiinli ne! Ɔluakɛ awie biala mɔɔ kɛmemaa ɔ nwo zo la, bɛkɛbɛlɛ ye aze, na awie biala mɔɔ kɛbɛlɛ ɔ nwo aze la, bɛkɛmaa ye zo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Kenle ko bie awie mɔ vale bɛ mra rɛlɛle Gyisɛse kɛ ɔyila bɛ. Na ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ nwunle bɛ la bɛvoanle bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16-17" />Akee Gyisɛse vɛlɛle mbɛda ne mɔ ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne na ɔzele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Bɛmaa ngakula ne mɔ adenle bɛmaa bɛrɛla me nwo! Bɛmmafoa bɛ fee! Ɔboalekɛ menli mɔɔ lɛ diedi ahonle kɛ ngakula ɛhye mɔ ɛdeɛ ne la, bɛmɛ a Awulae Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle ne le bɛ deɛ a. Na awie biala mɔɔ ɛnlɛ diedi mɔɔ le kɛ ngakula ne mɔ ɛdeɛ ne bie la, ɛnrɛbikye Belemgbunli maanle ne anlenkɛ kpole ne bɔbɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 18:16-17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sukoavolɛ nrenyia nee ye ngyianlɛdeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Kenle ko Dwuunli kpavolɛ bie rabizale Gyisɛse kɛ, “Yɛmenle kpalɛ, duzu a meyɛ a menwɔnyia ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Gyisɛse bizale ye kɛ, “Asoo ɛte ‘kpalɛ’ ne mɔɔ ɛlɛfɛlɛ me la abo ɔ? Memaa wɔade kɛ awie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ mɔɔ ɔle kpalɛ boka Nana Nyamenle anwo a. Yemɔ ɔ ngomekye ala a ɔle kpalɛ a. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Na emomu mɔɔ fale wɔ kpuyia ne anwo la, mɔɔ meka la a le kɛ, ɛdawɔ ɛze mɛla bulu ne: mmasɛkye agyalɛ, mmaku sonla, mmawua, mmadi daselɛ adalɛ di ɛ ze nee ɛ nli eni, ɔ nee mɔɔ bokɛboka nwo la.”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Nrenyia ne buale kɛ, “Sumunli me ngakula nu, meli mɛla ɛhye mɔ anu ko biala azo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Yeha debie ko mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ɛyɛ a. Tɔne wɔ agyapadeɛ mɔɔ ɛlɛ ye la amuala, na fa ezukoa ne kyɛ ehyiavolɛma. Ɛhye bahakyi agyapadeɛ amaa wɔ wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu, na akee bɛla na bali me nzi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Nrenyia ne dele ɛhye la, ɔvale nyane ɔhɔle, ɔluakɛ ɔle sukoavolɛ totohyia kpalɛ.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Gyisɛse nleanle ɔ kɔme anzi koonwu, na akee ɔzele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ nu, ɔyɛ se kpalɛ ɔmaa sukoavolɛ kɛ ɔkɛhɔ Nana Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle ne anu a! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Ɔnrɛyɛ ɛsesebɛ ɔnrɛmaa afunlumu kɛ ɔkɛwolo agbuyia tokule nu tɛla kɛ sukoavolɛ kɛhɔ Nana Nyamenle Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu a.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Menli mɔɔ dele kɛ ɔlɛka ɛhye la zele kɛ, “Wio! Na saa zɛhae a ɔde a, ɛnee akee nwane bɔbɔ a kɛhola kɛnyia ngoanelielɛ a?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Na ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Mɔɔ yɛ se maa sonla dasanli la, ɔnza Nana Nyamenle yɛ!”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Na Pita zele kɛ, “Awulae, na yɛdayɛ mɔɔ yɛgyakyi yɛ debie biala na yɛrali ɛ nzi noko la ɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Ɔle zɔ, na memaa bɛade ɔ bo wienyi kɛ awie biala noko mɔɔ ɛgyakyi ye aako, ɔ ye, ɔ mediema, ye awovolɛma, nee ɔ mra wɔ Awulae Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle ne duma nu ti la, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />banyia bɛ mɔnwo wɔ kɛkala mekɛ ye anu, na eza noko yeanyia ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ ye awieleɛ wɔ ewiade ne mɔɔ bara la anu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Akee ɔvɛlɛle Bulu nee Nwiɔ ne na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Ayi mɔ, bɛnlea, yɛlɛkɔ Gyɛlusalɛm. Na saa yɛdwu ɛkɛ ne a, mɔɔ ngapezoma ɛha ye wɔ Sonla Ra ne anwo dɛbadɛba la amuala bayɛ zɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Bɛbaye ye bɛamaa Maanle Gyɛne zo amra ne mɔ bɛamaa bɛazi ye amgbu, na bɛagua ɔ nyunlu nyiane aze bɛatoto nyɛlɛ ɔ nwo; <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />bɛbabilebila ye empele, na bɛahu ye. Na ye kenle nsa ne azo ɔbadwazo yeara ngoane nu bieko.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Bɛande ɛhye mɔ biala abo; ɔyɛle bɛ nzo nu kɛ asɛɛ agyebɛ edwɛkɛ bie la.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Na mɔɔ bɛbikyele Gyɛleko la, ɛnee nrenyia anyezinliravolɛ bie de adehanle ne ɛlɛsɛlɛzɛlɛ ezukoa. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Mɔɔ ɔdele kɛ menli dɔɔnwo bie ɛlɛyɛ dede pɛ nu la, ɔbizale deɛ mɔɔ ɛlɛkɔ zo a. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Bɛzele ye kɛ Gyisɛse mɔɔ vi Nazalɛte la ɛlɛse. <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Ɛhye maanle ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔteɛdea nu kɛ, “Gyisɛse, Devidi Ara, nwu me anwunvɔne!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Menli mɔɔ li Gyisɛse anyunlu la deɛdeanle ye nu kɛ ɔmua ɔ nloa. Noko ɛnee bɔ zo mɔɔ ɔ nye ɛbolo kpole kpalɛ ɔlɛtea nu kɛ, “Devidi Ara, nwu me anwunvɔne” a!<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse radwule nrenyia ne anwo ɛkɛ ne la, ɔgyinlanle na ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛva anyezinliravolɛ ne bɛrɛla ɛke.” <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />Gyisɛse bizale nrenyia ne kɛ, “Duzu a ɛkpondɛ a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Nrenyia ne zɛlɛle ye ɔzele kɛ, “Awulae, amaa meanwu debie!”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Nwu debie! Wɔ diedi ɛmaa wɔde kpɔkɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Na ɛkɛ ne ala, amgba ɔ nye nwiɔ ne bukele, na ɔdoale Gyisɛse ɔyele Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ. Na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnwunle ɛhye la amuala noko yele Awulae Nyamenle ayɛlɛ.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Nɔhalɛlilɛ nwo ahatualɛ kpalɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1-2" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse pɛ nu wɔ Gyɛleko la, nrenyia sukoavolɛ bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Zakeɛse, mɔɔ le Wulomu adwulelielɛ gyima ne anwo mgbanyima ne mɔ ko la, <verse eid="LUK 19:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />pelele kɛ ɔkɛnwu Gyisɛse, noko akee kɛmɔ ɔle sonla adwola la ati, ɛlɔne ne wale ɔ nye. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Ɛhye ati ɔnriandinle ɔlile bɛ nyunlu ɔhɔvole egyane bie mɔɔ gyi adehanle ɛkɛ ne la azo, amaa saa Gyisɛse badwu ɛkɛ ne a, yeanwu ye kpalɛ.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Amgba noko Gyisɛse radwule ɛkɛ ne la, ɔdole ɔ nye anwuma ɔnleanle Zakeɛse, na ɔbɔle ye duma ɔvɛlɛle ye ɔzele kɛ, “Zakeɛse, ka ɛ nwo dwu aze! Ɔluakɛ wɔ sua nu a ɛnɛ meba mearazokoɛ a!”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Zakeɛse dwule aze ndɛndɛ ne ala, na ɔvale Gyisɛse ɔhɔle ye sua nu wɔ fɛlɛkolilɛ nu ala.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Menli dodo ne akunlu andwo bɛ nwo wɔ ɛhye anwo. Bɛdendɛle bɛ nzo abo bɛzele kɛ, “Yehɔ yehɔzokoɛ ɛtanevolɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Zakeɛse noko gyinlanle Awulae anyunlu ɛkɛ na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Awulae, ɔvi ɛnɛ mɔɔ kɔ la mebava me agyapadeɛ ne anu foa ko meahyɛ ehyiavolɛma; eza noko awie biala mɔɔ mebɔ ye apo meza ye melie ye debie ɛlɛ la, mebabɔnye nwolɛ fane nna meahɔmaa ye!”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9-10" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Ɛhye kile kɛ amgba ngoanelielɛ ɛra aako ye anu ɛnɛ. Nrenyia ɛhye boka Ebileham abo zo amra ne mɔ mɔɔ minlinle la anwo, na Mame, Anyunlunyia Ra ne noko, mera kɛ mebakpondɛ bɛ, na eza mealie menli mɔɔ le zɛhae la ngoane.”<verse eid="LUK 19:9-10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Na kɛmɔ nee bɛbikye Gyɛlusalɛm la ati, Gyisɛse bule ɛrɛlɛ ɛhye hilele bɛ kɛ bɛmmadwenle kɛ asɛɛ Nana Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle ne maleɛ ne ala a ɛnyia ɛdwu zo la.<verse eid="LUK 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Ɔse: “Nrenyia anyunlunyiavolɛ bie mɔɔ ɛnee de maanzinli bie anu la nyianle nrɛlaleɛ kɛ ɔrɛla suakpole ne azo ɔmaa bɛyɛ ye belemgbunli wɔ ye maanzinli ne anu. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Kolaa na ɔbadu ɔ bo la, ɔvɛlɛle ye ngɛkɛlɛ ne mɔ anu bulu na ɔhyɛle pɔne bulu ɔmaanle bɛ ɔzele bɛ kɛ, ‘Bɛva ɛhye bɛli gua, kɔkpula kɛ menwɔzia menwɔra la.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Na mɔɔ ɔdule ɔ bo ala la, ye ngɛkɛlɛ ne mɔ anu bie vale ɔ nwo akpame. Bɛzoanle awie bɛmaanle ɔvale nrɛlaleɛ ɛhye ɔhɔmaanle ye kɛ, ‘Yɛngulo kɛ nrenyia ɛhye kɛyɛ yɛ belemgbunli.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Mɔɔ ɔrale, mɔɔ ɛnee bɛyɛ ye belemgbunli la, ɔvɛlɛle bɛdabɛ mɔɔ ɔvale ezukoa ne ɔmaanle bɛ la kɛ bɛrayɛ nwolɛ mgbonda bɛhile ye.<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />“Mɔɔ lumua la rale razele kɛ, ‘Yɛmenle, menyia wɔ pɔne ko ne anwo nvasoɛ pɔne bulu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />“Belemgbunli ne zele ye kɛ, ‘Mo somaa, me akɛlɛ kpalɛ! Kɛmɔ wɔli ekyi ye mɔɔ menvale memaanle wɔ la anwo nɔhalɛ la ati, ɛbazie azua mgbole bulu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />“Mɔɔ tia ye nwiɔ ne noko la rale razele kɛ, ‘Yɛmenle, wɔ pɔne ko ne anwo nvasoɛ ɛyɛ pɔne abulanlu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />“Ɔzele ye kɛ, ‘Mo somaa, ɛdawɔ noko ɛbanlea azua mgbole nnu azo.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />“Akee mɔɔ tɔ zo nsa ne la noko rale razele kɛ, ‘Yɛmenle, wɔ pɔne ko ne mɔɔ ɛvale ɛmaanle me la ɛne. Menkyekyele ye wɔ fuazinli nu menvale menziele koonwu, <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />ɔluakɛ meze ye wienyi kɛ wɔmɔ ɛnlua na wɔabu, yɛɛ mɔɔ le awie deɛ bɔbɔ la ɛnee ɛlɛsa ye wɔalie!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Na belemgbunli ne vale ɛya kpole na ɔzele ye kɛ, ‘Wɔmɔ akɛlɛ atisesebɛvo! Mebalua ɛ nloa edwɛkɛ zo me nee wɔ ali kɛmɔ ɛdawɔ ɛlɛka la. Saa ɛdawɔ ɛse ɛze me nwo edwɛkɛ muala, ɛze kɛ me edwɛkɛ ye se, menlua na meabu, na eza awie mɔ deɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛ la a mesa bɛ medie a, <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />ɛnee akee duzu ati a wɔanva me ezukoa ne wɔangɔndo bange a; amaa saa yeanyɛ boɛ fee bɔbɔ a meanyia nwolɛ nvasoɛ ekyi bɔbɔ a?’<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Akee ɔzele menli mɔɔ gyigyi ɛkɛ ne la kɛ, ‘Bɛza ye bɛlie pɔne ko ne ɔ sa nu, na bɛva bɛmaa nrenyia ne mɔɔ lɛ pɔne bulu ne la.’<verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />“Bɛzele ye kɛ, ‘Yɛmenle, ɔlɛ pɔne bulu dɛba!’<verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />“Na ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, ‘Meka meahile bɛ nɔhalɛ nu kɛ, mɔɔ lɛ bie la yɛɛ banyia bie aboka nwo a; na mɔɔ ɛnlɛ bie la, yemɔ ekyi ne bɔbɔ mɔɔ ɔlɛ ye la, bɛbaza ye bɛalie. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Na me kpɔvolɛma noko mɔɔ vale me nwo akpame la, bɛmɛ bɛva bɛ bɛrɛla me nyunlu ɛke bɛrahu bɛ.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛbikye Gyɛlusalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Ɛhye anzi ye, Gyisɛse zɔle ye Gyɛlusalɛm adendulɛ ne azo, na ɔlumuale ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anyunlu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Mɔɔ bɛbikyele Bɛtefagye nee Bɛtani, mɔɔ wɔ Boka Ɔlivi ne azo la, ɔzoanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu nwiɔ ɔmaanle bɛlumuale. <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />Ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛhɔ sua ko ne mɔɔ wɔ bɛ nyunlu ɛkɛ ne la azo, na bɛbanwu afunlumu ralɛ mɔɔ awie ɛtɛtɛnlanle ɔ nwo zo ɛlɛ la kɛ ɔhenda adehanle ne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:30">“Bɛzanyi ye na bɛva bɛrɛlɛ me. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Saa awie biala biza bɛ kɛ, ‘Duzu ati a bɛlɛsanyi ye a,’ bɛze ye kɛ, ‘Awulae ɛhyia ɔ nwo.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Amgba noko bɛhɔle na bɛnwunle ye kɛmɔ Gyisɛse zele bɛ ala la pɛ, <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />na mɔɔ bɛsanyi ye la, ɔ menle rale rabizale bɛ kɛ, “Duzu ati a bɛlɛsanyi ye a?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Na ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ yele ɔ nloa kɛ, “Awulae ɛhyia ɔ nwo!” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Na bɛ nee afunlumu ralɛ ne rale la, bɛyele bɛ adɛladeɛ ne bie bɛguale ɔ nwo zo, na bɛmaanle Gyisɛse dɛnlanle zolɛ.<verse eid="LUK 19:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36-37" />Akee menli dɔɔnwo ne mɔɔ li ɔ nyunlu la noko vale bɛ ndanlɛ sesɛle aze wɔ adenle ne anu; na mɔɔ bɛtolotolo Boka Ɔlivi ne bɛadwu aze la, menli mɔɔ solo ɛkɛ la amuala bɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛteɛdea nu bɛaye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ wɔ nwanwanendeɛ mɔɔ Gyisɛse ɛyɛ la amuala anwo.<verse eid="LUK 19:36-37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Bɛhanle ye kɛ, “Nyilalɛ ɛha Belemgbunli ne mɔɔ lua Awulae duma nu ɔlɛba la! Anzondwolɛ ɛrɛla anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu, na anyunlunyia ɛha Nana Nyamenle wɔ anwuma anwuma!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Na Falasiima ne bie mɔ mɔɔ ɛnee wɔ menli pemgbelamgbe ne anu la zele kɛ, “Awulae, tua wɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ maa bɛgyakyi mɔɔ bɛlɛkeha la!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Na ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Saa bɛmɛ bɛyɛ ngungoonwu bɔbɔ a, awolɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ wɔ ɛke la badeɛdea nu aye me ayɛlɛ!”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Akee mɔɔ bɛbikyele Gyɛlusalɛm, na ɔnwunle kɛ azua ne mɔ a gua nehane la, ɔ nye monle gyinlegyinlanle. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Ɔzunle na ɔzele kɛ, “Anzondwolɛ mɔɔ ɛmbɔ aze ɛlɛ la bikyele wɔ noko akee wɔannwu ye! Ɔti ɛkpole ye; na kɛkala noko yemɔ yekpa nwolɛ! <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Wɔ kpɔvolɛma babɔ ɛ nwo mgbɔlɛka ayia; <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />na bɛabubu wɔ bane ne bɛagua ye aze, na bɛazɛkye ɛ mra mɔɔ wɔ wɔ nu la amuala kosooti. Wɔ kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ ɛnrɛgyakyi bolɛ ko bɔbɔ wɔ ɔ gɔnwo anwo zo, ɔluakɛ wɔkpo adenle ne mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle bukele maanle wɔ la.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse hɔle asɔne sua kpole ne anu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Akee ɔhɔwolole Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu, na ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔfoa guadivoma ne mɔ yeavi bɛ ninyɛne mɔɔ bɛziezie la anwo. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Na ɔzele kɛ, “Nana Nyamenle Edwɛkɛ ne ka ye wienyi se kɛ, ‘Me Asɔne Sua ne le nzɛlɛlɛ ɛleka. Noko akee bɛmɛ bɛva bɛhakyi nwule feabelɛ.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Ɛhye anzi ye, dahuu biala ɔhilehilele debie wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu, noko akee azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ, nee asɔne mgbanyima ne mɔ, nee menli mgbole mgbole ne mɔ anye bolole adenle mɔɔ bɛpe zo bɛaminli ɔ bo zo la anwo. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Noko bɛangola ɛhwee biala yɛ ɔboalekɛ ɛnee ɔ nwo hyia menli ne kpole kpalɛ, ɔ nwo yɛ ɛzulolɛ, na eza bɛhulole kɛ dahuu bɛkɛde ye edwɛkɛ ne.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Na ɔrale ye kɛ, kenle ko bie mɔɔ ɛnee ɔlɛkilehile menli ne mɔ Nyamedwɛkɛ ne wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu la, azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ nee kɛlɛhɛlɛvolɛma ne mɔ ɔ nee mgbanyima mɔɔ ɛha la rale ɔ nwo zo. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Duzu tumi a ɛlɛ ye, yɛɛ nwane bɔbɔ yɛɛ maanle wɔ zɔhane tumi ne mɔɔ ɔti ɛvale ɛdule guadivolɛma ne mɔ ɛvile Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu a?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Ɔbuale bɛ ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛye me kpuyia ɛhye anloa kolaa na meabua bɛ edwɛkɛ ne anwo bie. <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Asoo Dwɔn tumi ne mɔɔ ɔvale ɔzɔnenle la vi Nana Nyamenle ɛkɛ ne anzɛɛ ɔvi sonla dasanli ɛkɛ ne ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Bɛdwenledwenlenle ɛhye anwo wɔ bɛ nu bɛzele kɛ, “Saa yɛse kɛ ye tumi ne vi anwuma a, yɛbali fɔlɛ, ɔluakɛ ɔbabiza yɛ kɛ, ‘Ɛnee akee duzu ati a bɛanlie ye bɛanli ɛ?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Emomu saa yɛka kɛ bɛanzoa Dwɔn bɛanvi Nana Nyamenle ɛkɛ noko a, menli ne mɔ bayɛ yɛ ayɛkayɛkadeɛ, ɔluakɛ bɛdie bɛdi kɛ amgba Dwɔn le kapezonli.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Ɔti bɛbuale ye sikalɛ bɛzele kɛ, “Yɛnze.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Gyisɛse ɔdaye noko ɔzele kɛ, “Ɛnee medame noko menrɛye bɛ kpuyia ɛdeɛ ne anloa.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Akee Gyisɛse bule ɛrɛlɛ ɛhye hilele bɛ kɛ: “Nrenyia bie zonle nwanye ɛya; ɔvale ɔbɔle ɛyazonlɛma bie mɔ ɛkpa, na akee ɔzile nu ɔhɔle ɛleka bie moamoa ɔhɔhyɛle kpalɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Mɔɔ aleɛbulɛ mekɛ dwule la, ɔzoanle ye menli mɔɔ ɔ nee bɛ yɛ gyima la anu ko wɔ ɛya ne anu kɛ ɔhɔlie ye afoa nu ɛdeɛ wɔ ɛkpavoma ne mɔ ɛkɛ ɔrɛlɛ ye. Ɛkpavoma ne mɔ bolɛ nrenyia ne bɛvoanle ye bɛmaanle ɔvale ɔ sa bulu ɔhɔle sua nu. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Nwanye tola ne amenle eza zoanle sonla fofolɛ wɔ ɛya nu lɔ, na ɔdaye noko ɔnwunle ɔ nyunlu zɔhane ala; bɛbole ye kpalɛ na bɛbɔle ye aholoba na bɛvoanle ye. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Nwanye tolamenle ne zoanle sonla mɔɔ tɔ zo nsa, na bɛyɛle ɔdaye noko zɔhane ala.<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />“Akee tolamenle ne bizale ɔ nwo kɛ, ‘Duzu bieko a menyɛ a? Mebazoa me ra ne mɔɔ me ahonle wɔ ye nu la. Ɔluakɛ yemɔ wɔannea a bɛbaze ye nyiane ekyii na bɛabu ye bie.’<verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />“Mɔɔ ɛkpavoma ne mɔ nwunle nwanye tola ne amenle ara nrenyia ne la, bɛzele kɛ, ‘Yɛ mekɛ kpalɛ a le mekɛ ɛhye! Koliagya ne a ɛlɛba la. Bɛrɛla. Bɛmaa yɛhu ye, na ɛya ne ayɛ yɛ deɛ.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Ɔti amgba noko bɛhwenle ye bɛvile nwanye tola ne anu na bɛhunle ye kpatalakpa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">“Bɛdabɛ bɛnea a, duzu a tolamenle ne te edwɛkɛ ɛhye a ɔbayɛ a? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Mese bɛ nɔhalɛ nu wienyi kɛ, ɔbara yearahu ɛkpavoma ɛhye mɔ noko, na akee yeava nwanye tola ne yeawula menli fofolɛ asa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Menli mɔɔ ɛnee ɛlɛtie ye edwɛkɛ ne bie la zele kɛ, “Bɛnrɛyɛ ɛhye bɔbɔ fee zɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Gyisɛse nleanle bɛ koonwu na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Duzu a ɛhye mɔɔ bɛhɛlɛ ye wɔ Ngɛlɛlera ne anu mɔɔ se kɛ: ‘Bolɛ ne mɔɔ suasivolɛma ne mɔ kpole ye la, yemɔ yɛɛ rayɛle ayia zo bolɛ a’, la abo kile a?” <verse eid="LUK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Eza ɔvale ɔzɔle zo kɛ, “Awie biala mɔɔ kɛfofo Bolɛ zɔhane azo la ɔbabubu; yɛɛ bɛdabɛ noko mɔɔ ɔkɛbubu ɔkɛgua bɛ nwo zo la ɔbadi bɛ motomotoo kɛ nzonle la.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Mɔɔ azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ nee kɛlɛhɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ dele ɛrɛlɛ ɛhye mɔɔ ɔbule bɛ la, bɛhulole kɛ bɛ sa kɛha ye bɛkɛhye ye ndɛndɛ ne ala, ɔluakɛ bɛnwunle kɛ ɛrɛlɛ zɔhane tia bɛ; noko akee bɛzulole kɛ saa bɛkye ye a nzakadolɛ kɛra. Ɔti bɛbɔle mɔdenle biala mɔɔ bɛkɛhola la kɛ bɛmaa yeaha edwɛkɛ bie mɔɔ ɔlua zo a ɛnee bɛkɛdoa ye bɛkɛmaa Wulomu amɛnlado ne la.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Bɛzinzale ye kpalɛ na bɛzoanle nwondomgbɔma bie feabo bɛmaanle bɛvunvuanle ye edwɛkɛ nu. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Menli ɛhye mɔ rale Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ razele ye kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, yɛze kɛ ɛka na eza ɛkilehile nɔhalɛ ne. Eza ɛnze awie biala nyiane nretee zɛ bɔbɔ wɔ mɔɔ menli dwenle la anwo, na dahuu ɛkilehile Nana Nyamenle ndenle ne mɔ wɔ nɔhalɛ nu. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Ka kile yɛ kɛkala. Anzɛɛ ɔfa mɛla nu kɛ yɛkɛdua adwule yɛkɛmaa Siza anzɛɛ Wulomu Arane ne ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Ɔnwunle bɛ adwenle nzuzulɛ ɛtane ne, ɔti ɔzele bɛ kɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Bɛva ezukoa mralɛ ne bie bɛmaa menea. Nwane nvoninli a wɔ zo a? Yɛɛ nwane duma noko a wɔ zo a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Siza, Wulomu amɛnlado ne ɛdeɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Akee ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Saa zɔhane ɛdeɛ a, ɛnee bɛva debie biala mɔɔ le Siza deɛ la bɛmaa Siza, na bɛva debie biala noko mɔɔ le Nana Nyamenle deɛ la bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle!”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Ɛhye ammaa bɛangola bɛando ye agyiba wɔ menli ne mɔ anyunlu; ye nyelebɛnloa ne yɛle bɛ azibɛnwo, ɔti bɛmuanle bɛ nloa kpulu!<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Na Sadusiima anzɛɛ menli mɔɔ ɛnlie Ewudwazo ne ɛnli la bie mɔ <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />rale Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ rabizale ye edwɛkɛ ɛhye kɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:28">“Mosisi mɛla ne mɔ kile kɛ, saa sonla nrenyia mɔɔ ɛnlɛ mralɛ la ka ɛlɛka bie a, ɔwɔ kɛ nrenyia ne adiema nrenyia gya kunlavolɛ raalɛ ne, na bɛ mra ne mɔ bayɛ nrenyia ne mɔɔ ɛwu la amra wɔ mɛla nu. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Mediema mrenyia nsuu bie wale ɛkɛ. Nuhua kpanyinli kpalɛ ne gyale raalɛ, na ɔ nee ye anwo, yɛɛ ɔwule a. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Ɔ diema nrenyia ko gyale kunlavolɛ raalɛ ne, na ɔdaye noko ɔ nee ye anwo yɛɛ ɔwule a. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Ɛhye hɔle zolɛ too kɔkpula kɛ mediema ne mɔ amuala gyale kunlavolɛ raalɛ ne, mɔɔ bɛ nuhua biala nee ye anwo na bɛwule a. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Awieleɛ ne, kunlavolɛ raalɛ ne ɔdaye ɔhale ɛleka bie. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Akee yɛ kpuyia ne ɛne: Bɛ nuhua boni a raalɛ ne bayɛ ɔ ye wɔ ewudwazo kenle ne a? Ɔluakɛ mediema nsuu ne biala gyale ye bie!”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34-35" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ zele kɛ, “Bɛhyehyɛ agyalɛ bɛmaa ewiade amra kosooti, na emomu saa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ ti kɛyɛ boɛ kɛ bɛkɛdwazo bɛ bɛkɛvi ewule nu la dwu Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu a, bɛnrɛgya agyalɛ bieko. <verse eid="LUK 20:34-35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Eza bɛnrɛwu bieko. Saa ɔba ye zɛ a ɛnee ɔkile kɛ bɛle kɛ anwumabɔvolɛma la, na bɛle Nana Nyamenle amra, ɔluakɛ bɛdwazo bɛ wɔ ngoane fofolɛ nu bɛvi ewule nu.<verse eid="LUK 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37-38" />“Bɛ kpuyia ɛdeɛ ne nyelebɛnloa ɛne: Saa ewudwazo wɔ ɛkɛ anzɛɛ ɔnle ɛkɛ o, yemɔ Mosisi ye ngɛlɛlera ne mɔ bɔbɔ di nwolɛ daselɛ. Ɔluakɛ saa Mosisi ka yeahile kɛ Nana Nyamenle zile yele ɔ nwo hilele ye wɔ kpɔkɛ ne mɔɔ zɔle senle la anu la a, ɔfɛlɛ Nana Nyamenle kɛ ‘Ebileham ye Nyamenle ne, Ayezeke ye Nyamenle ne, ɔ nee Gyekɔbo ye Nyamenle ne.’ Saa bɛka kɛ Awulae Nyamenle ne le awie bie ye Nyamenle a, ɛnee ɔkile kɛ ahenle holɛ ko ne de aze, na emomu ɔtɛwule! Ɛhye ati menli kpokpoti de aze wɔ Nana Nyamenle anye zo.<verse eid="LUK 20:37-38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />“Kɛlɛhɛlɛvolɛma ne mɔ bie buale zele kɛ, ‘Wioo, Kilehilevolɛ, wɔdendɛ boɛ bɔkɔɔ.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Ɛhye anzi, bɛanla bɛanga ɛlalɛ kɛ bɛkɛbiza ye edwɛkɛ bieko.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Eza ɔbizale bɛ kpuyia bieko kɛ, “Duzu ati a menli ka ye kɛ Kelaese, Ngoanedievolɛ ne le Belemgbunli Devidi ara a? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42-43" />Ɔluakɛ Devidi mumua ne hɛlɛle ye wɔ Edwɛndolɛ Buluku ne anu kɛ: Nana Nyamenle zele me Awulae, Sonla Ra ne kɛ, ‘Tɛnla me sa fema zo, kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ ɛkɛli konim wɔ wɔ kpɔvolɛma anwo zo la.’  <verse eid="LUK 20:42-43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Na kɛ ɔkɛzi ɔkɛyɛ na Sonla Ra ne ahola ayɛ Devidi ara, na eza yeayɛ Devidi ye Nyamenle wɔ melɛ ko ne ala anu ɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Akee mɔɔ menli dɔɔnwo ne dele ɛhye la, ɔzele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Bɛnlea boɛ wɔ kɛlɛhɛvolɛma ɛhye mɔ anwo, ɔluakɛ bɛkulo adɛladeɛ mgbole mgbole ɛwulalɛ nee bagua nu nganvolɛ, ɔ nee mgbanyinli mbia zo ɛdɛnlanlɛ wɔ ayiasua ne mɔ anu, ɔ nee ɛkponledolɛ bo! <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Wɔ ɛhye mɔ amuala anu bɔbɔ, wɔ bɛ bagua nu nzɛlɛlɛ ndendenle ndendenle ɛyɛlɛ ne mɔ anu, ɛnee eza bɛbɔ mɔdenle kɛ bɛkɛsisi ahunlavolɛ na bɛkɛvoa bɛ bɛkɛvi bɛ aako ne mɔ nu. Ɔlua bɛ zɛhae nyɛleɛ ne mɔ ati, Nana Nyamenle ndɛnebualɛ bedevinli ne ɛlɛkendɛ bɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Melɛ mɔɔ Gyisɛse wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu la, ɔdwazole ɔgyinlanle na ɔyɛle ɔ nye gyɛlɛmgbɛnye ɔnleanle azukoavolɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛlɛfa bɛ ezukoa aragua ahyɛlɛndeɛ anzɛɛ kɔlɛhyɛne nlɛka ne mɔ anu la. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Na kunlavolɛ raalɛ ehyianli bie rale ɛlɛka ne anwo na ɔradole nuhua ezukoa ngapɛlɛ nwiɔ.<verse eid="LUK 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Ɔyɛle ɛhye nzonlɛ na akee ɔzele kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ nu, kunlavolɛ raalɛ ehyianli ɛhye ɛhyɛ ezukoa dɔɔnwo ɛdɛla awie biala. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Ɔluakɛ bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛ ye mɔɔ yebu bɛ nwo zo la anu ekyi bie a bɛvale bɛraguale nu a, noko akee raalɛ ɛhye, mɔɔ ye ehyia tɛla asɔne sua nu kila la, ɛyeye ye ahonle nu ɛva debie biala mɔɔ ɔlɛ ye la ɛrado nu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛha kenlebie edwɛkɛ mɔɔ bazi la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Ye ɛdoavolɛma ne bie mɔ hanle asɔne sua ne anwo edwɛkɛ; kɛ bɛzile bɛvale awolɛ ngɛnlɛma ngɛnlɛma a bɛzile Asɔne Sua Kpole ne, ɔ nee kɛ bɛzile bɛvale ngakyelɛndeɛ bɛzieziele nuhua mbane ne mɔ anwo la.<verse eid="LUK 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />Na Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Mekɛ ne ɛlɛba mɔɔ bɛbabubu ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ bɛnwu bɛ la amuala bɛagua bɛ aze a, na bɛnrɛgyakyi bolɛ ko bɔbɔ mɔɔ la ko anwo zo wɔ nu mɔɔ yemɔ bɛnrɛbubu bɛnrɛgua aze a.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bizale ye kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, kenle nzu a ɛhye mɔ amuala bayɛ zɔ a? Yɛɛ duzu sɛkɛlɛndeɛ a bahile kɛ ɛhye mɔ bayɛ zɔ a?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Ɔbuale bɛ ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛnlea boɛ ammaa awie biala ambɛlɛbɛla bɛ. Ɔluakɛ menli dɔɔnwo ne ala bara wɔ me duma nu araze kɛ, Mame a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne a. ‘Mekɛ ne ɛdwu.’ Noko akee bɛmmadie bɛ bɛdi! <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Yɛɛ saa bɛte kɛ konle konle nee manzonle manzonle ɛbɔ ɔ bo a bɛmmamaa bɛ ahonle tu, ɔluakɛ ɛhye mɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ba, na emomu awieleɛ ne ɛnrɛdoa zo ɛkɛ ne ala. <verse eid="LUK 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Ɔluakɛ maanle badwazo maanle nwo zo; arelemgbunli badwazo arelemgbunli nwo zo, <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />azɛlɛkpusulɛ mgbole mgbole kpalɛ bara, na ɛhɔne nee ewule ngakyile anzɛɛ anwodolɛ ngyebangyeba ara ɛleka ɛleka, na ninyɛne ɛzulolɛ nee sɛkɛlɛndeɛ mgbole bavi anwuma anwuma ara.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />“Kolaa na ɛhye mɔ azi la, bɛbayɛ bɛ ayɛkayɛkadeɛ wɔ zɔhane mekɛ ne anu, bɛbawula bɛ ateetee bɛ nee bɛ ahɔ ayiasua ne mɔ anu ɔ nee efiade, na bɛ nee bɛ ahɔ arelemgbunli nee amɛnladoma anyunlu wɔ me duma nu ti. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Mekɛ mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛfa bɛka Nana Nyamenle edwɛkɛ ne la ɛne. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Ɛhye ati bɛmmadwenle mualɛ mɔɔ bɛbava bɛamaa wɔ ɛzonle ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ bɛbado bɛ la anwo, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />ɔluakɛ mebava edwɛkɛ nɔhalɛ ne meawula bɛ nloa na meamaa bɛ nrɛlɛbɛ mɔɔ bɛ kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ biala ɛnrɛhola ɔ nyunlu gyinla bua bie la. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Bɛdabɛ bɔbɔ mɔɔ bɛbikye bɛ la; awovolɛma, mediema, mbusua, ɔ nee agɔnwolɛma baye bɛ amaa bɛamaa bɛahye bɛ; na eza bɛamaa bɛahu bɛ nuhua bie mɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Menli kpokpoti bakpɔ bɛ wɔ me duma nu ti. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Noko akee bɛ ti enrinli kokye bɔbɔ ɛnrɛminli ɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Ɔluakɛ saa bɛgyinla kpundii a, bɛ sa baha bɛ ngɛla ne mɔ.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Akee saa bɛnwu kɛ ɛlɔne ɛbɔ Gyɛlusalɛm anwo ɛyia a, ɛnee bɛze kɛ ye ɛzɛkyelɛ mekɛ a ɛdwu zo la. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Saa ɔba ye zɔhane a, yemɔ bɛze Dwudiyama bɛmaa bɛnriandi bɛhɔ awoka ne mɔ azo. Bɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm noko la ɛnriandi ɛvi maanle ne anu ɛhɔvea bɛ nwo, yɛɛ bɛdabɛ noko mɔɔ bɛwɔ suakpole ne anzi wɔ maanle gyɛne zo la mmapele kɛ bɛsia bɛahɔ ɛkɛ ne bieko. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Ɔboalekɛ mekɛ zɔhane a bayɛ Nana Nyamenle ndɛnebualɛ kenle ne a, amaa edwɛkɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ tete kapezoma ne mɔ hɛlɛle ye wɔ Ngɛlɛlera ne anu la ali munli bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Na mraalɛ mɔɔ bɛva ɛkolɛ, ɔ nee mrɛladane mɔɔ vievia nlɔma na bɛmaa bɛ nyɛfonlɛ wɔ zɔhane mekɛ ne anu la, bɛ gyakɔ! Ɔluakɛ anwubɛnyunlu kpole kpalɛ bara azɛlɛ ye azo, na munzule bedevinli noko ara maanle ne anu ɛleka biala. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Bɛbawu wɔ nyane nu ala, na bɛava bɛ ngɛkɛlɛ bɛ nee bɛ ahɔ amanvoa wɔ maanle maanle kosooti azo. Maanle Gyɛne nu amra ne mɔ baho ava Gyɛlusalɛm amuala, na bɛatietia bɛ nwo zo kɔkpula kɛ Maanle Gyɛne nu amra ne mɔ bɛ konimlilɛ mekɛ ne kɛra awieleɛ kɛmɔ Nana Nyamenle ɔdaye ye ngyehyɛleɛ ne se la.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Akee sɛkɛlɛndeɛ ɛzulolɛ ɛzulolɛ mɔɔ le kɔkɔbɔlɛ, munzundeɛ nee ninyɛne ɛzulolɛ mɔɔ vi ewia, sɛnzɛne, nee nwɔlɛra ne mɔ anu la vi anwomanyunlu bara; na wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo ɛke bɔbɔ, maanle maanle banwu bɛ nyunlu, na bɛ adwenle bayɛ bɛ tendaanwo wɔ nyevile ne mɔ nee bɛ azɛlɛkye mgbole mgbole ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛlɛbu la anwo. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Ɔlua gyinlabelɛ nwanwane ne mɔɔ bɛbanwu ye kɛ ɔlɛba azɛlɛ ye azo la ati, menli dɔɔnwo ne ala bɛ akɛnrazilɛ babɔ aze ɔluakɛ anwuma bakpusu. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Akee aleɛabo amra banwu kɛ, Sonla Ra ne vi amungu ne anu ɛlɛba wɔ tumi kpole ɔ nee anyunlunyia nu. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Ɛhye ati saa ɛhye mɔ amuala bɔ ɔ bo kɛ ɔsisi a, bɛgyinla kpundii na bɛdo bɛ nye bɛnlea anwuma! Ɔboalekɛ ɛnee ɛkpɔnenlɛ mekɛ ne ɛdwu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Akee ɔbule bɛ ɛrɛlɛ ɛhye kɛ: “Bɛnlea dɔma baka ne, anzɛɛ baka biala. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Saa ye nya ne mɔ kpole gua a, ɛnee bɛze ye wienyi kɛ wawaa mekɛ ɛbikye. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Zɔhane ala noko, yɛɛ saa bɛnwu kɛ ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ meha nwolɛ edwɛkɛ mehile bɛ la bɔ ɔ bo kɛ ɔsisi a, ɛnee bɛnwu ye nɔhalɛ wienyi kɛ Nana Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle ne ɛbikye a.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />“Nɔhalɛ nu, nɔhalɛ nu mese bɛ kɛ, saa ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ ansisi a ewiade ɛlɔnwɔne ɛhye ɛnrera ye awieleɛ ɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Ɔle nɔhalɛ kɛ, Anwuma nee aze bapɛ nu aze ɛdeɛ, noko akee me edwɛkɛ ne ɛnrɛpɛ nu ɛlɛ, bɛbaboa ɛkɛ ne wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34-35" />“Bɛnlea bɛ nwo boɛ! Bɛmmamaa me arɛlevilɛ nu maleɛ ne fa bɛ aze; bɛmmamaa mebato bɛ kɛ asɛɛ ɛhane bie mɔɔ ɛvuandi la, na bɛlɛno nza bɛdielie bɛ nye, na ewiade anu adwenledwenle ɛyi bɛ ti tɛkɛɛ, kɛmɔ ewiade ne mɔɔ ɛha la de la. <verse eid="LUK 21:34-35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Emomu bɛhɔ zo bɛzinza dahuu, na bɛzɛlɛ ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ kɛ saa ɔkɛyɛ boɛ bɔbɔ a, bɛkɛnyia tumi bie na bɛkɛhwe bɛ nwo bɛkɛvi ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ ɛlɛba la anwo, amaa bɛahola bɛagyinla Sonla Ra ne anyunlu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37-38" />Gyisɛse hɔle Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu hɔhilehilele mekɛ biala, na nwonlomɔ mangyee ne ala ɛnee menli dɔɔnwo ɛwie yia kɛ bɛbadie ye, na ye nɔsolɛ biala noko ɔfi ɛkɛ ne ɔkɔtɛnla Boka Ɔlivi azo.<verse eid="LUK 21:37-38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse anwo akpamevalɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Na Dwuuma kpanwo mɔɔ mgbɔvonle ɛnle nu la ɛvoyia ne, ɛvoyia ne mɔɔ eza bɛfɛlɛ ye Akpabɛnwo la dwule zo mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛdi a. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Ɛnee azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ nee kɛlɛhɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ ɛlɛfa Gyisɛse anwo akpame akpondɛ adenle mɔɔ bɛdua zo bɛku ye a, basabasayɛlɛ ɛnrɛra maanle ne anu la.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Na Abɔnsam rawolole Dwudase Yesekaleɔto, mɔɔ le ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee nwiɔ ne anu la ko anu, <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />ɔti ɔhɔle ɔhɔnwunle azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ nee Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu sinzavolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ, na ɔ nee bɛ dwenlenle adenle mɔɔ ɔdua nu a ɔkɛhola ɔkɛye Gyisɛse ɔkɛmaa bɛ la. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Bɛ nye liele kpole kpalɛ, kɛ yeyɛ anwomoalɛ kɛ ɔkɛboa bɛ wɔ adenle ɛhye anu a, ɔti bɛbɔle ye ɛwɔkɛ kɛ bɛkɛdua ye nwolɛ kakɛ mɔɔ ɔsɛ a. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Ɛhye ati ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔkpondɛ mekɛ kpalɛ yeamaa bɛ yeamaa bɛahye Gyisɛse wɔ fealera nu wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ menli dɔɔnwo ɛnle ɛkɛ la.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Akee Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyialilɛ ne kenle ne mɔɔ bɛku akpabɛnwo mboane ne mɔ na bɛfa bɛboka kpanwo mɔɔ mgbɔvonle ɛnle nu la anwo na bɛdi la dwule zolɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Gyisɛse zoanle Pita nee Dwɔn kɛ, “Bɛhɔ bɛhɔziezie ɛleka mɔɔ yɛbali yɛ Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia aleɛ ɛdeɛ ne la na bɛziezie ɛkɛ ne.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Nienwu ɛleka a ɛkulo kɛ yɛkɔsiezie a?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Na ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Saa bɛdwu Gyɛlusalɛm suakpole ne azo a, bɛbanwu nrenyia bie mɔɔ zo nzule buakɛ la wɔ adenle nu. Bɛdoa ye bɛhɔ aako ne mɔɔ ɔbalumua yeawolo nuhua la anu, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />na bɛze aakomenle ne kɛ, ‘Yɛ Kilehilevolɛ ne se, ɛhile yɛ wɔ nyɛvolɛ sua ekpumgbunli ne mɔɔ wɔziezie nu wɔmaa ye mɔɔ ɔ nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ barali bɛ Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia aleɛ ne wɔ nu la.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Ɔ nee bɛ bahɔ esianwu kpole bie mɔɔ bɛziezie ekpumgbunli ko anu la azo, na ɛkɛ ne a bɛdabɛ noko bɛziezie aleɛ ne a.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Bɛhɔle suakpole ne azo na bɛhɔnwunle debie biala kɛmɔ Gyisɛse zele bɛ ala la pɛ, na bɛzieziele Akpabɛnwo aleɛ ne.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amozi Aleɛlilɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Mɔɔ mekɛ ne dwule la, akee Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee nwiɔ ne rale na bɛ muala bɛdɛnlanle ɛkponle ko anwo.<verse eid="LUK 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Akee ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Me nye ɛla dɔnehwele ɛhye ade ɛhye kpalɛ kpalɛ, kɛ me nee bɛ kɛli Akpabɛnwo aleɛ ɛhye kolaa na me amaneɛnwunlɛ ne abɔ ɔ bo. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Na akee mese bɛ nɔhalɛ nu kɛ, menrɛli ye bieko kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ deɛ mɔɔ ɔgyi ɛkɛ ne ɔmaa ye la kɛyɛ zɔ wɔ Nana Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle ne anu la.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Akee ɔvale nwanye tɔmɛlɛ ko. Na mɔɔ ɔyilale zolɛ ɔwiele la, ɔyɛle Nana Nyamenle mo na akee ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛlie ɛhye na bɛhyɛ bɛmaa bɛ nwo. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Ɔluakɛ menrɛnlo nwanye ɛhye bieko kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ye Belemgbunli maanle ne kɛra la.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Eza ɔvale kpanwo dolɔfo ko; na mɔɔ ɔyilale zolɛ ɔwiele na ɔyɛle Nana Nyamenle mo wɔ nwolɛ la, ɔbubule nuhua nzokenzoka na ɔvale ɔmaanle bɛ muala, ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Ɛhye a le me nwonane mɔɔ bɛlɛfa bɛamaa wɔ bɛ ɛtane ti a. Bɛli ɛhye na bɛva bɛhakye me dahuu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Bɛwiele nɔsolɛ aleɛ ne di la, eza ɔvale nwanye tɔmɛlɛ ko na ɔzele kɛ, “Nwanye ɛhye a le me mogya ne mɔɔ bɛbahwi bɛagua wɔ aleɛabo amra bɛ ɛtane ti a, na yemɔ noko a le ngyehyɛlɛ fofolɛ ne mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛyɛ mɔɔ balie bɛ ngoane a. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Bɛnlea kɛ, wɔ ɛkponledolɛ ɛhye abo, ahenle ne mɔɔ baye me amaa la wɔ yɛ avinli kɛ asɛɛ agɔnwolɛ bie la. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Nɔhalɛ nu mese bɛ kɛ, ɔwɔ kɛ Sonla Ra ne wu, ɔluakɛ ɔboka Nana Nyamenle ngyehyɛleɛ ne anwo. Na emomu, mɔɔ ɔlua ɔ nwo zo a bɛbaye ye bɛamaa la, ye gyakɔ!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bizebizale bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko kɛ, “Ɛnee yɛ nuhua ne boni ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Akee bɛzule bɛ nuhua ne mɔɔ banyia dibilɛ kpole kpalɛ ne wɔ Belemgbunli maanle ne mɔɔ bara la anu la anwo kpolera.<verse eid="LUK 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Na Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Aleɛabo arelemgbunli nee menli mgbole mgbole ne mɔ di bɛ ahanra ne mɔ anwo zo, na ahanra ne mɔ noko ɛnlɛ nwolɛ biala ɛhwee ɛnga, kɛ ɛhulolɛ ala a ɔwɔ kɛ bɛkulo a! <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Na emomu wɔ bɛ avinli ɛdeɛ, bɛmaa mɔɔ sonle bɛ kpalɛ la ɛyɛ bɛ nu kpanyinli. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Wɔ ewiade anu; kpanyinli ne a tɛnla ɛkponle nwo na ye sonvolɛma ado ye ɛkponle a. Noko akee tɛ wɔ ɛke ɔ? Ɔluakɛ mame a mele bɛ sonvolɛ a. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Wɔ melɛ ala mɔɔ bɛli nɔhalɛ bɛgyinla me nzi kpundii wɔ me anwubɛnyunlu anzɛɛ amaneɛnwunle mekɛ ɛhye anu, <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />na eza noko ɔluakɛ Egya ɛva Belemgbunli maanle ɛwula me sa la ati, medame noko memaa bɛ adenle kɛkala wɔ ɛke, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />amaa bɛali na bɛanlo wɔ me ɛkponle ne azo wɔ me Belemgbunli maanle ne anu; na bɛadɛnla arelemgbunli mbia zo na bɛabua Yizilayɛ abusua eku eku bulu nee nwiɔ ne mɔ ndɛne.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />“Saemɔn, Saemɔn, Abɔnsam ɛbiza kɛ saa ngyengyɛne nu biala ɔ sa kɛha wɔ ɔkɛkpogya wɔ kɛ awule a, <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />noko akee mezɛlɛ memaa wɔ, amaa ɔlua zo wɔ diedi ande andɔ aze amminli. Ɛhye ati saa akee ɛfu ɛ nwo na ɛsia ɛba me ɛkɛ ne bieko a, nea maa ɛ mediema ne mɔ noko bɛ diedi ne ɛyɛ kpundii.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Saemɔn zele kɛ, “Awulae, meyɛ anwomoalɛ kɛ me nee wɔ bahɔ yɛahɔla efiade, ne eza bɔbɔ me nee wɔ ahɔ ewule nu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Gyisɛse noko zele kɛ, “Pita, meka ye nɔhalɛ nu meahile wɔ kɛ, akɔlɛ kabɔ, ɔvi kɛkala kɔkpula ɛhyema nwonlomɔ la, ɛnee wɔkpo me fane nsa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Akee Gyisɛse bizale bɛ kɛ, “Melɛ mɔɔ menzoanle bɛ kɛ bɛhɔha Edwɛkpa ne, mɔɔ ɛnee ezukoa biala ɛnle bɛ nwo, na bɛnlɛ kodoku anzɛɛ ndanlɛ gyɛne mɔɔ bɛbaheda la, kɛ bɛzile bɛdule adenle ne ɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Debie biala anwo angyia yɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Akee ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Kɛkala, mɔɔ lɛ kodoku anzɛɛ ezukoa la ɛva. Zɔhane ala noko a, mɔɔ ɛnlɛ nrɛlande la, ɔdɔne ye ndanlɛ anzɛɛ adɛladeɛ ɔva ɔdɔ bie a. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Ɔluakɛ mekɛ ne ɛdwu mɔɔ ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ bɛhanle ye me nwo la ɔwɔ kɛ yɛ zɔ a, kɛ: ‘Bɛbabua ye mgbɔvodɛne kɛ kodiawu bie la!’ Ɛhɛe, debie biala mɔɔ ngapezoma ne mɔ hɛlɛle ye wɔ me nwo la bayɛ zɔ bɔkɔɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Bɛzele ye kɛ, “Awulae, yɛlɛ nrɛlande nwiɔ wɔ yɛ nwo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Ɔle kpalɛ!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛhye Gyisɛse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Akee ɔvile ekpumgbunli ne anu wɔ anwuma nehane ɔvindele; ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ doale ye, na ɔhɔle Boka Ɔlivi azo kɛmɔ ɔyɛ ye dɛba la. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Wɔ boka ne azo, ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛzɛlɛ Nana Nyamenle ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ ammaa bɛangɔ ngyegyelɛ nu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41-42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41-42" />Ɔvile bɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne ɔhɔle ɔ nyunlu ekyii na ɔhotole ɔ gyakɛ abonyi zo ɔzɛlɛle kɛ: “Egya, saa ɔyɛ wɔ ɛhulolɛ ɛdeɛ a, medobo wɔ, ɛnee maa dwora ɛhye ɛkpa me ti. Noko akee wɔ ɛhulolɛdeɛ ne a mekpondɛ a, tɛ me ɛhulolɛdeɛ ne ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 22:41-42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Akee anwumabɔvolɛ bie vi anwuma rayele ɔ nwo hilele ye na ɔmaanle ye akɛnrazilɛ, <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />ɔluakɛ ɛnee ɔlɛdi nyane somaa yeahɔ ewule nu; ɔti ɔzɛlɛle ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ ne ala, ɔlua zo ɛhɛlɛnra mɔɔ dule ye la yɛle kɛ mogya kputaa bie mɔɔ ɛlɛsonyi agua aze la. <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Ɔwiele asɔne ne yɛ la, ɔziale ɔrale ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anwo ɛkɛ, na ɔradole bɛ kɛ, ɔlua nyane somaa ti, bɛdeda.<verse eid="LUK 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛdeda ɔ? Bɛdwazo! Bɛzɛlɛ ammaa bɛangɔ ngyegyelɛ nu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Mɔɔ ɔ nloa wɔ zo ɔka ɛhye la, ɛlɔne kpole bie mɔɔ Dwudase, mɔɔ le ye ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee nwiɔ ne anu ko a li bɛ nyunlu la bikyele ye. Dwudase hɔle Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ na ɔvole ɔ nloa anwo kɛ asɛɛ ɔsoma ye wɔ agɔnwolɛyɛlɛ nu la.<verse eid="LUK 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Gyisɛse nwunle ɛhye la ɔzele kɛ, “Dwudase, ɔti ɛkpati wɔava anloanwovolɛ wɔaye Sonla Ra ne wɔamaa ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Mɔɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛha la nwunle mɔɔ ɛlɛba arazi la, bɛzele kɛ, “Awulae, anzɛɛ yɛ nee bɛ ɛho ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Na bɛ nuhua ko bɔle Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne sonvolɛ ne, na ɔpɛle ɔ nzo fema ne.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Bɛmaa ɔha ɛke ala.” Ɔzɔle ɛleka ne mɔɔ sonvolɛ nrenyia ne anzo ne wɔ la na ɔvale ɔbetanle ɛkɛ ne ɔyɛle ye kɛ ye dɛba ne ala la. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Akee Gyisɛse dendɛle bagua nu hilele azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ, nee Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu sinzavolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ, ɔ nee kɛlɛhɛlɛvolɛma ne mɔ mɔɔ lile menli dɔɔnwo ne anyunlu la. Ɔzele kɛ, “Mele kodiawu bie ati a bɛdedɛ nrɛlande nee ahoholombaka bɛra kɛ bɛbahye me la anzɛɛ? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Mengilehilele bɛ wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu, na duzu ati a bɛangye me wɔ ɛkɛ ne a? Tɛ bɛ ɔ, ɔluakɛ melɛ ne mɔɔ Abɔnsam kile ye tumi la ɛdwu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pita ɛkpo kɛ ɔnze Gyisɛse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Akee bɛhyele ye, na bɛ nee ye hɔle Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne sua nu, na Pita lile ɔ nzi wɔ moamoa. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Ɛnee sogyama ne mɔ ɛhua senle wɔ ndɛneleka ne alie ne anwo bɛlɛte, na Pita rabokale bɛ nwo wɔ ɛkɛ ne, ɔluakɛ ɛnee ɛyɛlɛ mekɛ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 22:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Na mɔɔ ɔde senle ne anwo la, sonvolɛ bɛlɛra bie nwunle ye; ɔnleanle ye koonwu na ɔzele kɛ; “Nrenyia ɛhye le Gyisɛse ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu ko!”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Pita zale ɔ ne, ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛlɛra, menze ye hweledede!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Ɔ nzi hyɛle ekyii la, awie bieko noko nwunle ye, na ɔzele kɛ, “Ɛdawɔ noko ɛle bɛ nuhua ko!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Pita buale kɛ, “Yɛmenle, Kyɛkyɛ, memboka bɛ nwo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Kɛyɛ dɔnehwele ko anzi, awie bieko gyinlanle zolɛ ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ hanle kɛ, “Meze ye nɔhalɛ wienyi kɛ sonla ɛhye le Gyisɛse ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu ko, ɔluakɛ bɛ mu nwiɔ bɛvi Galeli.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Na Pita zele kɛ, “Ayi, menze mɔɔ ɛlɛka nwolɛ edwɛkɛ la hweledede.” Na mɔɔ ɔ nloa wɔ zo bɔbɔ mɔɔ ɔka ɛhye ala la, yɛɛ akɔlɛ bɔle a.<verse eid="LUK 22:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Mekɛ zɔhane anu, Gyisɛse hakyile ɔ nwo na ɔnleanle Pita. Akee Pita hakyele Awulae edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔhanle kɛ, “Kolaa mɔɔ akɔlɛ abɔ nwonlomɔ la, ɛnee wɔkpo me fane nsa” la. <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Pita vindele hɔle alie nwo, na ɔhɔzunle ɔmaanle ɔyɛle alɔbɔlɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63-64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63-64" />Sinzavolɛma ne mɔ mɔɔ lɛ Gyisɛse anu la bɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛsi ye amgbu. Bɛkyekyele ɔ nye amu nwiɔ na bɛbobɔle ye abotokuma; akee bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Kapezonli, nwane a bɔle wɔ a?” <verse eid="LUK 22:63-64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Bɛbɔle ye aholoba na bɛhanle edwɛkɛ avunli dɔɔnwo ne ala bɛtiale ye.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Aleɛ hyenle na ye nwonlomɔ ne, Dwuuma Kɔɔto Kpole Kpale ne, mɔɔ azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ, nee maanle mgbanyima ne mɔ boka kɛlɛhɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ wɔ nu la yiale. Bɛ nee Gyisɛse hɔle edwɛkɛlilɛ, <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67-68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67-68" />na bɛzele ye kɛ, “Saa wɔmɔ a ɛle Kelaese ne a ɛnee ka kile yɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67-68">Ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Saa meka mekile bɛ a, bɛnrɛlie me bɛnrɛli, anzɛɛ bɛnrɛmaa me adenle bɛnrɛmaa menrɛva me edwɛkɛ menrɛdo gua. <verse eid="LUK 22:67-68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Na ɔnrɛhyɛ biala, melɛ ne ɛlɛba, mɔɔ bɛbazoa Anyunlunyia Sonla ne belemgbunli a, na yeadɛnla Nyamenle Bedevinli ne asa fema zo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Bɛ muala bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛzele ye kɛ, “Ɔti ɛkpondɛ wɔaze yɛ kɛ, wɔmɔ a ɛle Nyamenle Ra ne anzɛɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Ɛhɛe! Bɛdabɛ mumua ne bɛha.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Bɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Yɛngyia alasevolɛ bieko anwo. Ɔluakɛ yɛdayɛ mumua ne yɛde yɛvi ɔ nloa anu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛli Gyisɛse edwɛkɛ na bɛbua ye mgbɔvodɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Akee Mɛla Ekuma ne amuala dwazole, na bɛvale Gyisɛse bɛhɔmaanle Paelɛte, mɔɔ le Amɛnlado ne. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Bɛbɔle ɔ bo bɛdoɔdoanle ye bɛzele kɛ, “Nrenyia ɛhye li menli ne mɔ anyunlu bɛlɛsɛkye maanle ne; yeze bɛ kɛ bɛmmatua adwule biala bɛmaa Wulomu Arane ne, eza ɔse ɔle Ngoanedievolɛ, anzɛɛ Kelaese, Belemgbunli ne.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Yemɔti Paelɛte bizale ye kɛ, “Anzɛɛ wɔmɔ a ɛle Dwuuma ne bɛ Belemgbunli ne ɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Gyisɛse buale ye zele kɛ, “Ɛhɛe, ɛdawɔ wɔha.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Paelɛte hakyile ɔ nye nleanle azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ ɔ nee menli dodo ne na ɔzele kɛ, “Mennwu ɛtane biala wɔ ɔ nwo.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Akee ɛya hunle bɛ somaa ne ala maanle bɛzele kɛ, “Ɔvi Galeli mɔɔ kɔ Gyɛlusalɛm, ɔ nee Dwudiya amuala, ɛleka biala mɔɔ ɔkɛhɔ la ɔfa ye ngilehile ne ɔtendɛ ɔtia, na ɔkpudwu maanle ne anu Arane ne.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Paelɛte bizale kɛ, “Ɛnee ɛhye kile kɛ ɔle Galelinli ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Mɔɔ bɛzele ye kɛ, “ɛhɛe” la, Paelɛte zoanle ye wɔ Hɛlɔdo anwo lɔ ɔluakɛ ɛnee Galeli wɔ Hɛlɔdo maamulɛ bo; yɛɛ mekɛ zɔhane anu noko, ɛnee Hɛlɔdo ɔdaye mumua ne ɔwɔ Gyɛlusalɛm. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Hɛlɔdo lile fɛlɛko kɛ yenwu Gyisɛse mekɛ ɛhye anu a, ɔluakɛ ɛnee yede ye nganeɛ dɛbadɛba; na eza ɔ nye la kɛ ɔkɛnwu ye kɛ ɔlɛyɛ nwanwanedeɛ.<verse eid="LUK 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Ɔbizebizale Gyisɛse kpuyia dɔɔnwo ne ala, noko akee yemɔ yeambua nwolɛ bie. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Mekɛ ɛhye anu bɔbɔ, azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ ɔ nee kɛlɛhɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima mɔɔ ɛha la gyinlanle ɛkɛ ne deɛdeanle nu doanle ye fane dɔɔnwo ne ala.<verse eid="LUK 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Akee Hɛlɔdo nee ye azogya ne mɔ bɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛbɔ Gyisɛse aholoba na eza bɛsi ye amgbu; bɛvale arelemgbunli ɛsaso adɛladeɛ bɛwulale ye, na akee bɛvale ye bɛhɔmaanle Paelɛte bieko. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Kenle ko zɔhane, Hɛlɔdo nee Paelɛte, mɔɔ ɛnee le akpɔvolɛ, ɔlua manzonle bie mɔɔ la bɛ avinli la ati la, yɛle agɔnwolɛ ɛkɛ ne ala.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Paelɛte vɛlɛle azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ, ɔ nee Dwuuma maanle mgbanyima, boka menli ne kpokpoti maanle bɛboale bɛ nloa, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />na ɔvale ye ɛdeɛ mɔɔ ɔze la ɔdole bɛ nyunlu kɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:14">“Bɛdonle nrenyia ɛhye ɛzonle na bɛ nee ye rɛlɛle me kɛ ɔlɛdi menli nyunlu yeamaa bɛaho bɛatia Wulomu Arane ne. Menleɛnlea edwɛkɛ ɛhye anu kpalɛ na meannwu fɔlɛlilɛ biala wɔ ɔ nwo, <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Kɛ Hɛlɔdo ɔdaye noko ye adwenle yɛle la ɛne, ɔti ɔmaanle bɛ nee ye ziale rɛlɛle yɛ, kɛ debie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ mɔɔ nrenyia ɛhye ɛyɛ mɔɔ yemɔti ɔfɛta ewule a. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Ɛhye ati mebamaa bɛabo ye, bɛabila ye empele ala na akee meagyakyi ye.”<verse eid="LUK 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17-18" />Na menli ɛwolaa ne vale ɛnelɛ bedevinli bie deanle nu zele kɛ, “Ku ye, na ye Balabase maa yɛ!” <verse eid="LUK 23:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Ɛnee Balabase la efiade wɔ nzaka bie mɔɔ ɔdole ye wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm ɔtiale Wulomu Arane ne boka sonlahunlɛ nwo la ati. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Paelɛte nee bɛ zule nwolɛ kpolera, ɔluakɛ ɔhulole kɛ ɔkɛgyakyi Gyisɛse. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Noko akee menli ne mɔ deɛdeanle nu zele kɛ, “Bɔ ye meanubaka nu! Bɔ ye meanubaka nu!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Ɔbizale bɛ mɔɔ tɔ zo fane nsa ne la kɛ, “Duzu ati ɔ? Duzu munzule a yebɔ a? Mennwu ɛtane biala wɔ ɔ nwo mɔɔ ɔlua zo ɔwɔ kɛ mebua ye ewule fɔlɛ a. Ɔti mebabo ye meabila ye empele ala na meagyakyi ye meamaa yeahɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Noko akee bɛdeɛdeanle nu mgbole mgbole ne ala kɛ Gyisɛse ye ewule ala a bɛkpondɛ a, na bɛ ne ne mɔ noko hɔle anwuma kpalɛ kpalɛ.<verse eid="LUK 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Ɔti Paelɛte buale Gyisɛse fɔlɛ kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ ɔwu kɛmɔ menli ne mɔ kpondɛ la, <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />na ɔyele Balabase, mɔɔ ɛnee la efiade ɔlua nzakadolɛ nee sonlahunlɛ ti la ɔmaanle bɛ wɔ bɛdabɛ bɛ nloa edwɛkɛ ti. Na Gyisɛse, yemɔ ɔyele ye ɔmaanle bɛ kɛ bɛdabɛ bɛ nee yɛ ɛhɔ na bɛhɔyɛ ye debie biala mɔɔ bɛkulo la.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Mekɛ mɔɔ bɛ nee Gyisɛse kɔ la, bɛ nee Saemɔn mɔɔ vi Saelin, mɔɔ ɛnee vi ɛbɔ nu ɛlɛsia ara Gyɛlusalɛm la yiale; ɔti bɛhyele ye kɛ ɔzoa Gyisɛse ye meanubaka ne ɔli bɛ nzi. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Na maanle ne anu menli dodo ne ala, ɔ nee mraalɛ mɔɔ ɛlɛsu ye awolɛ la doale ye.<verse eid="LUK 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Gyisɛse hakyile ɔ nye nleanle bɛ na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Gyɛlusalɛm mraalɛ, bɛmmasu bɛmaa me, na emomu bɛzu bɛmaa bɛ nwo nee bɛ mra. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Ɔluakɛ melɛ ɛlɛba mɔɔ bɛbaze kɛ, ‘Nyilalɛ ɛha mraalɛ mɔɔ ɛnwo la, nee ɛkolɛ mɔɔ ralɛ ɛtɛtɔle nu ɛlɛ la, ɔ nee nyɛfonlɛ ne mɔɔ adɔma ɛtɛnonle ye ɛlɛ la.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Akee bɛbabodo bɛaze awoka ne mɔ kɛ, ‘Bɛdudu bɛgua yɛ nwo zo’, ɔ nee awoka ngyikyi ne mɔ noko kɛ, ‘Bɛheda yɛ nwo zo.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Ɔboalekɛ saa bɛlɛyɛ ɛhye wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ baka ne le amolɛ la a, ɛnee saa ɔyɛ welera a duzu a, bɛkɛyɛ a?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛbɔ Gyisɛse meanubaka nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32-33" />Bɛ nee nwule nwiɔ bie noko hɔle kɛ bɛkahu bɛ bɛaboka ɔ nwo wɔ ɛleka bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye “Etile Kanrɛlɛ” la. Ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ bɛbɔle bɛmɛ nsa ne meanumbaka nu a; Gyisɛse wɔ avinli meanubaka ne azo, yɛɛ nwule nwiɔ ne mɔ wɔ ye bɛne zo nee ye fema zo.<verse eid="LUK 23:32-33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Akee Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Egya, fakyɛ bɛ, ɔluakɛ bɛnze mɔɔ bɛlɛyɛ la.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Sogyama ne mɔ hwenle ye tɛladeɛ ne anwo adunyi kɛ saa ɔkɛyɛ nwane deɛ a. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Menli dɔɔnwo ne gyinlanle ɛkɛ ne nleanle, yɛɛ Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ noko zelele ye na bɛzile ye amgbu bɛzele kɛ, “Ɔdie awie mɔ ngoane, noko akee ɔngola ɔnlie ɔ nwo; bɛmaa yɛnlea kɛ ɔkɛhola ɔkɛlie ɔ nwo kɛ amgba yemɔ a le Kelaese Nana Nyamenle Ra ne a!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Sogyama ne mɔ noko zile ye amgbu zɔhane ala, na bɛvale nwanye ɛnwonle kasokaso bie bɛmaanle ye kɛ ɔnlo. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Akee bɛzele ye kɛ, “Saa amgba ala wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle Dwuuma Belemgbunli ne a, ɛnee die ɛ nwo!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Na bɛvale taboa sinli bie mɔɔ ngɛlɛlera ɛhye: <char style="sc">“Dwuuma ne Belemgbunli ne ɛne”</char> wɔ zo la bɛbɔle ɔ ti sɔlɔ.<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Nwule nwiɔ ne mɔɔ bɛbɔle bɛ meanumbaka nu bɛbokale ɔ nwo la anu ko zile ye amgbu zele kɛ, “Na tɛ wɔmɔ a ɛle Ngoanedievolɛ ne ɔ? Die ɛ nwo nee yɛdayɛ noko ɛ!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40-41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40-41" />Awule ɛhendeɛ ne zele ɔ gɔnwo ne kɛ, “Yemɔti ɛnzulo Nyamenle bɔbɔ kɛ ɛdawɔ noko bɛbua wɔ ewule fɔlɛ ɔ? Yɛmɛ yɛ sa ɛha yɛ ahatualɛ mɔɔ fɛta yɛ ninyɛmunli ne a, na nrenyia ɛhye yemɔ ɔtɛyɛle ɛtane biala.” <verse eid="LUK 23:40-41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Akee ɔzele kɛ, “Gyisɛse, saa ɛkɔ wɔ Belemgbunli maanle ne anu a, anrɛɛ mmamaa ɛ rɛle fi me.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Gyisɛse noko buale ye zele kɛ, “Mese wɔ nɔhalɛ nu kɛ, ɛnɛ demua ye me nee wɔ bahɔ Paladaese.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Mekɛ ɛhye anu ɛnee bɛbɔ kɛyɛ ewiazo bulu nee nwiɔ, na awozinli kabii hedale aleɛabo kosooti dedee dɔnehwele nsa. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Ewia ne kɛnlaneɛ ne hɔle awozinli nu, na arɛlevilɛ nu ala, ɛdanlɛ ne mɔɔ bɛva bɛpɛ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu la suanle kɛlɛdɛdɛ nwiɔ vi ɔ ti rapenle ye aze.<verse eid="LUK 23:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Gyisɛse vale ɛnelɛ kpole bie deanle nu zele kɛ, “Egya, mefa me sunsum mewula ɛ sa nu.” Ɔhanle ɛhye ɔwiele ala la, akee ɔbɔle ɔ ti aze na ɔwule.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Mɔɔ Wulomu sogya kpanyinli ne mɔɔ nleanle maanle menlihunlɛ ne hɔle zolɛ la nwunle mɔɔ ɛzi la, ɔ nwo nyianle ye kpole kpalɛ; ɔti ɔzele kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ, nrenyia ɛhye le tenlenenli amgba.”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Akee mɔɔ menli dodo ne mɔɔ rale ranleanle meanubaka nu ɛbɔlɛ ne bie la nwunle kɛ Gyisɛse ɛwu la, bɛvale alɔbɔlɛ nee nyane kpole kpalɛ bɛhɔle bɛ azua nu. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Mɔɔ ɛhye mɔ ɛlɛkɔ zo la, Gyisɛse agɔnwo mɔ nee ye kulovolɛma kpokpoti ɔ nee mraalɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛlile ɔ nzi bɛvile Galeli la, amuala gyinlanle moamoa nehane nleanle mɔɔ ɛlɛkɔ zolɛ la.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-52" />Na nrenyia bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Dwosefi, mɔɔ vi Arelematia, mɔɔ boka Kɔɔto Kpole ne anwo la, hɔle Paelɛte ɛkɛ hɔzɛlɛle Gyisɛse ye funli ne. Nrenyia ɛhye sulo Nyamenle, mɔɔ ɛnee ɔ nye la Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle ne ade, na ɔlua ɛhye ati ɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ anyɛ adwenle wɔ bɛ adwenlenzuzulɛ nee bɛ nyɛleɛ nwo a. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Ɔti ɔyele Gyisɛse funli ne ɔvile meanubaka ne azo, na ɔvale selekye ɛdanlɛ tendenle bie ɔkyekyele funli ne; akee ɔhɔziele ye wɔ sɛka fofolɛ bie mɔɔ bɛpɛ ye wɔ bolɛ nu wɔ boka ekyi bie foa ko la anu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Bɛyɛle ɛhye wɔ Yalɛ ewiazo mɔɔ ɛnee maanle nu ɛlɛba aramua, kenle ne mɔɔ bɛyɛ anwoziezielɛ bɛkendɛ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne la.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Melɛ mɔɔ bɛ nee funli ne kɔ la, mraalɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛ nee ye vile Galeli rale la lile ɔ nzi ranleanle sɛka ne, ɔ nee ɛleka mɔɔ bɛbava ye bɛado la. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Akee bɛhɔle sua nu na bɛhɔzieziele alufuanlɛ nee nwole evuanlɛ evuanlɛ mɔɔ bɛbava bɛakpokpa ye la; mɔɔ bɛkawie ɛhye yɛ la ɛnee Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne asɛɛ ɛdwu, ɔti bɛliele bɛ ɛnwomenle kenle ko zɔhane amuala kɛmɔ Dwuuma ne mɛla ne se la.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">“Yezia yera ngoane nu bieko!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Na kenle ne mɔɔ lumua wɔ dapɛne ne anyunlu nwonlomɔ mangyee ne, bɛhɔle sɛka ne azo; <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />bɛnwunle kɛ bɛhundo bolɛ totohyia ne mɔɔ bɛvale bɛnyinle sɛka ne anloa la bɛdo ye ahanle. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Bɛhɔle sɛka ne anu, na emomu bɛannwu Awulae Gyisɛse ye funli ne.<verse eid="LUK 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Ɛhye zinle bɛ nwo, ɔti ɔmaanle bɛ adwenle noko yɛle bɛ sesakaa, na arɛlevilɛ nu ala, mrenyia nwiɔ mɔɔ wulowula adɛladeɛ fufule nwohyenwohyee na bɛlɛta kɛ sɛnzɛne la ragyinlanle bɛ nwo ɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Ɛzulolɛ kpole hanle mraalɛ ne mɔ maanle bɛbutubutule bɛ nye aze.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:5">Akee mrenyia nwiɔ ne mɔ bizale bɛ kɛ, “Duzu ati a bɛlɛkpondɛ sonla mɔɔ de aze la bɛavi mɔwuamra anu a? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6-7" />Ɔnle ɛke. Yedwazo yera ngoane nu bieko! Bɛngakye mɔɔ ɔhanle ɔhilele bɛ wɔ Galeli, kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛye Sonla Ra ne bɛwula ɛtanevolɛma asa anu, na bɛbɔ ye meanubaka nu, na ye kenle nsa ne azo ɔbadwazo bieko la ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 24:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Bɛhakyele ye edwɛkɛ ne, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />ɔti bɛvi sɛka ne azo bɛziale bɛhɔle Gyɛlusalɛm ndɛndɛ zo bɛhɔbɔle ye ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee ko ne, ɔ nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ ɛha la amuala amaneɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Mraalɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ hɔle sɛka ne azo la a le Male mɔɔ vi Magedala la, Dwowana, ɔ nee Gyemise ɔ nli, Male nee dɔɔnwo ne ala mɔɔ ɛha la. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Edwɛkɛ ne yɛle mrenyia ne mɔ kɛ asɛɛ nwɔra bie la, bɛanlie bɛanli ɛlɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Pita, yemɔ ɔnriandinle ɔhɔle sɛka ne azo kɛ ɔkanlea ye ɔ nye zo. Ɔbutule ɔnleanle nu, na ɔnwunle ndanlɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛvale bɛkyekyele ɔ nwo la angome. Ɔziale ɔhɔle ye sua nu, na ɔdwenlenle nwanwanedeɛ ɛhye mɔɔ ɛzi la anwo.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Kenle ko demua ne ala, Gyisɛse ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu nwiɔ zile nu kɛ bɛkɔ Ɛmeeyɛse, namule bie mɔɔ nee Gyɛlusalɛm avinli le kɛyɛ mayɛlɛ nsuu la azo. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Ɛnee bɛlɛdi Gyisɛse ye ewule ne ɔ nee ninyɛne mɔɔ ɛsisi ɔ nzi la anwo adwelie; <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />na arɛlevilɛ nu ala, Gyisɛse mumua ne vindele bɛ nwo ɛkɛ, ɔbikyele bɛ na ɔ nee bɛ muala luale nwolɛ hɔle. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Ɔlua Nyamenle ye ngyehyɛleɛ ti, bɛannwu ye sonla holɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Duzu edwɛkɛ a ɛzi, mɔɔ ɔti bɛlɛdi nwolɛ adwelie zɛhae a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Bɛgyinlanle bɛyɛle ngungoonwu, na ɛnee bɛ rɛle ɛbɔ somaa ne ala. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Bɛ nuhua ko, mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Kiliopase la buale kɛ, “Ɛdawɔ ɛ ngomekye a ɛle ɛyɛvolɛ wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm, mɔɔ yemɔti ɛtɛtele edwɛkɛ nwanwane ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛzi dapɛne ne mɔɔ ɛze ɛhɔ la anu ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Gyisɛse bizale bɛ kɛ, “Duzu edwɛkɛ ɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Bɛzele ye kɛ, “Ninyɛne ne mɔ mɔɔ zile Gyisɛse, Nazalɛtenli kapezonli kpole ne anwo zo la. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Noko akee azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ ɔ nee yɛ maanle mgbanyima yele ye maanle Wulomu Arane ne maanle bɛbuale ye mgbɔvodɛne, bɛbɔle ye meanubaka nu bɛhunle ye. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Na yɛmɛ ɛnee yɛlɛ anyelazo kɛ yemɔ yɛɛ a le anyunlunyia Sonla Ra ne mɔɔ barakpɔne Yizilayɛ a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:21">“Na wɔ ɛhye mɔ amuala anzi, mɔɔ zile ɛnɛ kenle nsa la, <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22-23" />mraalɛ bie mɔɔ wɔ yɛ ɛdoavolɛma eku ne anu la hɔle ye sɛka ne azo nwonlomɔ ye, na bɛrabɔle amaneɛ ɛzulolɛ bie kɛ, ye funli ne ɛminli; na eza noko bɛnwunle anwumabɔvolɛma bie wɔ ɛkɛ mɔɔ bɛzele bɛ kɛ Gyisɛse ɛdwazo a! <verse eid="LUK 24:22-23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Yɛ mraalɛ mɔɔ yɛ nee bɛ wɔ ɛke la bie mɔ hɔle hɔnleanle, na bɛnwunle ye nɔhalɛ nu kɛ Gyisɛse ye funli ne ɛnle ɛkɛ kɛmɔ mraalɛ ne mɔ hanle ala la pɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Gyisɛse ɔdaye mumua ne ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Ao, menli ahoasea mɔɔ le kɛ bɛmɛ, mɔɔ bɛ ahonle ne mɔ ɛtili, mɔɔ bɛnlie debie biala mɔɔ ngapezoma ne mɔ ɛha la bɛnli a! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Anzɛɛ ngapezoma ne annwu ye anga ye dɛbadɛba kɛ Kelaese banwu anwubɛnyunlu ɛhye mɔ kosooti kolaa na yeahɔ ye anyunlunyia nu ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Akee Gyisɛse bɔle ɔ bo vi Mosisi ɔ nee ngapezonɔa ne mɔ amuala anwo zo hilehilele bɛ debie biala mɔɔ wɔ Ngɛlɛlera ne anu mɔɔ fale ɔ nwo la abo.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Mekɛ ɛhye anu ɛnee akee bɛlɛbikye Ɛmeeyɛse wɔ adendulɛ ne awieleɛ. Gyisɛse yɛle ye adwenle kɛ ɔkɔ ɔ nyunlu bieko, <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />na kɛmɔ ɛnee maanle nu ɛlɛba aramua la ati, bɛbodole ye kɛ, “Maa yɛla, aleɛ ɛdwo.” Ɔti ɔdaye noko ɔkponlenle zolɛ ɔ nee bɛ makyile hɔle sua nu. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Mɔɔ bɛdi aleɛ la, ɔvale kpanwo ɔyilale zolɛ na ɔbubule nuhua ngyikyi ngyikyi ɔmaanle bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Arɛlevilɛ nu ala, bɛ nye zo tetele bɛ wienyi na akee bɛnwunle ye kɛ ɔdaye mumua ne ɔ, na ɔminlinle bɛ nye zo minlimɛnla.<verse eid="LUK 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Bɛzele bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko kɛ, “Ɛhye ati a mekɛ mɔɔ yɛ nee ye lua adenle nu la ɔhilehilele yɛ ngɛlɛlera ne anu ɔmaanle yɛdele ɔ bo na yɛ nye liele ɔ nwo la.” <verse eid="LUK 24:32" /><verse number="33-34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33-34" />Na dɔnehwele ko ne ala anu; bɛziale bɛrale Gyɛlusalɛm, bɛradole kɛ Bulu Nee Ko ne nee ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔɔ boka bɛ nwo la ɛhuohua bɛ nloa wɔ ɛleka ko ɛlɛkeha wɔ bɛ nu kɛ, “Awulae ɛdwazo amgba, na yeye ɔ nwo yehile Pita!”<verse eid="LUK 24:33-34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Akee mrenyia nwiɔ ne mɔ mɔɔ vi Ɛmeeyɛse la hanle bɛ nloa anu edwɛkɛ, kɛ Gyisɛse zile yele ɔ nwo hilele bɛ wɔ adenle nu, ɔ nee kɛ bɛzile bɛholale bɛnwunle ye wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔbubule kpanwo ne anu la. <verse eid="LUK 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Mɔɔ bɛ nloa wɔ zo bɔbɔ bɛdi ɛhye anwo adwelie la, Gyisɛse mumua ne ragyinlanle bɛ avinli arɛlevilɛ nu ala na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Anzondwolɛ ɛha bɛ!” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Ɛzulolɛ hanle bɛ maanle bɛbɔle mgbatike, na bɛdwenlenle kɛ bɛnwu nwomenle bie.<verse eid="LUK 24:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Duzu ati a bɛ ahonle ɛdu zɛhae a? Duzu ati a bɛnlie bɛnli kɛ medame a? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Bɛnlea me sa nu nee me gyakɛ! Bɛbahola bɛanwu ye kɛ medame mumua ne ɛne. Bɛva bɛ sa bɛha me na bɛnwu ye kɛ menle nwomenle. Ɔluakɛ nwomenle ɛnlɛ nwonane kɛmɔ mame melɛ ye la!” <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Mɔɔ ɔhanle ɛhye ɔwiele la, ɔvale ɔ sa akunlu nee ɔ gyakɛ ɔhilele bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Ɔlua fɛlɛkolilɛ somaa ti, bɛanlie bɛanli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:41">Akee ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛlɛ aleɛ wɔ ɛke ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Bɛmaanle ye fɛlɛ ngyehye ekyi ko, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />na ɔlile ye wɔ bɛ nyunlu ɛkɛ ne ala.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Ɔwiele la ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛngakye kɛ mekɛ mɔɔ me nee bɛ de la, menganle mengilele bɛ kɛ debie biala mɔɔ Mosisi nee ngapezoma ne mɔ hɛlɛle wɔ Ngɛlɛlera ne anu mɔɔ fale me nwo la ɔwɔ kɛ di munli ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Akee ɔbukele bɛ adwenle nu amaa bɛade Ngɛlɛlera ne abo kofee. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ, bɛhɛlɛ ye dɛbadɛba kɛ Sonla Ra ne banwu amaneɛ, bɛbahu ye bɛazie ye na yeadwazo ye kenle nsa ne azo; <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />na ɔwɔ kɛ bɛfa ɛkpɔnenlɛ nwo nolobɔlɛ ɛhye bɛfi Gyɛlusalɛm bɛkɔmaa maanle maanle kosooti: Ɛtanefakyɛ wɔ ɛkɛ maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfu bɛ nwo na bɛtoa me bo zo la. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Bɛdabɛ bɛdi kapezo edwɛkɛ ɛhye mɔ amuala anwo daselɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />“Bɛnlea, akee mebazoa Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne wɔ bɛ nwo, kɛmɔ Egya bɔle bɛ ɛwɔkɛ la. Bɛmmabɔ ye nolo bɛkile awie biala kɛkala, bɛdɛnla sua ye azo ɛke kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne vi anwuma maanle nu kɛra kɛrayi bɛ tɛkɛɛ na ɔkɛmaa bɛ anwosesebɛ la.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Gyisɛse nee bɛ vindele hɔle Bɛtani kandiba, na ɔmaanle ɔ sa zo ɔyilale bɛ, <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />na ɔrale ye kɛ, mɔɔ ɔyila bɛ la, ɔ nee bɛ lile mgbakyelɛ nu, na akee bɛvale ye bɛhɔle anwuma maanle ne anu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Bɛmɛ bɛhotole bɛyeyɛle ye, na bɛvale fɛlɛkolilɛ kpole bɛziale bɛrale Gyɛlusalɛm, <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />na bɛdɛnlanle Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu dahuu bɛyele Nyamenle ayɛlɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>